      "statSections": [
        {
          "name": "Traits",
          "rulesText": "Amphibious. The dragon can breathe air and water.\n\nLegendary Resistance (4/Day, or 5/Day in Lair). If the dragon fails a saving throw, it can choose to succeed instead.",
          "sourceLocator": {
            "chapter": "Monsters A-Z",
            "section": "12.29",
            "heading": "Traits",
            "lineStart": 18837,
            "lineEnd": 18841
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Actions",
          "rulesText": "Multiattack. The dragon makes three Rend attacks. It can replace one attack with a use of Spellcasting to cast Acid Arrow (level 4 version).\n\nRend. Melee Attack Roll: +15, reach 15 ft. Hit: 17 (2d8 + 8) Slashing damage plus 9 (2d8) Acid damage.\n\nAcid Breath (Recharge 5–6). Dexterity Saving Throw: DC 22, each creature in a 90-foot-long, 10-foot-wide Line. Failure: 67 (15d8) Acid damage. Success: Half damage.\n\nSpellcasting. The dragon casts one of the following spells, requiring no Material components and using Charisma as the spellcasting ability (spell save DC 21, +13 to hit with spell attacks):\n\nAt Will: Acid Arrow (level 4 version), Detect Magic, Fear\n\n1/Day Each: Create Undead, Speak with Dead, Vitriolic Sphere (level 5 version)",
          "sourceLocator": {
            "chapter": "Monsters A-Z",
            "section": "12.29",
            "heading": "Actions",
            "lineStart": 18843,
            "lineEnd": 18855
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Legendary Actions",
          "rulesText": "Legendary Action Uses: 3 (4 in Lair). Immediately after another creature's turn, the dragon can expend a use to take one of the following actions. The dragon regains all expended uses at the start of each of its turns.\n\nCloud of Insects. Dexterity Saving Throw: DC 21, one creature the dragon can see within 120 feet. Failure: 33 (6d10) Poison damage, and the target has Disadvantage on saving throws to maintain Concentration until the end of its next turn. Failure or Success: The dragon can't take this action again until the start of its next turn.\n\nFrightful Presence. The dragon uses Spellcasting to cast Fear. The dragon can't take this action again until the start of its next turn.\n\nPounce. The dragon moves up to half its Speed, and it makes one Rend attack.",
          "sourceLocator": {
            "chapter": "Monsters A-Z",
            "section": "12.29",
            "heading": "Legendary Actions",
            "lineStart": 18857,
            "lineEnd": 18865
          }
        }
      ],
      "rulesText": "Gargantuan Dragon (Chromatic), Chaotic Evil\n\nAC 22\nInitiative +16 (26)\nHP 367 (21d20 + 147)\nSpeed 40 ft., Fly 80 ft., Swim 40 ft.\n\nSkills Perception +16, Stealth +9\nImmunities Acid\nSenses Blindsight 60 ft., Darkvision 120 ft.; Passive Perception 26\nLanguages Common, Draconic\nCR 21 (XP 33,000, or 41,000 in lair; PB +7)\n\nTraits\n\nAmphibious. The dragon can breathe air and water.\n\nLegendary Resistance (4/Day, or 5/Day in Lair). If the dragon fails a saving throw, it can choose to succeed instead.\n\nActions\n\nMultiattack. The dragon makes three Rend attacks. It can replace one attack with a use of Spellcasting to cast Acid Arrow (level 4 version).\n\nRend. Melee Attack Roll: +15, reach 15 ft. Hit: 17 (2d8 + 8) Slashing damage plus 9 (2d8) Acid damage.\n\nAcid Breath (Recharge 5–6). Dexterity Saving Throw: DC 22, each creature in a 90-foot-long, 10-foot-wide Line. Failure: 67 (15d8) Acid damage. Success: Half damage.\n\nSpellcasting. The dragon casts one of the following spells, requiring no Material components and using Charisma as the spellcasting ability (spell save DC 21, +13 to hit with spell attacks):\n\nAt Will: Acid Arrow (level 4 version), Detect Magic, Fear\n\n1/Day Each: Create Undead, Speak with Dead, Vitriolic Sphere (level 5 version)\n\nLegendary Actions\n\nLegendary Action Uses: 3 (4 in Lair). Immediately after another creature's turn, the dragon can expend a use to take one of the following actions. The dragon regains all expended uses at the start of each of its turns.\n\nCloud of Insects. Dexterity Saving Throw: DC 21, one creature the dragon can see within 120 feet. Failure: 33 (6d10) Poison damage, and the target has Disadvantage on saving throws to maintain Concentration until the end of its next turn. Failure or Success: The dragon can't take this action again until the start of its next turn.\n\nFrightful Presence. The dragon uses Spellcasting to cast Fear. The dragon can't take this action again until the start of its next turn.\n\nPounce. The dragon moves up to half its Speed, and it makes one Rend attack.",
      "attacks": [
        {
          "name": "Rend",
          "attackType": "Melee",
          "damageComponents": [
            {
              "averageDamage": 17,
              "damageType": "Slashing",
              "damageRoll": {
                "expression": "2d8+8",
                "count": 2,
                "sides": 8,
                "modifier": 8
              }
            },
            {
              "averageDamage": 9,
              "damageType": "Acid",
              "damageRoll": {
                "expression": "2d8",
                "count": 2,
                "sides": 8
              }
            }
          ],
