      "statSections": [
        {
          "name": "Actions",
          "rulesText": "Multiattack. The bandit makes two attacks, using Scimitar and Pistol in any combination.\n\nScimitar. Melee Attack Roll: +5, reach 5 ft. Hit: 6 (1d6 + 3) Slashing damage.\n\nPistol. Ranged Attack Roll: +5, range 30/90 ft. Hit: 8 (1d10 + 3) Piercing damage.",
