        {
          "name": "Traits",
          "rulesText": "Earth Glide. The elemental can burrow through nonmagical, unworked earth and stone. While doing so, the elemental doesn't disturb the material it moves through.\n\nSiege Monster. The elemental deals double damage to objects and structures.",
          "sourceLocator": {
            "chapter": "Monsters A-Z",
