      "statSections": [
        {
          "name": "Traits",
          "rulesText": "Ethereal Sight. The ghost can see 60 feet into the Ethereal Plane when it is on the Material Plane.\n\nIncorporeal Movement. The ghost can move through other creatures and objects as if they were Difficult Terrain. It takes 5 (1d10) Force damage if it ends its turn inside an object.",
