          "name": "Traits",
          "rulesText": "Water Breathing. The octopus can breathe only underwater. It can hold its breath for 1 hour outside water.",
          "sourceLocator": {
            "chapter": "Animals",
            "section": "13.41",
            "heading": "Traits",
