      "statSections": [
        {
          "name": "Traits",
          "rulesText": "Air Form. The stalker can enter an enemy's space and stop there. It can move through a space as narrow as 1 inch without expending extra movement to do so.\n\nInvisibility. The stalker has the Invisible condition.",
          "sourceLocator": {
            "chapter": "Monsters A-Z",
            "section": "12.144",
            "heading": "Traits",
            "lineStart": 22518,
            "lineEnd": 22522
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Actions",
          "rulesText": "Multiattack. The stalker makes three Wind Swipe attacks. It can replace one attack with a use of Vortex.\n\nWind Swipe. Melee Attack Roll: +7, reach 5 ft. Hit: 11 (2d6 + 4) Force damage.\n\nVortex. Constitution Saving Throw: DC 14, one Large or smaller creature in the stalker's space. Failure: 7 (1d8 + 3) Thunder damage, and the target has the Grappled condition (escape DC 13). Until the grapple ends, the target can't cast spells with a Verbal component and takes 7 (2d6) Thunder damage at the start of each of the stalker's turns.",
          "sourceLocator": {
            "chapter": "Monsters A-Z",
            "section": "12.144",
            "heading": "Actions",
            "lineStart": 22524,
            "lineEnd": 22530
          }
        }
      ],
