        {
          "name": "Actions",
          "rulesText": "Multiattack. The golem makes two attacks, using Bladed Arm or Fiery Bolt in any combination.\n\nBladed Arm. Melee Attack Roll: +12, reach 10 ft.\nHit: 20 (3d8 + 7) Slashing damage plus 10 (3d6) Fire damage.\n\nFiery Bolt. Ranged Attack Roll: +10, range 120 ft. Hit: 36 (8d8) Fire damage.\n\nPoison Breath (Recharge 6). Constitution Saving\nThrow: DC 18, each creature in a 60-foot Cone. Failure: 55 (10d10) Poison damage. Success: Half damage.",
