          "rulesText": "Trample. Dexterity Saving Throw: DC 18, one creature within 5 feet that has the Prone condition. Failure: 29 (4d10 + 7) Bludgeoning damage. Success: Half damage.",
          "sourceLocator": {
            "chapter": "Animals",
            "section": "13.63",
            "heading": "Bonus Actions",
            "lineStart": 28389,
            "lineEnd": 28391
          }
        }
      ],
      "rulesText": "Huge Beast, Unaligned\n\nAC 13\nInitiative +2 (12)\nHP 126 (11d12 + 55)\nSpeed 50 ft.\n\nSenses Passive Perception 10\nLanguages None\nCR 6 (XP 2,300; PB +3)\n\nActions\n\nMultiattack. The mammoth makes two Gore attacks.\n\nGore. Melee Attack Roll: +10, reach 10 ft. Hit: 18 (2d10 + 7) Piercing damage. If the target is a Huge or smaller creature and the mammoth moved 20+ feet straight toward it immediately before the hit, the target has the Prone condition.\n\nBonus Actions\n\nTrample. Dexterity Saving Throw: DC 18, one creature within 5 feet that has the Prone condition. Failure: 29 (4d10 + 7) Bludgeoning damage. Success: Half damage.",
      "attacks": [
        {
          "name": "Gore",
          "attackType": "Melee",
          "damageComponents": [
            {
              "averageDamage": 18,
              "damageType": "Piercing",
              "damageRoll": {
                "expression": "2d10+7",
                "count": 2,
                "sides": 10,
                "modifier": 7
              }
            }
          ],
          "sourceText": "Gore. Melee Attack Roll: +10, reach 10 ft. Hit: 18 (2d10 + 7) Piercing damage. If the target is a Huge or smaller creature and the mammoth moved 20+ feet straight toward it immediately before the hit, the target has the Prone condition.",
          "path": "statSections[0].rulesText.paragraphs[1]",
