        {
          "name": "Actions",
          "rulesText": "Multiattack. The merrow makes two attacks, using Bite, Claw, or Harpoon in any combination.\n\nBite. Melee Attack Roll: +6, reach 5 ft. Hit: 6 (1d4 + 4) Piercing damage, and the target has the Poisoned condition until the end of the merrow's next turn.\n\nClaw. Melee Attack Roll: +6, reach 5 ft. Hit: 9 (2d4 + 4) Slashing damage.\n\nHarpoon. Melee or Ranged Attack Roll: +6, reach 5 ft. or range 20/60 ft. Hit: 11 (2d6 + 4) Piercing damage. If the target is a Large or smaller creature, the merrow pulls the target up to 15 feet straight toward itself.",
          "sourceLocator": {
            "chapter": "Monsters A-Z",
            "section": "12.167",
            "heading": "Actions",
            "lineStart": 23237,
            "lineEnd": 23245
