              "damageRoll": {
                "expression": "3d12",
                "count": 3,
                "sides": 12
              }
            }
          ],
          "sourceText": "Cursed Touch. Melee Attack Roll: +10, reach 5 ft. Hit: 12 (2d6 + 5) Slashing damage plus 19 (3d12) Necrotic damage. If the target is a creature, it is cursed. While cursed, the target gains no benefit from finishing a Short or Long Rest.",
