      "statSections": [
        {
          "name": "Traits",
          "rulesText": "Fiendish Restoration. If it dies, the naga returns to life in 1d6 days and regains all its Hit Points. Only a Wish spell can prevent this trait from functioning.",
          "sourceLocator": {
            "chapter": "Monsters A-Z",
            "section": "12.229",
            "heading": "Traits",
            "lineStart": 25260,
            "lineEnd": 25262
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Actions",
          "rulesText": "Multiattack. The naga makes three attacks, using Bite or Necrotic Ray in any combination.\n\nBite. Melee Attack Roll: +7, reach 10 ft. Hit: 7 (1d6 + 4) Piercing damage plus 14 (4d6) Poison damage.\n\nNecrotic Ray. Ranged Attack Roll: +6, range 60 ft. Hit: 21 (6d6) Necrotic damage.\n\nSpellcasting. The naga casts one of the following spells, requiring no Somatic or Material components and using Intelligence as the spellcasting ability (spell save DC 14):\n\nAt Will: Detect Magic, Mage Hand, Minor Illusion, Water Breathing\n\n2/Day Each: Detect Thoughts, Dimension Door, Hold Person (level 3 version), Lightning Bolt (level 4 version)",
          "sourceLocator": {
            "chapter": "Monsters A-Z",
            "section": "12.229",
            "heading": "Actions",
            "lineStart": 25264,
