        {
          "name": "Actions",
          "rulesText": "Claw. Melee Attack Roll: +2, reach 5 ft. Hit: 2 (1d4) Slashing damage plus 2 (1d4) Fire damage.\n\nSteam Breath (Recharge 6). Constitution Saving Throw: DC 10, each creature in a 15-foot Cone. Failure: 5 (2d4) Fire damage, and the target's Speed decreases by 10 feet until the end of the mephit's next turn. Success: Half damage only. Failure or Success: Being underwater doesn't grant Resistance to this Fire damage.",
          "sourceLocator": {
            "chapter": "Monsters A-Z",
            "section": "12.164",
            "heading": "Actions",
            "lineStart": 23179,
            "lineEnd": 23183
          }
        }
      ],
