      "statSections": [
        {
          "name": "Actions",
          "rulesText": "Multiattack. The giant makes two attacks, using Stone Club or Boulder in any combination.\n\nStone Club. Melee Attack Roll: +9, reach 15 ft. Hit: 22 (3d10 + 6) Bludgeoning damage.\n\nBoulder. Ranged Attack Roll: +9, range 60/240 ft. Hit: 15 (2d8 + 6) Bludgeoning damage. If the target is a Large or smaller creature, it has the Prone condition.",
