    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/rules/3-32-wizard-spell-list",
      "@type": "Rule",
      "name": "Wizard Spell List",
      "slug": "3-32-wizard-spell-list",
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/sources/srd-5-2-1"
      },
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Classes",
        "section": "3.32",
        "heading": "Wizard Spell List",
        "lineStart": 5108,
        "lineEnd": 5383
      },
      "section": "3.32",
      "rulesText": "This section presents the Wizard spell list. The spells are organized by spell level and then alphabetized, and each spell's school of magic is listed. In the Special column, C means the spell requires Concentration, R means it's a Ritual, and M means it requires a specific Material component.\n\nCantrips (Level 0 Wizard Spells)\n\nLevel 1 Wizard Spells\n\nLevel 2 Wizard Spells\n\nLevel 3 Wizard Spells\n\nLevel 4 Wizard Spells\n\nLevel 5 Wizard Spells\n\nLevel 6 Wizard Spells\n\nLevel 7 Wizard Spells\n\nLevel 8 Wizard Spells\n\nLevel 9 Wizard Spells",
