        "heading": "Gaming Set (Varies)",
        "lineStart": 6344,
        "lineEnd": 6352
      },
      "section": "6.55",
      "rulesText": "Ability: Wisdom\n\nWeight: -\n\nUtilize: Discern whether someone is cheating (DC 10), or win the game (DC 20)\n\nVariants: Dice (1 SP), dragonchess (1 GP), playing cards (5 SP), three-dragon ante (1 GP)"
