      },
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Equipment",
        "section": "6.57",
        "heading": "Musical Instrument (Varies)",
        "lineStart": 6364,
        "lineEnd": 6372
      },
      "section": "6.57",
      "rulesText": "Ability: Charisma\n\nWeight: Varies\n\nUtilize: Play a known tune (DC 10), or improvise a song (DC 15)\n\nVariants: Bagpipes (30 GP, 6 lb.), drum (6 GP, 3 lb.), dulcimer (25 GP, 10 lb.), flute (2 GP, 1 lb.), horn (3 GP, 2 lb.), lute (35 GP, 2 lb.), lyre (30 GP, 2 lb.), pan flute (12 GP, 2 lb.), shawm (2 GP, 1 lb.), viol (30 GP, 1 lb.)"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/rules/6-58-navigators-tools-25-gp",
      "@type": "Rule",
