        "Bard",
        "Cleric",
        "Druid",
        "Paladin",
        "Ranger"
      ],
      "castingTime": "Action",
      "range": "30 feet",
      "components": "V, S, M (a strip of white cloth)",
      "duration": "8 hours",
      "rulesText": "Level 2 Abjuration (Bard, Cleric, Druid, Paladin, Ranger)\n\nCasting Time: Action\nRange: 30 feet\nComponents: V, S, M (a strip of white cloth)\nDuration: 8 hours\n\nChoose up to three creatures within range. Each target's Hit Point maximum and current Hit Points increase by 5 for the duration.\n\nUsing a Higher-Level Spell Slot. Each target's Hit Points increase by 5 for each spell slot level above 2.",
      "classes": [
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/bard"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/cleric"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/druid"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/paladin"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/ranger"
        }
      ],
      "scalesWithSlotLevel": true,
      "concentration": false,
      "ritual": false
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/spells/alarm",
      "@type": "Spell",
      "name": "Alarm",
      "slug": "alarm",
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/sources/srd-5-2-1"
      },
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Spells",
        "section": "7.33",
        "heading": "Alarm",
        "lineStart": 7384,
        "lineEnd": 7399
      },
      "level": 1,
      "school": "Abjuration",
      "classAvailability": [
        "Ranger",
        "Wizard"
      ],
      "castingTime": "1 minute or Ritual",
      "range": "30 feet",
      "components": "V, S, M (a bell and silver wire)",
      "duration": "8 hours",
      "rulesText": "Level 1 Abjuration (Ranger, Wizard)\n\nCasting Time: 1 minute or Ritual\nRange: 30 feet\nComponents: V, S, M (a bell and silver wire)\nDuration: 8 hours\n\nYou set an alarm against intrusion. Choose a door, a window, or an area within range that is no larger than a 20-foot Cube. Until the spell ends, an alarm\n\nalerts you whenever a creature touches or enters the warded area. When you cast the spell, you can designate creatures that won't set off the alarm. You also choose whether the alarm is audible or mental:\n\nAudible Alarm. The alarm produces the sound of a handbell for 10 seconds within 60 feet of the warded area.\n\nMental Alarm. You are alerted by a mental ping if you are within 1 mile of the warded area. This ping awakens you if you're asleep.",
      "classes": [
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/ranger"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/wizard"
        }
      ],
      "scalesWithSlotLevel": false,
      "concentration": false,
      "ritual": true
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/spells/alter-self",
      "@type": "Spell",
      "name": "Alter Self",
      "slug": "alter-self",
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/sources/srd-5-2-1"
      },
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Spells",
        "section": "7.34",
        "heading": "Alter Self",
        "lineStart": 7401,
        "lineEnd": 7416
      },
      "level": 2,
      "school": "Transmutation",
      "classAvailability": [
        "Sorcerer",
        "Wizard"
      ],
      "castingTime": "Action",
      "range": "Self",
      "components": "V, S",
      "duration": "Concentration, up to 1 hour",
      "rulesText": "Level 2 Transmutation (Sorcerer, Wizard)\n\nCasting Time: Action\nRange: Self\nComponents: V, S\nDuration: Concentration, up to 1 hour\n\nYou alter your physical form. Choose one of the following options. Its effects last for the duration, during which you can take a Magic action to replace the option you chose with a different one.\n\nAquatic Adaptation. You sprout gills and grow webs between your fingers. You can breathe underwater and gain a Swim Speed equal to your Speed.\n\nChange Appearance. You alter your appearance. You decide what you look like, including your height, weight, facial features, sound of your voice, hair length, coloration, and other distinguishing characteristics. You can make yourself appear as a member of another species, though none of your statistics change. You can't appear as a creature of a different size, and your basic shape stays the same; if you're bipedal, you can't use this spell to become quadrupedal, for instance. For the duration, you can take a Magic action to change your appearance in this way again.\n\nNatural Weapons. You grow claws (Slashing), fangs (Piercing), horns (Piercing), or hooves (Bludgeoning). When you use your Unarmed Strike to deal damage with that new growth, it deals 1d6 damage of the type in parentheses instead of dealing the normal damage for your Unarmed Strike, and you use your spellcasting ability modifier for the attack and damage rolls rather than using Strength.",
      "classes": [
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/sorcerer"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/wizard"
        }
      ],
      "scalesWithSlotLevel": false,
      "concentration": true,
      "ritual": false
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/spells/animal-friendship",
      "@type": "Spell",
      "name": "Animal Friendship",
      "slug": "animal-friendship",
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/sources/srd-5-2-1"
      },
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Spells",
        "section": "7.35",
        "heading": "Animal Friendship",
        "lineStart": 7418,
        "lineEnd": 7431
      },
      "level": 1,
      "school": "Enchantment",
      "classAvailability": [
        "Bard",
        "Druid",
        "Ranger"
      ],
      "castingTime": "Action",
      "range": "30 feet",
      "components": "V, S, M (a morsel of food)",
      "duration": "24 hours",
      "rulesText": "Level 1 Enchantment (Bard, Druid, Ranger)\n\nCasting Time: Action\nRange: 30 feet\nComponents: V, S, M (a morsel of food)\nDuration: 24 hours\n\nTarget a Beast that you can see within range. The target must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw or have the Charmed condition for the duration. If you\n\nor one of your allies deals damage to the target, the spells ends.\n\nUsing a Higher-Level Spell Slot. You can target one additional Beast for each spell slot level above 1.",
      "classes": [
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/bard"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/druid"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/ranger"
        }
      ],
      "savingThrowAbility": "Wisdom",
      "scalesWithSlotLevel": true,
      "concentration": false,
      "ritual": false
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/spells/animal-messenger",
      "@type": "Spell",
      "name": "Animal Messenger",
      "slug": "animal-messenger",
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/sources/srd-5-2-1"
      },
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Spells",
        "section": "7.36",
        "heading": "Animal Messenger",
        "lineStart": 7433,
        "lineEnd": 7446
      },
      "level": 2,
      "school": "Enchantment",
      "classAvailability": [
        "Bard",
        "Druid",
        "Ranger"
      ],
      "castingTime": "Action or Ritual",
      "range": "30 feet",
      "components": "V, S, M (a morsel of food)",
      "duration": "24 hours",
      "rulesText": "Level 2 Enchantment (Bard, Druid, Ranger)\n\nCasting Time: Action or Ritual\nRange: 30 feet\nComponents: V, S, M (a morsel of food)\nDuration: 24 hours\n\nA Tiny Beast of your choice that you can see within range must succeed on a Charisma saving throw, or it attempts to deliver a message for you (if the target's Challenge Rating isn't 0, it automatically succeeds). You specify a location you have visited and a recipient who matches a general description, such as “a person dressed in the uniform of the town guard” or “a red-haired dwarf wearing a pointed hat.” You also communicate a message of up to twenty-five words. The Beast travels for the duration toward the specified location, covering about 25 miles per 24 hours or 50 miles if the Beast can fly.\n\nWhen the Beast arrives, it delivers your message to the creature that you described, mimicking your communication. If the Beast doesn't reach its destination before the spell ends, the message is lost, and the Beast returns to where you cast the spell.\n\nUsing a Higher-Level Spell Slot. The spell's duration increases by 48 hours for each spell slot level above 2.",
      "classes": [
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/bard"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/druid"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/ranger"
        }
      ],
      "savingThrowAbility": "Charisma",
      "scalesWithSlotLevel": true,
      "concentration": false,
      "ritual": true
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/spells/animal-shapes",
      "@type": "Spell",
      "name": "Animal Shapes",
      "slug": "animal-shapes",
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/sources/srd-5-2-1"
      },
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Spells",
        "section": "7.37",
        "heading": "Animal Shapes",
        "lineStart": 7448,
        "lineEnd": 7463
      },
      "level": 8,
      "school": "Transmutation",
      "classAvailability": [
        "Druid"
      ],
      "castingTime": "Action",
      "range": "30 feet",
      "components": "V, S",
      "duration": "24 hours",
      "rulesText": "Level 8 Transmutation (Druid)\n\nCasting Time: Action\nRange: 30 feet\nComponents: V, S\nDuration: 24 hours\n\nChoose any number of willing creatures that you can see within range. Each target shape-shifts into a Large or smaller Beast of your choice that has a Challenge Rating of 4 or lower. You can choose a different form for each target. On later turns, you can take a Magic action to transform the targets again.\n\nA target's game statistics are replaced by the chosen Beast's statistics, but the target retains its creature type; Hit Points; Hit Point Dice; alignment; ability to communicate; and Intelligence, Wisdom, and Charisma scores. The target's actions are limited by the Beast form's anatomy, and it can't cast spells. The target's equipment melds into the new form, and the target can't use any of that equipment while in that form.\n\nThe target gains a number of Temporary Hit Points equal to the Hit Points of the first form into\n\nwhich it shape-shifts. These Temporary Hit Points vanish if any remain when the spell ends. The transformation lasts for the duration or until the target ends it as a Bonus Action.",
      "classes": [
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/druid"
        }
      ],
      "scalesWithSlotLevel": false,
      "concentration": false,
      "ritual": false
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/spells/animate-dead",
      "@type": "Spell",
      "name": "Animate Dead",
      "slug": "animate-dead",
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/sources/srd-5-2-1"
      },
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Spells",
        "section": "7.38",
        "heading": "Animate Dead",
        "lineStart": 7465,
        "lineEnd": 7480
      },
      "level": 3,
      "school": "Necromancy",
      "classAvailability": [
        "Cleric",
        "Wizard"
      ],
      "castingTime": "1 minute",
      "range": "10 feet",
      "components": "V, S, M (a drop of blood, a piece of flesh, and a pinch of bone dust)",
      "duration": "Instantaneous",
      "rulesText": "Level 3 Necromancy (Cleric, Wizard)\n\nCasting Time: 1 minute\nRange: 10 feet\nComponents: V, S, M (a drop of blood, a piece of flesh, and a pinch of bone dust)\nDuration: Instantaneous\n\nChoose a pile of bones or a corpse of a Medium or Small Humanoid within range. The target becomes an Undead creature: a Skeleton if you chose bones or a Zombie if you chose a corpse (see “Monsters” for the stat blocks).\n\nOn each of your turns, you can take a Bonus Action to mentally command any creature you made with this spell if the creature is within 60 feet of you (if you control multiple creatures, you can command any of them at the same time, issuing the same command to each one). You decide what action the creature will take and where it will move on its next turn, or you can issue a general command, such as to guard a chamber or corridor. If you issue no commands, the creature takes the Dodge action and moves only to avoid harm. Once given an order, the creature continues to follow it until its task is complete.\n\nThe creature is under your control for 24 hours, after which it stops obeying any command you've given it. To maintain control of the creature for another 24 hours, you must cast this spell on the creature again before the current 24-hour period ends. This use of the spell reasserts your control over up to four creatures you have animated with this spell rather than animating a new creature.\n\nUsing a Higher-Level Spell Slot. You animate or reassert control over two additional Undead creatures for each spell slot level above 3. Each of the creatures must come from a different corpse or pile of bones.",
      "classes": [
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/cleric"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/wizard"
        }
      ],
      "scalesWithSlotLevel": true,
      "concentration": false,
      "ritual": false
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/spells/animate-objects",
      "@type": "Spell",
      "name": "Animate Objects",
      "slug": "animate-objects",
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/sources/srd-5-2-1"
      },
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Spells",
        "section": "7.39",
        "heading": "Animate Objects",
        "lineStart": 7482,
        "lineEnd": 7499
      },
      "level": 5,
      "school": "Transmutation",
      "classAvailability": [
        "Bard",
        "Sorcerer",
        "Wizard"
      ],
      "castingTime": "Action",
      "range": "120 feet",
      "components": "V, S",
      "duration": "Concentration, up to 1 minute",
      "rulesText": "Level 5 Transmutation (Bard, Sorcerer, Wizard)\n\nCasting Time: Action\nRange: 120 feet\nComponents: V, S\nDuration: Concentration, up to 1 minute\n\nObjects animate at your command. Choose a number of nonmagical objects within range that aren't being worn or carried, aren't fixed to a surface, and aren't Gargantuan. The maximum number of objects is equal to your spellcasting ability modifier; for this number, a Medium or smaller target counts as\n\none object, a Large target counts as two, and a Huge target counts as three.\n\nEach target animates, sprouts legs, and becomes a Construct that uses the Animated Object stat block; this creature is under your control until the spell ends or until it is reduced to 0 Hit Points. Each creature you make with this spell is an ally to you and your allies. In combat, it shares your Initiative count and takes its turn immediately after yours.\n\nUntil the spell ends, you can take a Bonus Action to mentally command any creature you made with this spell if the creature is within 500 feet of you (if you control multiple creatures, you can command any of them at the same time, issuing the same command to each one). If you issue no commands, the creature takes the Dodge action and moves only to avoid harm. When the creature drops to 0 Hit Points, it reverts to its object form, and any remaining damage carries over to that form.\n\nUsing a Higher-Level Spell Slot. The creature's Slam damage increases by 1d4 (Medium or smaller), 1d6 (Large), or 1d12 (Huge) for each spell slot level above 5.",
      "classes": [
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/bard"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/sorcerer"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/wizard"
        }
      ],
      "scalesWithSlotLevel": true,
      "concentration": true,
      "ritual": false
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/spells/antilife-shell",
      "@type": "Spell",
      "name": "Antilife Shell",
      "slug": "antilife-shell",
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/sources/srd-5-2-1"
      },
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Spells",
        "section": "7.41",
        "heading": "Antilife Shell",
        "lineStart": 7524,
        "lineEnd": 7537
      },
      "level": 5,
      "school": "Abjuration",
      "classAvailability": [
        "Druid"
      ],
      "castingTime": "Action",
      "range": "Self",
      "components": "V, S",
      "duration": "Concentration, up to 1 hour",
      "rulesText": "Level 5 Abjuration (Druid)\n\nCasting Time: Action\nRange: Self\nComponents: V, S\nDuration: Concentration, up to 1 hour\n\nAn aura extends from you in a 10-foot Emanation for the duration. The aura prevents creatures other than Constructs and Undead from passing or reaching through it. An affected creature can cast spells\n\nor make attacks with Ranged or Reach weapons through the barrier.\n\nIf you move so that an affected creature is forced to pass through the barrier, the spell ends.",
      "classes": [
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/druid"
        }
      ],
      "scalesWithSlotLevel": false,
      "concentration": true,
      "ritual": false
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/spells/antimagic-field",
      "@type": "Spell",
      "name": "Antimagic Field",
      "slug": "antimagic-field",
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/sources/srd-5-2-1"
      },
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Spells",
        "section": "7.42",
        "heading": "Antimagic Field",
        "lineStart": 7539,
        "lineEnd": 7554
      },
      "level": 8,
      "school": "Abjuration",
      "classAvailability": [
        "Cleric",
        "Wizard"
      ],
      "castingTime": "Action",
      "range": "Self",
      "components": "V, S, M (iron filings)",
      "duration": "Concentration, up to 1 hour",
      "rulesText": "Level 8 Abjuration (Cleric, Wizard)\n\nCasting Time: Action\nRange: Self\nComponents: V, S, M (iron filings)\nDuration: Concentration, up to 1 hour\n\nAn aura of antimagic surrounds you in 10-foot Emanation. No one can cast spells, take Magic actions, or create other magical effects inside the aura, and those things can't target or otherwise affect anything inside it. Magical properties of magic items don't work inside the aura or on anything inside it.\n\nAreas of effect created by spells or other magic can't extend into the aura, and no one can teleport into or out of it or use planar travel there. Portals close temporarily while in the aura.\n\nOngoing spells, except those cast by an Artifact or a deity, are suppressed in the area. While an effect is suppressed, it doesn't function, but the time it spends suppressed counts against its duration.\n\nDispel Magic has no effect on the aura, and the auras created by different Antimagic Field spells don't nullify each other.",
      "classes": [
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/cleric"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/wizard"
        }
      ],
      "scalesWithSlotLevel": false,
      "concentration": true,
      "ritual": false
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/spells/antipathy-sympathy",
      "@type": "Spell",
      "name": "Antipathy/Sympathy",
      "slug": "antipathy-sympathy",
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/sources/srd-5-2-1"
      },
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Spells",
        "section": "7.43",
        "heading": "Antipathy/Sympathy",
        "lineStart": 7556,
        "lineEnd": 7573
      },
      "level": 8,
      "school": "Enchantment",
      "classAvailability": [
        "Bard",
        "Druid",
        "Wizard"
      ],
      "castingTime": "1 hour",
      "range": "60 feet",
      "components": "V, S, M (a mix of vinegar and honey)",
      "duration": "10 days",
      "rulesText": "Level 8 Enchantment (Bard, Druid, Wizard)\n\nCasting Time: 1 hour\nRange: 60 feet\nComponents: V, S, M (a mix of vinegar and honey)\nDuration: 10 days\n\nAs you cast the spell, choose whether it creates antipathy or sympathy, and target one creature or object that is Huge or smaller. Then specify a kind of creature, such as red dragons, goblins, or vampires. A creature of the chosen kind makes a Wisdom saving throw when it comes within 120 feet of the target. Your choice of antipathy or sympathy determines what happens to a creature when it fails that save:\n\nAntipathy. The creature has the Frightened condition. The Frightened creature must use its movement on its turns to get as far away as possible from the target, moving by the safest route.\n\nSympathy. The creature has the Charmed condition. The Charmed creature must use its movement on its turns to get as close as possible to the target, moving by the safest route. If the creature is within 5 feet of the target, the creature can't willingly move away. If the target damages the Charmed creature, that creature can make a\n\nWisdom saving throw to end the effect, as described below.\n\nEnding the Effect. If the Frightened or Charmed creature ends its turn more than 120 feet away from the target, the creature makes a Wisdom saving throw. On a successful save, the creature is no longer affected by the target. A creature that successfully saves against this effect is immune to it for 1 minute, after which it can be affected again.",
      "classes": [
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/bard"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/druid"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/wizard"
        }
      ],
      "savingThrowAbility": "Wisdom",
      "scalesWithSlotLevel": false,
      "concentration": false,
      "ritual": false
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/spells/arcane-eye",
      "@type": "Spell",
      "name": "Arcane Eye",
      "slug": "arcane-eye",
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/sources/srd-5-2-1"
      },
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Spells",
        "section": "7.44",
        "heading": "Arcane Eye",
        "lineStart": 7575,
        "lineEnd": 7586
      },
      "level": 4,
      "school": "Divination",
      "classAvailability": [
        "Wizard"
      ],
      "castingTime": "Action",
      "range": "30 feet",
      "components": "V, S, M (a bit of bat fur)",
      "duration": "Concentration, up to 1 hour",
      "rulesText": "Level 4 Divination (Wizard)\n\nCasting Time: Action\nRange: 30 feet\nComponents: V, S, M (a bit of bat fur)\nDuration: Concentration, up to 1 hour\n\nYou create an Invisible, invulnerable eye within range that hovers for the duration. You mentally receive visual information from the eye, which can see in every direction. It also has Darkvision with a range of 30 feet.\n\nAs a Bonus Action, you can move the eye up to 30 feet in any direction. A solid barrier blocks the eye's movement, but the eye can pass through an opening as small as 1 inch in diameter.",
      "classes": [
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/wizard"
        }
      ],
      "scalesWithSlotLevel": false,
      "concentration": true,
      "ritual": false
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/spells/arcane-hand",
      "@type": "Spell",
      "name": "Arcane Hand",
      "slug": "arcane-hand",
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/sources/srd-5-2-1"
      },
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Spells",
        "section": "7.45",
        "heading": "Arcane Hand",
        "lineStart": 7588,
        "lineEnd": 7611
      },
      "level": 5,
      "school": "Evocation",
      "classAvailability": [
        "Sorcerer",
        "Wizard"
      ],
      "castingTime": "Action",
      "range": "120 feet",
      "components": "V, S, M (an eggshell and a glove)",
      "duration": "Concentration, up to 1 minute",
      "rulesText": "Level 5 Evocation (Sorcerer, Wizard)\n\nCasting Time: Action\nRange: 120 feet\nComponents: V, S, M (an eggshell and a glove)\nDuration: Concentration, up to 1 minute\n\nYou create a Large hand of shimmering magical energy in an unoccupied space that you can see within range. The hand lasts for the duration, and it moves at your command, mimicking the movements of your own hand.\n\nThe hand is an object that has AC 20 and Hit Points equal to your Hit Point maximum. If it drops to 0 Hit Points, the spell ends. The hand doesn't occupy its space.\n\nWhen you cast the spell and as a Bonus Action on your later turns, you can move the hand up to 60 feet and then cause one of the following effects:\n\nClenched Fist. The hand strikes a target within 5 feet of it. Make a melee spell attack. On a hit, the target takes 5d8 Force damage.\n\nForceful Hand. The hand attempts to push a Huge or smaller creature within 5 feet of it. The target must succeed on a Strength saving throw, or the hand pushes the target up to 5 feet plus a number of feet equal to five times your spellcasting ability modifier. The hand moves with the target, remaining within 5 feet of it.\n\nGrasping Hand. The hand attempts to grapple a Huge or smaller creature within 5 feet of it. The target must succeed on a Dexterity saving throw, or the target has the Grappled condition, with an escape DC equal to your spell save DC. While the hand grapples the target, you can take a Bonus Action to cause the hand to crush it, dealing Bludgeoning damage to the target equal to 4d6 plus your spellcasting ability modifier.\n\nInterposing Hand. The hand grants you Half Cover against attacks and other effects that originate from its space or that pass through it. In addition, its space counts as Difficult Terrain for your enemies.\n\nUsing a Higher-Level Spell Slot. The damage of the Clenched Fist increases by 2d8 and the damage of the Grasping Hand increases by 2d6 for each spell slot level above 5.",
      "classes": [
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/sorcerer"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/wizard"
        }
      ],
      "savingThrowAbility": "Strength",
      "damage": [
        {
          "damageType": "Force",
          "damageRoll": {
            "expression": "5d8",
            "count": 5,
            "sides": 8
          }
        }
      ],
      "scalesWithSlotLevel": true,
      "concentration": true,
      "ritual": false
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/spells/arcane-lock",
      "@type": "Spell",
      "name": "Arcane Lock",
      "slug": "arcane-lock",
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/sources/srd-5-2-1"
      },
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Spells",
        "section": "7.46",
        "heading": "Arcane Lock",
        "lineStart": 7613,
        "lineEnd": 7624
      },
      "level": 2,
      "school": "Abjuration",
      "classAvailability": [
        "Wizard"
      ],
      "castingTime": "Action",
      "range": "Touch",
      "components": "V, S, M (gold dust worth 25+ GP, which the spell consumes)",
      "duration": "Until dispelled",
      "rulesText": "Level 2 Abjuration (Wizard)\n\nCasting Time: Action\nRange: Touch\nComponents: V, S, M (gold dust worth 25+ GP, which the spell consumes)\nDuration: Until dispelled\n\nYou touch a closed door, window, gate, container, or hatch and magically lock it for the duration. This lock can't be unlocked by any nonmagical means.\n\nYou and any creatures you designate when you cast the spell can open and close the object despite the lock. You can also set a password that, when spoken within 5 feet of the object, unlocks it for 1 minute.",
      "classes": [
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/wizard"
        }
      ],
      "scalesWithSlotLevel": false,
      "concentration": false,
      "ritual": false
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/spells/arcane-sword",
      "@type": "Spell",
      "name": "Arcane Sword",
      "slug": "arcane-sword",
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/sources/srd-5-2-1"
      },
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Spells",
        "section": "7.47",
        "heading": "Arcane Sword",
        "lineStart": 7626,
        "lineEnd": 7639
      },
      "level": 7,
      "school": "Evocation",
      "classAvailability": [
        "Bard",
        "Wizard"
      ],
      "castingTime": "Action",
      "range": "90 feet",
      "components": "V, S, M (a miniature sword worth 250+ GP)",
      "duration": "Concentration, up to 1 minute",
      "rulesText": "Level 7 Evocation (Bard, Wizard)\n\nCasting Time: Action\nRange: 90 feet\nComponents: V, S, M (a miniature sword worth 250+ GP)\nDuration: Concentration, up to 1 minute\n\nYou create a spectral sword that hovers within range. It lasts for the duration.\n\nWhen the sword appears, you make a melee spell attack against a target within 5 feet of the sword. On a hit, the target takes Force damage equal to 4d12 plus your spellcasting ability modifier.\n\nOn your later turns, you can take a Bonus Action to move the sword up to 30 feet to a spot you can see and repeat the attack against the same target or a different one.",
      "classes": [
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/bard"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/wizard"
        }
      ],
      "scalesWithSlotLevel": false,
      "concentration": true,
      "ritual": false
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/spells/arcanists-magic-aura",
      "@type": "Spell",
      "name": "Arcanist's Magic Aura",
      "slug": "arcanists-magic-aura",
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/sources/srd-5-2-1"
      },
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Spells",
        "section": "7.48",
        "heading": "Arcanist's Magic Aura",
        "lineStart": 7641,
        "lineEnd": 7654
      },
      "level": 2,
      "school": "Illusion",
      "classAvailability": [
        "Wizard"
      ],
      "castingTime": "Action",
      "range": "Touch",
      "components": "V, S, M (a small square of silk)",
      "duration": "24 hours",
      "rulesText": "Level 2 Illusion (Wizard)\n\nCasting Time: Action\nRange: Touch\nComponents: V, S, M (a small square of silk)\nDuration: 24 hours\n\nWith a touch, you place an illusion on a willing creature or an object that isn't being worn or carried. A creature gains the Mask effect below, and an object gains the False Aura effect below. The effect lasts for the duration. If you cast the spell on the same target every day for 30 days, the illusion lasts until dispelled.\n\nMask (Creature). Choose a creature type other than the target's actual type. Spells and other magical effects treat the target as if it were a creature of the chosen type.\n\nFalse Aura (Object). You change the way the target appears to spells and magical effects that detect magical auras, such as Detect Magic. You can make a nonmagical object appear magical, make a magic item appear nonmagical, or change the object's aura so that it appears to belong to a school of magic you choose.",
      "classes": [
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/wizard"
        }
      ],
      "scalesWithSlotLevel": false,
      "concentration": false,
      "ritual": false
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/spells/astral-projection",
      "@type": "Spell",
      "name": "Astral Projection",
      "slug": "astral-projection",
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/sources/srd-5-2-1"
      },
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Spells",
        "section": "7.49",
        "heading": "Astral Projection",
        "lineStart": 7656,
        "lineEnd": 7673
      },
      "level": 9,
      "school": "Necromancy",
      "classAvailability": [
        "Cleric",
        "Warlock",
        "Wizard"
      ],
      "castingTime": "1 hour",
      "range": "10 feet",
      "components": "V, S, M (for each of the spell's targets, one jacinth worth 1,000+ GP and one silver bar worth 100+ GP, all of which the spell consumes)",
      "duration": "Until dispelled",
      "rulesText": "Level 9 Necromancy (Cleric, Warlock, Wizard)\n\nCasting Time: 1 hour\nRange: 10 feet\nComponents: V, S, M (for each of the spell's targets, one jacinth worth 1,000+ GP and one silver bar worth 100+ GP, all of which the spell consumes)\nDuration: Until dispelled\n\nYou and up to eight willing creatures within range project your astral bodies into the Astral Plane (the spell ends instantly if you are already on that plane). Each target's body is left behind in a state of suspended animation; it has the Unconscious condition, doesn't need food or air, and doesn't age.\n\nA target's astral form resembles its body in almost every way, replicating its game statistics and possessions. The principal difference is the addition of a silvery cord that trails from between the shoulder blades of the astral form. The cord fades from view after 1 foot. If the cord is cut - which happens only when an effect states that it does so - the target's body and astral form both die.\n\nA target's astral form can travel through the Astral Plane. The moment an astral form leaves that plane, the target's body and possessions travel along the silver cord, causing the target to re-enter its body on the new plane.\n\nAny damage or other effects that apply to an astral form have no effect on the target's body and vice versa. If a target's body or astral form drops to 0 Hit Points, the spell ends for that target. The spell ends for all the targets if you take a Magic action to dismiss it.\n\nWhen the spell ends for a target who isn't dead, the target reappears in its body and exits the state of suspended animation.",
      "classes": [
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/cleric"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/warlock"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/wizard"
        }
      ],
      "scalesWithSlotLevel": false,
      "concentration": false,
      "ritual": false
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/spells/augury",
      "@type": "Spell",
      "name": "Augury",
      "slug": "augury",
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/sources/srd-5-2-1"
      },
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Spells",
        "section": "7.50",
        "heading": "Augury",
        "lineStart": 7675,
        "lineEnd": 7697
      },
      "level": 2,
      "school": "Divination",
      "classAvailability": [
        "Cleric",
        "Druid",
        "Wizard"
      ],
      "castingTime": "1 minute or Ritual",
      "range": "Self",
      "components": "V, S, M (specially marked sticks, bones, cards, or other divinatory tokens worth 25+ GP)",
      "duration": "Instantaneous",
      "rulesText": "Level 2 Divination (Cleric, Druid, Wizard)\n\nCasting Time: 1 minute or Ritual\nRange: Self\nComponents: V, S, M (specially marked sticks, bones, cards, or other divinatory tokens worth 25+ GP)\nDuration: Instantaneous\n\nYou receive an omen from an otherworldly entity about the results of a course of action that you plan to take within the next 30 minutes. The GM chooses the omen from the Omens table.\n\nOmens\n\n| Omen         | For Results That Will Be ... |\n| :----------- | :--------------------------- |\n| Weal         | Good                         |\n| Woe          | Bad                          |\n| Weal and woe | Good and bad                 |\n| Indifference | Neither good nor bad         |\n\nThe spell doesn't account for circumstances, such as other spells, that might change the results.\n\nIf you cast the spell more than once before finishing a Long Rest, there is a cumulative 25 percent chance for each casting after the first that you get no answer.",
      "classes": [
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/cleric"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/druid"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/wizard"
        }
      ],
      "scalesWithSlotLevel": false,
      "concentration": false,
      "ritual": true
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/spells/aura-of-life",
      "@type": "Spell",
      "name": "Aura of Life",
      "slug": "aura-of-life",
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/sources/srd-5-2-1"
      },
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Spells",
        "section": "7.51",
        "heading": "Aura of Life",
        "lineStart": 7699,
        "lineEnd": 7708
      },
      "level": 4,
      "school": "Abjuration",
      "classAvailability": [
        "Cleric",
        "Paladin"
      ],
      "castingTime": "Action",
      "range": "Self",
      "components": "V",
      "duration": "Concentration, up to 10 minutes",
      "rulesText": "Level 4 Abjuration (Cleric, Paladin)\n\nCasting Time: Action\nRange: Self\nComponents: V\nDuration: Concentration, up to 10 minutes\n\nAn aura radiates from you in a 30-foot Emanation for the duration. While in the aura, you and your allies have Resistance to Necrotic damage, and your Hit Point maximums can't be reduced. If an ally with 0 Hit Points starts its turn in the aura, that ally regains 1 Hit Point.",
      "classes": [
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/cleric"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/paladin"
        }
      ],
      "scalesWithSlotLevel": false,
      "concentration": true,
      "ritual": false
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/spells/awaken",
      "@type": "Spell",
      "name": "Awaken",
      "slug": "awaken",
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/sources/srd-5-2-1"
      },
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Spells",
        "section": "7.52",
        "heading": "Awaken",
        "lineStart": 7710,
        "lineEnd": 7725
      },
      "level": 5,
      "school": "Transmutation",
      "classAvailability": [
        "Bard",
        "Druid"
      ],
      "castingTime": "8 hours",
      "range": "Touch",
      "components": "V, S, M (an agate worth 1,000+ GP, which the spell consumes)",
      "duration": "Instantaneous",
      "rulesText": "Level 5 Transmutation (Bard, Druid)\n\nCasting Time: 8 hours\nRange: Touch\nComponents: V, S, M (an agate worth 1,000+ GP, which the spell consumes)\nDuration: Instantaneous\n\nYou spend the casting time tracing magical pathways within a precious gemstone, and then touch the target. The target must be either a Beast or Plant creature with an Intelligence of 3 or less or a natural plant that isn't a creature. The target gains\n\nan Intelligence of 10 and the ability to speak one language you know. If the target is a natural plant, it becomes a Plant creature and gains the ability to move its limbs, roots, vines, creepers, and so forth, and it gains senses similar to a human's. The GM chooses statistics appropriate for the awakened Plant, such as the statistics for the Awakened\n\nShrub or Awakened Tree in \"Monsters.\"\n\nThe awakened target has the Charmed condition for 30 days or until you or your allies deal damage to it. When that condition ends, the awakened creature chooses its attitude toward you.",
      "classes": [
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/bard"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/druid"
        }
      ],
      "scalesWithSlotLevel": false,
      "concentration": false,
      "ritual": false
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/spells/bane",
      "@type": "Spell",
      "name": "Bane",
      "slug": "bane",
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/sources/srd-5-2-1"
      },
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Spells",
        "section": "7.53",
        "heading": "Bane",
        "lineStart": 7727,
        "lineEnd": 7738
      },
      "level": 1,
      "school": "Enchantment",
      "classAvailability": [
        "Bard",
        "Cleric",
        "Warlock"
      ],
      "castingTime": "Action",
      "range": "30 feet",
      "components": "V, S, M (a drop of blood)",
      "duration": "Concentration, up to 1 minute",
      "rulesText": "Level 1 Enchantment (Bard, Cleric, Warlock)\n\nCasting Time: Action\nRange: 30 feet\nComponents: V, S, M (a drop of blood)\nDuration: Concentration, up to 1 minute\n\nUp to three creatures of your choice that you can see within range must each make a Charisma saving throw. Whenever a target that fails this save makes an attack roll or a saving throw before the spell ends, the target must subtract 1d4 from the attack roll or save.\n\nUsing a Higher-Level Spell Slot. You can target one additional creature for each spell slot level above 1.",
      "classes": [
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/bard"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/cleric"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/warlock"
        }
      ],
      "savingThrowAbility": "Charisma",
      "scalesWithSlotLevel": true,
      "concentration": true,
      "ritual": false
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/spells/banishment",
      "@type": "Spell",
      "name": "Banishment",
      "slug": "banishment",
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/sources/srd-5-2-1"
      },
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Spells",
        "section": "7.54",
        "heading": "Banishment",
        "lineStart": 7740,
        "lineEnd": 7753
      },
      "level": 4,
      "school": "Abjuration",
      "classAvailability": [
        "Cleric",
        "Paladin",
        "Sorcerer",
        "Warlock",
        "Wizard"
      ],
      "castingTime": "Action",
      "range": "30 feet",
      "components": "V, S, M (a pentacle)",
      "duration": "Concentration, up to 1 minute",
      "rulesText": "Level 4 Abjuration (Cleric, Paladin, Sorcerer, Warlock, Wizard)\n\nCasting Time: Action\nRange: 30 feet\nComponents: V, S, M (a pentacle)\nDuration: Concentration, up to 1 minute\n\nOne creature that you can see within range must succeed on a Charisma saving throw or be transported to a harmless demiplane for the duration. While there, the target has the Incapacitated condition. When the spell ends, the target reappears in the space it left or in the nearest unoccupied space if that space is occupied.\n\nIf the target is an Aberration, a Celestial, an Elemental, a Fey, or a Fiend, the target doesn't return if the spell lasts for 1 minute. The target is instead transported to a random location on a plane (GM's choice) associated with its creature type.\n\nUsing a Higher-Level Spell Slot. You can target one additional creature for each spell slot level above 4.",
      "classes": [
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/cleric"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/paladin"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/sorcerer"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/warlock"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/wizard"
        }
      ],
      "savingThrowAbility": "Charisma",
      "scalesWithSlotLevel": true,
      "concentration": true,
      "ritual": false
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/spells/barkskin",
      "@type": "Spell",
      "name": "Barkskin",
      "slug": "barkskin",
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/sources/srd-5-2-1"
      },
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Spells",
        "section": "7.55",
        "heading": "Barkskin",
        "lineStart": 7755,
        "lineEnd": 7764
      },
      "level": 2,
      "school": "Transmutation",
      "classAvailability": [
        "Druid",
        "Ranger"
      ],
      "castingTime": "Bonus Action",
      "range": "Touch",
      "components": "V, S, M (a handful of bark)",
      "duration": "1 hour",
      "rulesText": "Level 2 Transmutation (Druid, Ranger)\n\nCasting Time: Bonus Action\nRange: Touch\nComponents: V, S, M (a handful of bark)\nDuration: 1 hour\n\nYou touch a willing creature. Until the spell ends, the target's skin assumes a bark-like appearance, and the target has an Armor Class of 17 if its AC is lower than that.",
      "classes": [
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/druid"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/ranger"
