      "ritual": false
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/spells/burning-hands",
      "@type": "Spell",
      "name": "Burning Hands",
      "slug": "burning-hands",
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/sources/srd-5-2-1"
      },
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Spells",
        "section": "7.66",
        "heading": "Burning Hands",
        "lineStart": 7906,
        "lineEnd": 7919
      },
      "level": 1,
      "school": "Evocation",
      "classAvailability": [
        "Sorcerer",
        "Wizard"
      ],
      "castingTime": "Action",
      "range": "Self",
      "components": "V, S",
      "duration": "Instantaneous",
      "rulesText": "Level 1 Evocation (Sorcerer, Wizard)\n\nCasting Time: Action\nRange: Self\nComponents: V, S\nDuration: Instantaneous\n\nA thin sheet of flames shoots forth from you. Each creature in a 15-foot Cone makes a Dexterity saving throw, taking 3d6 Fire damage on a failed save or half as much damage on a successful one.\n\nFlammable objects in the Cone that aren't being worn or carried start burning.\n\nUsing a Higher-Level Spell Slot. The damage increases by 1d6 for each spell slot level above 1.",
      "classes": [
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/sorcerer"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/wizard"
        }
      ],
      "savingThrowAbility": "Dexterity",
