        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/ranger"
        }
      ],
      "scalesWithSlotLevel": true,
      "concentration": false,
      "ritual": false
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/spells/dancing-lights",
      "@type": "Spell",
      "name": "Dancing Lights",
      "slug": "dancing-lights",
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/sources/srd-5-2-1"
      },
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Spells",
        "section": "7.104",
        "heading": "Dancing Lights",
        "lineStart": 8531,
        "lineEnd": 8542
      },
      "level": 0,
      "school": "Illusion",
      "classAvailability": [
        "Bard",
        "Sorcerer",
        "Wizard"
      ],
      "castingTime": "Action",
      "range": "120 feet",
      "components": "V, S, M (a bit of phosphorus)",
      "duration": "Concentration, up to 1 minute",
      "rulesText": "Illusion Cantrip (Bard, Sorcerer, Wizard)\n\nCasting Time: Action\nRange: 120 feet\nComponents: V, S, M (a bit of phosphorus)\nDuration: Concentration, up to 1 minute\n\nYou create up to four torch-size lights within range, making them appear as torches, lanterns, or glowing orbs that hover for the duration. Alternatively, you combine the four lights into one glowing Medium form that is vaguely humanlike. Whichever form you choose, each light sheds Dim Light in a 10-foot radius.\n\nAs a Bonus Action, you can move the lights up to 60 feet to a space within range. A light must be within 20 feet of another light created by this spell, and a light vanishes if it exceeds the spell's range.",
      "classes": [
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/bard"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/sorcerer"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/wizard"
        }
      ],
      "scalesWithSlotLevel": false,
      "concentration": true,
      "ritual": false
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/spells/darkness",
      "@type": "Spell",
      "name": "Darkness",
      "slug": "darkness",
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/sources/srd-5-2-1"
      },
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Spells",
        "section": "7.105",
        "heading": "Darkness",
        "lineStart": 8544,
        "lineEnd": 8557
      },
      "level": 2,
      "school": "Evocation",
      "classAvailability": [
        "Sorcerer",
        "Warlock",
        "Wizard"
      ],
      "castingTime": "Action",
      "range": "60 feet",
      "components": "V, M (bat fur and a piece of coal)",
      "duration": "Concentration, up to 10 minutes",
      "rulesText": "Level 2 Evocation (Sorcerer, Warlock, Wizard)\n\nCasting Time: Action\nRange: 60 feet\nComponents: V, M (bat fur and a piece of coal)\nDuration: Concentration, up to 10 minutes\n\nFor the duration, magical Darkness spreads from a point within range and fills a 15-foot-radius Sphere. Darkvision can't see through it, and nonmagical light can't illuminate it.\n\nAlternatively, you cast the spell on an object that isn't being worn or carried, causing the Darkness to fill a 15-foot Emanation originating from that object. Covering that object with something opaque, such as a bowl or helm, blocks the Darkness.\n\nIf any of this spell's area overlaps with an area of Bright Light or Dim Light created by a spell of level 2 or lower, that other spell is dispelled.",
      "classes": [
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/sorcerer"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/warlock"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/wizard"
        }
      ],
      "scalesWithSlotLevel": false,
      "concentration": true,
      "ritual": false
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/spells/darkvision",
      "@type": "Spell",
      "name": "Darkvision",
      "slug": "darkvision",
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/sources/srd-5-2-1"
      },
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Spells",
        "section": "7.106",
        "heading": "Darkvision",
        "lineStart": 8559,
        "lineEnd": 8568
      },
      "level": 2,
      "school": "Transmutation",
      "classAvailability": [
        "Druid",
        "Ranger",
        "Sorcerer",
        "Wizard"
      ],
      "castingTime": "Action",
      "range": "Touch",
      "components": "V, S, M (a dried carrot)",
      "duration": "8 hours",
      "rulesText": "Level 2 Transmutation (Druid, Ranger, Sorcerer, Wizard)\n\nCasting Time: Action\nRange: Touch\nComponents: V, S, M (a dried carrot)\nDuration: 8 hours\n\nFor the duration, a willing creature you touch has Darkvision with a range of 150 feet.",
      "classes": [
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/druid"
