        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/ranger"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/sorcerer"
        }
      ],
      "scalesWithSlotLevel": false,
      "concentration": false,
      "ritual": false
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/spells/death-ward",
      "@type": "Spell",
      "name": "Death Ward",
      "slug": "death-ward",
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/sources/srd-5-2-1"
      },
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Spells",
        "section": "7.108",
        "heading": "Death Ward",
        "lineStart": 8587,
        "lineEnd": 8598
      },
      "level": 4,
      "school": "Abjuration",
      "classAvailability": [
        "Cleric",
        "Paladin"
      ],
      "castingTime": "Action",
      "range": "Touch",
      "components": "V, S",
      "duration": "8 hours",
      "rulesText": "Level 4 Abjuration (Cleric, Paladin)\n\nCasting Time: Action\nRange: Touch\nComponents: V, S\nDuration: 8 hours\n\nYou touch a creature and grant it a measure of protection from death. The first time the target would drop to 0 Hit Points before the spell ends, the target instead drops to 1 Hit Point, and the spell ends.\n\nIf the spell is still in effect when the target is subjected to an effect that would kill it instantly without dealing damage, that effect is negated against the target, and the spell ends.",
      "classes": [
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/cleric"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/paladin"
        }
      ],
      "scalesWithSlotLevel": false,
      "concentration": false,
      "ritual": false
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/spells/delayed-blast-fireball",
      "@type": "Spell",
      "name": "Delayed Blast Fireball",
      "slug": "delayed-blast-fireball",
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/sources/srd-5-2-1"
      },
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Spells",
        "section": "7.109",
        "heading": "Delayed Blast Fireball",
        "lineStart": 8600,
        "lineEnd": 8617
      },
      "level": 7,
      "school": "Evocation",
      "classAvailability": [
        "Sorcerer",
        "Wizard"
      ],
      "castingTime": "Action",
      "range": "150 feet",
      "components": "V, S, M (a ball of bat guano and sulfur)",
      "duration": "Concentration, up to 1 minute",
      "rulesText": "Level 7 Evocation (Sorcerer, Wizard)\n\nCasting Time: Action\nRange: 150 feet\nComponents: V, S, M (a ball of bat guano and sulfur)\nDuration: Concentration, up to 1 minute\n\nA beam of yellow light flashes from you, then condenses at a chosen point within range as a glowing bead for the duration. When the spell ends, the bead explodes, and each creature in a 20-foot-radius Sphere centered on that point makes a Dexterity saving throw. A creature takes Fire damage equal to the total accumulated damage on a failed save or half as much damage on a successful one.\n\nThe spell's base damage is 12d6, and the damage increases by 1d6 whenever your turn ends and the spell hasn't ended.\n\nIf a creature touches the glowing bead before the spell ends, that creature makes a Dexterity saving throw. On a failed save, the spell ends, causing the bead to explode. On a successful save, the creature can throw the bead up to 40 feet. If the thrown bead enters a creature's space or collides with a solid object, the spell ends, and the bead explodes.\n\nWhen the bead explodes, flammable objects in the explosion that aren't being worn or carried start burning.\n\nUsing a Higher-Level Spell Slot. The base damage increases by 1d6 for each spell slot level above 7.",
      "classes": [
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/sorcerer"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/wizard"
        }
      ],
      "savingThrowAbility": "Dexterity",
      "scalesWithSlotLevel": true,
      "concentration": true,
      "ritual": false
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/spells/demiplane",
      "@type": "Spell",
      "name": "Demiplane",
      "slug": "demiplane",
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/sources/srd-5-2-1"
      },
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Spells",
        "section": "7.110",
        "heading": "Demiplane",
        "lineStart": 8619,
        "lineEnd": 8632
      },
      "level": 8,
      "school": "Conjuration",
      "classAvailability": [
        "Sorcerer",
        "Warlock",
        "Wizard"
      ],
      "castingTime": "Action",
      "range": "60 feet",
      "components": "S",
      "duration": "1 hour",
      "rulesText": "Level 8 Conjuration (Sorcerer, Warlock, Wizard)\n\nCasting Time: Action\nRange: 60 feet\nComponents: S\nDuration: 1 hour\n\nYou create a shadowy Medium door on a flat solid surface that you can see within range. This door can be opened and closed, and it leads to a demiplane that is an empty room 30 feet in each dimension, made of wood or stone (your choice).\n\nWhen the spell ends, the door vanishes, and any objects inside the demiplane remain there. Any creatures inside also remain unless they opt to be shunted through the door as it vanishes, landing with the Prone condition in the unoccupied spaces closest to the door's former space.\n\nEach time you cast this spell, you can create a new demiplane or connect the shadowy door to a demiplane you created with a previous casting of this spell. Additionally, if you know the nature and contents of a demiplane created by a casting of this spell by another creature, you can connect the shadowy door to that demiplane instead.",
      "classes": [
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/sorcerer"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/warlock"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/wizard"
        }
      ],
      "scalesWithSlotLevel": false,
      "concentration": false,
      "ritual": false
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/spells/detect-evil-and-good",
      "@type": "Spell",
      "name": "Detect Evil and Good",
      "slug": "detect-evil-and-good",
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/sources/srd-5-2-1"
      },
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Spells",
        "section": "7.111",
        "heading": "Detect Evil and Good",
        "lineStart": 8634,
        "lineEnd": 8645
      },
      "level": 1,
      "school": "Divination",
      "classAvailability": [
        "Cleric",
        "Paladin"
      ],
      "castingTime": "Action",
      "range": "Self",
      "components": "V, S",
      "duration": "Concentration, up to 10 minutes",
      "rulesText": "Level 1 Divination (Cleric, Paladin)\n\nCasting Time: Action\nRange: Self\nComponents: V, S\nDuration: Concentration, up to 10 minutes\n\nFor the duration, you sense the location of any Aberration, Celestial, Elemental, Fey, Fiend, or Undead within 30 feet of yourself. You also sense whether the Hallow spell is active there and, if so, where.\n\nThe spell is blocked by 1 foot of stone, dirt, or wood; 1 inch of metal; or a thin sheet of lead.",
      "classes": [
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/cleric"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/paladin"
        }
      ],
      "scalesWithSlotLevel": false,
      "concentration": true,
      "ritual": false
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/spells/detect-magic",
      "@type": "Spell",
      "name": "Detect Magic",
      "slug": "detect-magic",
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/sources/srd-5-2-1"
      },
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Spells",
        "section": "7.112",
        "heading": "Detect Magic",
        "lineStart": 8647,
        "lineEnd": 8658
      },
      "level": 1,
      "school": "Divination",
      "classAvailability": [
        "Bard",
        "Cleric",
        "Druid",
        "Paladin",
        "Ranger",
        "Sorcerer",
        "Warlock",
        "Wizard"
      ],
      "castingTime": "Action or Ritual",
      "range": "Self",
      "components": "V, S",
      "duration": "Concentration, up to 10 minutes",
      "rulesText": "Level 1 Divination (Bard, Cleric, Druid, Paladin, Ranger, Sorcerer, Warlock, Wizard)\n\nCasting Time: Action or Ritual\nRange: Self\nComponents: V, S\nDuration: Concentration, up to 10 minutes\n\nFor the duration, you sense the presence of magical effects within 30 feet of yourself. If you sense such effects, you can take the Magic action to see a faint aura around any visible creature or object in the area that bears the magic, and if an effect was created by a spell, you learn the spell's school of magic.\n\nThe spell is blocked by 1 foot of stone, dirt, or wood; 1 inch of metal; or a thin sheet of lead.",
      "classes": [
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/bard"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/cleric"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/druid"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/paladin"
        },
        {
