        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/wizard"
        }
      ],
      "scalesWithSlotLevel": false,
      "concentration": true,
      "ritual": true
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/spells/detect-poison-and-disease",
      "@type": "Spell",
      "name": "Detect Poison and Disease",
      "slug": "detect-poison-and-disease",
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/sources/srd-5-2-1"
      },
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Spells",
        "section": "7.113",
        "heading": "Detect Poison and Disease",
        "lineStart": 8660,
        "lineEnd": 8673
      },
      "level": 1,
      "school": "Divination",
      "classAvailability": [
        "Cleric",
        "Druid",
        "Paladin",
        "Ranger"
      ],
      "castingTime": "Action or Ritual",
      "range": "Self",
      "components": "V, S, M (a yew leaf)",
      "duration": "Concentration, up to 10 minutes",
      "rulesText": "Level 1 Divination (Cleric, Druid, Paladin, Ranger)\n\nCasting Time: Action or Ritual\nRange: Self\nComponents: V, S, M (a yew leaf)\nDuration: Concentration, up to 10 minutes\n\nFor the duration, you sense the location of poisons, poisonous or venomous creatures, and magical\n\ncontagions within 30 feet of yourself. You sense the kind of poison, creature, or contagion in each case.\n\nThe spell is blocked by 1 foot of stone, dirt, or wood; 1 inch of metal; or a thin sheet of lead.",
      "classes": [
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/cleric"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/druid"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/paladin"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/ranger"
        }
      ],
      "scalesWithSlotLevel": false,
      "concentration": true,
      "ritual": true
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/spells/detect-thoughts",
      "@type": "Spell",
      "name": "Detect Thoughts",
      "slug": "detect-thoughts",
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/sources/srd-5-2-1"
      },
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Spells",
        "section": "7.114",
        "heading": "Detect Thoughts",
        "lineStart": 8675,
        "lineEnd": 8692
      },
      "level": 2,
      "school": "Divination",
      "classAvailability": [
        "Bard",
        "Sorcerer",
        "Wizard"
      ],
      "castingTime": "Action",
      "range": "Self",
      "components": "V, S, M (I Copper Piece)",
      "duration": "Concentration, up to 1 minute",
      "rulesText": "Level 2 Divination (Bard, Sorcerer, Wizard)\n\nCasting Time: Action\nRange: Self\nComponents: V, S, M (I Copper Piece)\nDuration: Concentration, up to 1 minute\n\nYou activate one of the effects below. Until the spell ends, you can activate either effect as a Magic action on your later turns.\n\nSense Thoughts. You sense the presence of thoughts within 30 feet of yourself that belong to creatures that know languages or are telepathic. You don't read the thoughts, but you know that a thinking creature is present.\n\nThe spell is blocked by 1 foot of stone, dirt, or wood; 1 inch of metal; or a thin sheet of lead.\n\nRead Thoughts. Target one creature you can see within 30 feet of yourself or one creature within 30 feet of yourself that you detected with the Sense Thoughts option. You learn what is most on the target's mind right now. If the target doesn't know any languages and isn't telepathic, you learn nothing.\n\nAs a Magic action on your next turn, you can try to probe deeper into the target's mind. If you probe deeper, the target makes a Wisdom saving throw. On a failed save, you discern the target's reasoning, emotions, and something that looms large in its mind (such as a worry, love, or hate). On a successful save, the spell ends. Either way, the target knows that you are probing into its mind, and until you shift your attention away from the target's mind, the target can take an action on its turn to make an Intelligence (Arcana) check against your spell save DC, ending the spell on a success.",
      "classes": [
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/bard"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/sorcerer"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/wizard"
        }
      ],
      "savingThrowAbility": "Wisdom",
      "scalesWithSlotLevel": false,
      "concentration": true,
      "ritual": false
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/spells/dimension-door",
      "@type": "Spell",
      "name": "Dimension Door",
      "slug": "dimension-door",
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/sources/srd-5-2-1"
      },
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Spells",
        "section": "7.115",
        "heading": "Dimension Door",
        "lineStart": 8694,
        "lineEnd": 8707
      },
      "level": 4,
      "school": "Conjuration",
      "classAvailability": [
        "Bard",
        "Sorcerer",
        "Warlock",
        "Wizard"
      ],
      "castingTime": "Action",
      "range": "500 feet",
      "components": "V",
      "duration": "Instantaneous",
      "rulesText": "Level 4 Conjuration (Bard, Sorcerer, Warlock, Wizard)\n\nCasting Time: Action\nRange: 500 feet\nComponents: V\nDuration: Instantaneous\n\nYou teleport to a location within range. You arrive at exactly the spot desired. It can be a place you can see, one you can visualize, or one you can describe by stating distance and direction, such as “200 feet straight downward” or “300 feet upward to the northwest at a 45-degree angle.”\n\nYou can also teleport one willing creature. The creature must be within 5 feet of you when you teleport, and it teleports to a space within 5 feet of your destination space.\n\nIf you, the other creature, or both would arrive in a space occupied by a creature or completely filled by one or more objects, you and any creature traveling with you each take 4d6 Force damage, and the teleportation fails.",
      "classes": [
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/bard"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/sorcerer"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/warlock"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/wizard"
        }
      ],
      "damage": [
        {
          "damageType": "Force",
          "damageRoll": {
            "expression": "4d6",
            "count": 4,
            "sides": 6
          }
        }
      ],
      "scalesWithSlotLevel": false,
      "concentration": false,
      "ritual": false
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/spells/disguise-self",
      "@type": "Spell",
      "name": "Disguise Self",
      "slug": "disguise-self",
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/sources/srd-5-2-1"
      },
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Spells",
        "section": "7.116",
        "heading": "Disguise Self",
        "lineStart": 8709,
        "lineEnd": 8722
      },
      "level": 1,
      "school": "Illusion",
      "classAvailability": [
        "Bard",
        "Sorcerer",
        "Wizard"
      ],
      "castingTime": "Action",
      "range": "Self",
      "components": "V, S",
      "duration": "1 hour",
      "rulesText": "Level 1 Illusion (Bard, Sorcerer, Wizard)\n\nCasting Time: Action\nRange: Self\nComponents: V, S\nDuration: 1 hour\n\nYou make yourself - including your clothing, armor, weapons, and other belongings on your person - look different until the spell ends. You can seem 1 foot shorter or taller and can appear heavier or lighter. You must adopt a form that has the same basic arrangement of limbs as you have. Otherwise, the extent of the illusion is up to you.\n\nThe changes wrought by this spell fail to hold up to physical inspection. For example, if you use this spell to add a hat to your outfit, objects pass through the hat, and anyone who touches it would feel nothing.\n\nTo discern that you are disguised, a creature must take the Study action to inspect your appearance and succeed on an Intelligence (Investigation) check against your spell save DC.",
      "classes": [
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/bard"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/sorcerer"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/wizard"
        }
      ],
      "scalesWithSlotLevel": false,
      "concentration": false,
      "ritual": false
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/spells/disintegrate",
      "@type": "Spell",
      "name": "Disintegrate",
      "slug": "disintegrate",
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/sources/srd-5-2-1"
      },
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Spells",
        "section": "7.117",
        "heading": "Disintegrate",
        "lineStart": 8724,
        "lineEnd": 8739
      },
      "level": 6,
      "school": "Transmutation",
      "classAvailability": [
        "Sorcerer",
        "Wizard"
      ],
      "castingTime": "Action",
      "range": "60 feet",
      "components": "V, S, M (a lodestone and dust)",
      "duration": "Instantaneous",
      "rulesText": "Level 6 Transmutation (Sorcerer, Wizard)\n\nCasting Time: Action\nRange: 60 feet\nComponents: V, S, M (a lodestone and dust)\nDuration: Instantaneous\n\nYou launch a green ray at a target you can see within range. The target can be a creature, a non-magical object, or a creation of magical force, such as the wall created by Wall of Force.\n\nA creature targeted by this spell makes a Dexterity saving throw. On a failed save, the target takes 10d6 + 40 Force damage. If this damage reduces it to 0 Hit Points, it and everything nonmagical it is wearing and carrying are disintegrated into gray dust. The target can be revived only by a True Resurrection or a Wish spell.\n\nThis spell automatically disintegrates a Large or smaller nonmagical object or a creation of magical force. If such a target is Huge or larger, this spell disintegrates a 10-foot-Cube portion of it.\n\nUsing a Higher-Level Spell Slot. The damage increases by 3d6 for each spell slot level above 6.",
      "classes": [
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/sorcerer"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/wizard"
        }
      ],
      "savingThrowAbility": "Dexterity",
      "damage": [
        {
          "damageType": "Force",
          "damageRoll": {
            "expression": "10d6+40",
            "count": 10,
            "sides": 6,
            "modifier": 40
          }
        }
      ],
      "scalesWithSlotLevel": true,
      "concentration": false,
      "ritual": false
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/spells/dispel-evil-and-good",
      "@type": "Spell",
      "name": "Dispel Evil and Good",
      "slug": "dispel-evil-and-good",
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/sources/srd-5-2-1"
      },
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Spells",
        "section": "7.118",
        "heading": "Dispel Evil and Good",
        "lineStart": 8741,
        "lineEnd": 8754
      },
      "level": 5,
      "school": "Abjuration",
      "classAvailability": [
        "Cleric",
        "Paladin"
      ],
      "castingTime": "Action",
      "range": "Self",
      "components": "V, S, M (powdered silver and iron)",
      "duration": "Concentration, up to 1 minute",
      "rulesText": "Level 5 Abjuration (Cleric, Paladin)\n\nCasting Time: Action\nRange: Self\nComponents: V, S, M (powdered silver and iron)\nDuration: Concentration, up to 1 minute\n\nFor the duration, Celestials, Elementals, Fey, Fiends, and Undead have Disadvantage on attack rolls against you. You can end the spell early by using either of the following special functions.\n\nBreak Enchantment. As a Magic action, you touch a creature that is possessed by or has the Charmed or Frightened condition from one or more creatures of the types above. The target is no longer possessed, Charmed, or Frightened by such creatures.\n\nDismissal. As a Magic action, you target one creature you can see within 5 feet of you that has one of the creature types above. The target must succeed on a Charisma saving throw or be sent back to its home plane if it isn't there already. If they aren't on their home plane, Undead are sent to the Shadowfell, and Fey are sent to the Feywild.",
      "classes": [
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/cleric"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/paladin"
        }
      ],
      "savingThrowAbility": "Charisma",
      "scalesWithSlotLevel": false,
      "concentration": true,
      "ritual": false
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/spells/dispel-magic",
      "@type": "Spell",
      "name": "Dispel Magic",
      "slug": "dispel-magic",
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/sources/srd-5-2-1"
      },
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Spells",
        "section": "7.119",
        "heading": "Dispel Magic",
        "lineStart": 8756,
        "lineEnd": 8767
      },
      "level": 3,
      "school": "Abjuration",
      "classAvailability": [
        "Bard",
        "Cleric",
        "Druid",
        "Paladin",
        "Ranger",
        "Sorcerer",
        "Warlock",
        "Wizard"
      ],
      "castingTime": "Action",
      "range": "120 feet",
      "components": "V, S",
      "duration": "Instantaneous",
      "rulesText": "Level 3 Abjuration (Bard, Cleric, Druid, Paladin, Ranger, Sorcerer, Warlock, Wizard)\n\nCasting Time: Action\nRange: 120 feet\nComponents: V, S\nDuration: Instantaneous\n\nChoose one creature, object, or magical effect within range. Any ongoing spell of level 3 or lower on the target ends. For each ongoing spell of level 4 or higher on the target, make an ability check using your spellcasting ability (DC 10 plus that spell's level). On a successful check, the spell ends.\n\nUsing a Higher-Level Spell Slot. You automatically end a spell on the target if the spell's level is equal to or less than the level of the spell slot you use.",
      "classes": [
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/bard"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/cleric"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/druid"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/paladin"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/ranger"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/sorcerer"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/warlock"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/wizard"
        }
      ],
      "scalesWithSlotLevel": true,
      "concentration": false,
      "ritual": false
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/spells/dissonant-whispers",
      "@type": "Spell",
      "name": "Dissonant Whispers",
      "slug": "dissonant-whispers",
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/sources/srd-5-2-1"
      },
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Spells",
        "section": "7.120",
        "heading": "Dissonant Whispers",
        "lineStart": 8769,
        "lineEnd": 8780
      },
      "level": 1,
      "school": "Enchantment",
      "classAvailability": [
        "Bard"
      ],
      "castingTime": "Action",
      "range": "60 feet",
      "components": "V",
      "duration": "Instantaneous",
      "rulesText": "Level 1 Enchantment (Bard)\n\nCasting Time: Action\nRange: 60 feet\nComponents: V\nDuration: Instantaneous\n\nOne creature of your choice that you can see within range hears a discordant melody in its mind. The target makes a Wisdom saving throw. On a failed save, it takes 3d6 Psychic damage and must immediately use its Reaction, if available, to move as far away from you as it can, using the safest route. On a successful save, the target takes half as much damage only.\n\nUsing a Higher-Level Spell Slot. The damage increases by 1d6 for each spell slot level above 1.",
      "classes": [
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/bard"
        }
      ],
      "savingThrowAbility": "Wisdom",
      "damage": [
        {
          "damageType": "Psychic",
          "damageRoll": {
            "expression": "3d6",
            "count": 3,
            "sides": 6
          }
        }
      ],
      "scalesWithSlotLevel": true,
      "concentration": false,
      "ritual": false
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/spells/divination",
      "@type": "Spell",
      "name": "Divination",
      "slug": "divination",
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/sources/srd-5-2-1"
      },
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Spells",
        "section": "7.121",
        "heading": "Divination",
        "lineStart": 8782,
        "lineEnd": 8793
      },
      "level": 4,
      "school": "Divination",
      "classAvailability": [
        "Cleric",
        "Druid",
        "Wizard"
      ],
      "castingTime": "Action or Ritual",
      "range": "Self",
      "components": "V, S, M (incense worth 25+ GP, which the spell consumes)",
      "duration": "Instantaneous",
      "rulesText": "Level 4 Divination (Cleric, Druid, Wizard)\n\nCasting Time: Action or Ritual\nRange: Self\nComponents: V, S, M (incense worth 25+ GP, which the spell consumes)\nDuration: Instantaneous\n\nThis spell puts you in contact with a god or a god's servants. You ask one question about a specific goal, event, or activity to occur within 7 days. The GM offers a truthful reply, which might be a short phrase or cryptic rhyme. The spell doesn't account for circumstances that might change the answer, such as the casting of other spells.\n\nIf you cast the spell more than once before finishing a Long Rest, there is a cumulative 25 percent chance for each casting after the first that you get no answer.",
      "classes": [
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/cleric"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/druid"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/wizard"
        }
      ],
      "scalesWithSlotLevel": false,
      "concentration": false,
      "ritual": true
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/spells/divine-favor",
      "@type": "Spell",
      "name": "Divine Favor",
      "slug": "divine-favor",
      "source": {
