      "rulesText": "Level 1 Transmutation (Paladin)\n\nCasting Time: Bonus Action\nRange: Self\nComponents: V, S\nDuration: 1 minute\n\nUntil the spell ends, your attacks with weapons deal an extra 1d4 Radiant damage on a hit.",
