    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/spells/divine-smite",
      "@type": "Spell",
      "name": "Divine Smite",
      "slug": "divine-smite",
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/sources/srd-5-2-1"
      },
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Spells",
        "section": "7.123",
        "heading": "Divine Smite",
        "lineStart": 8806,
        "lineEnd": 8817
      },
      "level": 1,
      "school": "Evocation",
      "classAvailability": [
        "Paladin"
      ],
      "castingTime": "Bonus Action, which you take immediately after hitting a target with a Melee weapon or an Unarmed Strike",
      "range": "Self",
      "components": "V",
      "duration": "Instantaneous",
      "rulesText": "Level 1 Evocation (Paladin)\n\nCasting Time: Bonus Action, which you take immediately after hitting a target with a Melee weapon or an Unarmed Strike\nRange: Self\nComponents: V\nDuration: Instantaneous\n\nThe target takes an extra 2d8 Radiant damage from the attack. The damage increases by 1d8 if the target is a Fiend or an Undead.\n\nUsing a Higher-Level Spell Slot. The damage increases by 1d8 for each spell slot level above 1.",
      "classes": [
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/paladin"
        }
      ],
      "damage": [
        {
          "damageType": "Radiant",
          "damageRoll": {
            "expression": "2d8",
            "count": 2,
            "sides": 8
          }
        }
      ],
      "scalesWithSlotLevel": true,
      "concentration": false,
      "ritual": false
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/spells/divine-word",
      "@type": "Spell",
      "name": "Divine Word",
      "slug": "divine-word",
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/sources/srd-5-2-1"
      },
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Spells",
        "section": "7.124",
        "heading": "Divine Word",
        "lineStart": 8819,
        "lineEnd": 8839
      },
      "level": 7,
      "school": "Evocation",
      "classAvailability": [
        "Cleric"
      ],
      "castingTime": "Bonus Action",
      "range": "30 feet",
      "components": "V",
      "duration": "Instantaneous",
      "rulesText": "Level 7 Evocation (Cleric)\n\nCasting Time: Bonus Action\nRange: 30 feet\nComponents: V\nDuration: Instantaneous\n\nYou utter a word imbued with power from the Upper Planes. Each creature of your choice in range makes a Charisma saving throw. On a failed save, a target that has 50 Hit Points or fewer suffers an effect based on its current Hit Points, as shown in the Divine Word Effects table. Regardless of its Hit Points, a Celestial, an Elemental, a Fey, or a Fiend\n\ntarget that fails its save is forced back to its plane of origin (if it isn't there already) and can't return to the current plane for 24 hours by any means short of a Wish spell.\n\nDivine Word Effects\n\n| Hit Points | Effect                                                                   |\n| :--------- | :----------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 0–20       | The target dies.                                                         |\n| 21–30      | The target has the Blinded, Deafened, and Stunned conditions for 1 hour. |\n| 31–40      | The target has the Blinded and Deafened conditions for 10 minutes.       |\n| 41–50      | The target has the Deafened condition for 1 minute.                      |",
      "classes": [
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/cleric"
        }
      ],
      "savingThrowAbility": "Charisma",
      "scalesWithSlotLevel": false,
      "concentration": false,
      "ritual": false
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/spells/dominate-beast",
      "@type": "Spell",
      "name": "Dominate Beast",
      "slug": "dominate-beast",
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/sources/srd-5-2-1"
      },
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Spells",
        "section": "7.125",
        "heading": "Dominate Beast",
        "lineStart": 8841,
        "lineEnd": 8856
      },
      "level": 4,
      "school": "Enchantment",
      "classAvailability": [
        "Druid",
        "Ranger",
        "Sorcerer"
      ],
      "castingTime": "Action",
      "range": "60 feet",
      "components": "V, S",
      "duration": "Concentration, up to 1 minute",
      "rulesText": "Level 4 Enchantment (Druid, Ranger, Sorcerer)\n\nCasting Time: Action\nRange: 60 feet\nComponents: V, S\nDuration: Concentration, up to 1 minute\n\nOne Beast you can see within range must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw or have the Charmed condition for the duration. The target has Advantage on the save if you or your allies are fighting it. Whenever the target takes damage, it repeats the save, ending the spell on itself on a success.\n\nYou have a telepathic link with the Charmed target while the two of you are on the same plane of existence. On your turn, you can use this link to issue commands to the target (no action required), such as “Attack that creature,” “Move over there,” or “Fetch that object.” The target does its best to obey on its turn. If it completes an order and doesn’t receive further direction from you, it acts and moves as it likes, focusing on protecting itself.\n\nYou can command the target to take a Reaction but must take your own Reaction to do so.\n\nUsing a Higher-Level Spell Slot. Your Concentration can last longer with a spell slot of level 5 (up to 10 minutes), 6 (up to 1 hour), or 7+ (up to 8 hours).",
      "classes": [
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/druid"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/ranger"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/sorcerer"
        }
      ],
      "savingThrowAbility": "Wisdom",
      "scalesWithSlotLevel": true,
      "concentration": true,
      "ritual": false
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/spells/dominate-monster",
      "@type": "Spell",
      "name": "Dominate Monster",
      "slug": "dominate-monster",
