    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/spells/heroism",
      "@type": "Spell",
      "name": "Heroism",
      "slug": "heroism",
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/sources/srd-5-2-1"
      },
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Spells",
        "section": "7.197",
        "heading": "Heroism",
        "lineStart": 10011,
        "lineEnd": 10022
      },
      "level": 1,
      "school": "Enchantment",
      "classAvailability": [
        "Bard",
        "Paladin"
      ],
      "castingTime": "Action",
      "range": "Touch",
      "components": "V, S",
      "duration": "Concentration, up to 1 minute",
      "rulesText": "Level 1 Enchantment (Bard, Paladin)\n\nCasting Time: Action\nRange: Touch\nComponents: V, S\nDuration: Concentration, up to 1 minute\n\nA willing creature you touch is imbued with bravery. Until the spell ends, the creature is immune to the Frightened condition and gains Temporary Hit Points equal to your spellcasting ability modifier at the start of each of its turns.\n\nUsing a Higher-Level Spell Slot. You can target one additional creature for each spell slot level above 1.",
      "classes": [
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/bard"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/paladin"
        }
      ],
      "scalesWithSlotLevel": true,
      "concentration": true,
      "ritual": false
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/spells/hex",
      "@type": "Spell",
      "name": "Hex",
      "slug": "hex",
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/sources/srd-5-2-1"
      },
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Spells",
        "section": "7.198",
        "heading": "Hex",
        "lineStart": 10024,
        "lineEnd": 10037
      },
      "level": 1,
      "school": "Enchantment",
      "classAvailability": [
        "Warlock"
      ],
      "castingTime": "Bonus Action",
      "range": "90 feet",
      "components": "V, S, M (the petrified eye of a newt)",
      "duration": "Concentration, up to 1 hour",
      "rulesText": "Level 1 Enchantment (Warlock)\n\nCasting Time: Bonus Action\nRange: 90 feet\nComponents: V, S, M (the petrified eye of a newt)\nDuration: Concentration, up to 1 hour\n\nYou place a curse on a creature that you can see within range. Until the spell ends, you deal an extra 1d6 Necrotic damage to the target whenever you hit it with an attack roll. Also, choose one ability when you cast the spell. The target has Disadvantage on ability checks made with the chosen ability.\n\nIf the target drops to 0 Hit Points before this spell ends, you can take a Bonus Action on a later turn to curse a new creature.\n\nUsing a Higher-Level Spell Slot. Your Concentration can last longer with a spell slot of level 2 (up to 4 hours), 3–4 (up to 8 hours), or 5+ (24 hours).",
      "classes": [
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/warlock"
        }
      ],
      "damage": [
        {
          "damageType": "Necrotic",
          "damageRoll": {
            "expression": "1d6",
            "count": 1,
            "sides": 6
          }
        }
      ],
      "scalesWithSlotLevel": true,
      "concentration": true,
      "ritual": false
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/spells/hideous-laughter",
      "@type": "Spell",
      "name": "Hideous Laughter",
      "slug": "hideous-laughter",
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/sources/srd-5-2-1"
      },
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Spells",
        "section": "7.199",
        "heading": "Hideous Laughter",
        "lineStart": 10039,
        "lineEnd": 10052
      },
      "level": 1,
      "school": "Enchantment",
      "classAvailability": [
        "Bard",
        "Warlock",
        "Wizard"
      ],
      "castingTime": "Action",
      "range": "30 feet",
      "components": "V, S, M (a tart and a feather)",
      "duration": "Concentration, up to 1 minute",
      "rulesText": "Level 1 Enchantment (Bard, Warlock, Wizard)\n\nCasting Time: Action\nRange: 30 feet\nComponents: V, S, M (a tart and a feather)\nDuration: Concentration, up to 1 minute\n\nOne creature of your choice that you can see within range makes a Wisdom saving throw. On a failed save, it has the Prone and Incapacitated conditions for the duration. During that time, it laughs uncontrollably if it's capable of laughter, and it can't end the Prone condition on itself.\n\nAt the end of each of its turns and each time it takes damage, it makes another Wisdom saving throw. The target has Advantage on the save if the save is triggered by damage. On a successful save, the spell ends.\n\nUsing a Higher-Level Spell Slot. You can target one additional creature for each spell slot level above 1.",
      "classes": [
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/bard"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/warlock"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/wizard"
        }
      ],
      "savingThrowAbility": "Wisdom",
      "scalesWithSlotLevel": true,
      "concentration": true,
      "ritual": false
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/spells/hold-monster",
      "@type": "Spell",
      "name": "Hold Monster",
      "slug": "hold-monster",
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/sources/srd-5-2-1"
      },
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Spells",
        "section": "7.200",
        "heading": "Hold Monster",
        "lineStart": 10054,
        "lineEnd": 10065
      },
      "level": 5,
      "school": "Enchantment",
      "classAvailability": [
        "Bard",
        "Sorcerer",
        "Warlock",
        "Wizard"
      ],
      "castingTime": "Action",
      "range": "90 feet",
      "components": "V, S, M (a straight piece of iron)",
      "duration": "Concentration, up to 1 minute",
      "rulesText": "Level 5 Enchantment (Bard, Sorcerer, Warlock, Wizard)\n\nCasting Time: Action\nRange: 90 feet\nComponents: V, S, M (a straight piece of iron)\nDuration: Concentration, up to 1 minute\n\nChoose a creature that you can see within range. The target must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw or have the Paralyzed condition for the duration. At the end of each of its turns, the target repeats the save, ending the spell on itself on a success.\n\nUsing a Higher-Level Spell Slot. You can target one additional creature for each spell slot level above 5.",
      "classes": [
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/bard"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/sorcerer"
