    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/spells/holy-aura",
      "@type": "Spell",
      "name": "Holy Aura",
      "slug": "holy-aura",
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/sources/srd-5-2-1"
      },
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Spells",
        "section": "7.202",
        "heading": "Holy Aura",
        "lineStart": 10080,
        "lineEnd": 10089
      },
      "level": 8,
      "school": "Abjuration",
      "classAvailability": [
        "Cleric"
      ],
      "castingTime": "Action",
      "range": "Self",
      "components": "V, S, M (a reliquary worth 1,000+ GP)",
      "duration": "Concentration, up to 1 minute",
      "rulesText": "Level 8 Abjuration (Cleric)\n\nCasting Time: Action\nRange: Self\nComponents: V, S, M (a reliquary worth 1,000+ GP)\nDuration: Concentration, up to 1 minute\n\nFor the duration, you emit an aura in a 30-foot Emanation. While in the aura, creatures of your choice have Advantage on all saving throws, and other creatures have Disadvantage on attack rolls against them. In addition, when a Fiend or an Undead hits an affected creature with a melee attack roll, the attacker must succeed on a Constitution saving throw or have the Blinded condition until the end of its next turn.",
      "classes": [
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/cleric"
        }
      ],
      "savingThrowAbility": "Constitution",
      "scalesWithSlotLevel": false,
      "concentration": true,
      "ritual": false
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/spells/hunters-mark",
      "@type": "Spell",
      "name": "Hunter's Mark",
      "slug": "hunters-mark",
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/sources/srd-5-2-1"
      },
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Spells",
        "section": "7.203",
        "heading": "Hunter's Mark",
        "lineStart": 10091,
        "lineEnd": 10104
      },
      "level": 1,
      "school": "Divination",
      "classAvailability": [
        "Ranger"
      ],
      "castingTime": "Bonus Action",
      "range": "90 feet",
      "components": "V",
      "duration": "Concentration, up to 1 hour",
      "rulesText": "Level 1 Divination (Ranger)\n\nCasting Time: Bonus Action\nRange: 90 feet\nComponents: V\nDuration: Concentration, up to 1 hour\n\nYou magically mark one creature you can see within range as your quarry. Until the spell ends, you deal an extra 1d6 Force damage to the target whenever you hit it with an attack roll. You also have Advantage on any Wisdom (Perception or Survival) check you make to find it.\n\nIf the target drops to 0 Hit Points before this spell ends, you can take a Bonus Action to move the mark to a new creature you can see within range.\n\nUsing a Higher-Level Spell Slot. Your Concentration can last longer with a spell slot of level 3–4 (up to 8 hours) or 5+ (up to 24 hours).",
      "classes": [
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/ranger"
        }
      ],
      "damage": [
        {
          "damageType": "Force",
          "damageRoll": {
            "expression": "1d6",
            "count": 1,
            "sides": 6
          }
        }
      ],
      "scalesWithSlotLevel": true,
      "concentration": true,
      "ritual": false
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/spells/hypnotic-pattern",
      "@type": "Spell",
      "name": "Hypnotic Pattern",
      "slug": "hypnotic-pattern",
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/sources/srd-5-2-1"
      },
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Spells",
        "section": "7.204",
        "heading": "Hypnotic Pattern",
        "lineStart": 10106,
        "lineEnd": 10117
      },
      "level": 3,
      "school": "Illusion",
      "classAvailability": [
        "Bard",
        "Sorcerer",
        "Warlock",
        "Wizard"
      ],
      "castingTime": "Action",
      "range": "120 feet",
      "components": "S, M (a pinch of confetti)",
      "duration": "Concentration, up to 1 minute",
      "rulesText": "Level 3 Illusion (Bard, Sorcerer, Warlock, Wizard)\n\nCasting Time: Action\nRange: 120 feet\nComponents: S, M (a pinch of confetti)\nDuration: Concentration, up to 1 minute\n\nYou create a twisting pattern of colors in a 30-foot Cube within range. The pattern appears for a moment and vanishes. Each creature in the area who can see the pattern must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw or have the Charmed condition for the duration. While Charmed, the creature has the Incapacitated condition and a Speed of 0.\n\nThe spell ends for an affected creature if it takes any damage or if someone else uses an action to shake the creature out of its stupor.",
      "classes": [
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/bard"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/sorcerer"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/warlock"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/wizard"
        }
      ],
      "savingThrowAbility": "Wisdom",
      "scalesWithSlotLevel": false,
      "concentration": true,
      "ritual": false
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/spells/ice-knife",
      "@type": "Spell",
      "name": "Ice Knife",
      "slug": "ice-knife",
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/sources/srd-5-2-1"
      },
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Spells",
        "section": "7.205",
        "heading": "Ice Knife",
        "lineStart": 10119,
        "lineEnd": 10130
      },
      "level": 1,
      "school": "Conjuration",
      "classAvailability": [
        "Druid",
        "Sorcerer",
        "Wizard"
      ],
      "castingTime": "Action",
      "range": "60 feet",
      "components": "S, M (a drop of water or a piece of ice)",
      "duration": "Instantaneous",
      "rulesText": "Level 1 Conjuration (Druid, Sorcerer, Wizard)\n\nCasting Time: Action\nRange: 60 feet\nComponents: S, M (a drop of water or a piece of ice)\nDuration: Instantaneous\n\nYou create a shard of ice and fling it at one creature within range. Make a ranged spell attack against the target. On a hit, the target takes 1d10 Piercing damage. Hit or miss, the shard then explodes. The target and each creature within 5 feet of it must succeed on a Dexterity saving throw or take 2d6 Cold damage.\n\nUsing a Higher-Level Spell Slot. The Cold damage increases by 1d6 for each spell slot level above 1.",
      "classes": [
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/druid"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/sorcerer"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/wizard"
        }
      ],
      "savingThrowAbility": "Dexterity",
      "damage": [
        {
          "damageType": "Piercing",
          "damageRoll": {
            "expression": "1d10",
            "count": 1,
            "sides": 10
          }
        },
        {
          "damageType": "Cold",
          "damageRoll": {
            "expression": "2d6",
            "count": 2,
            "sides": 6
          }
        }
      ],
      "scalesWithSlotLevel": true,
      "concentration": false,
      "ritual": false
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/spells/ice-storm",
      "@type": "Spell",
      "name": "Ice Storm",
      "slug": "ice-storm",
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/sources/srd-5-2-1"
      },
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Spells",
        "section": "7.206",
        "heading": "Ice Storm",
        "lineStart": 10132,
        "lineEnd": 10145
      },
      "level": 4,
      "school": "Evocation",
      "classAvailability": [
        "Druid",
        "Sorcerer",
        "Wizard"
      ],
      "castingTime": "Action",
      "range": "300 feet",
      "components": "V, S, M (a mitten)",
      "duration": "Instantaneous",
      "rulesText": "Level 4 Evocation (Druid, Sorcerer, Wizard)\n\nCasting Time: Action\nRange: 300 feet\nComponents: V, S, M (a mitten)\nDuration: Instantaneous\n\nHail falls in a 20-foot-radius, 40-foot-high Cylinder centered on a point within range. Each creature in the Cylinder makes a Dexterity saving throw. A creature takes 2d10 Bludgeoning damage and 4d6 Cold damage on a failed save or half as much damage on a successful one.\n\nHailstones turn ground in the Cylinder into Difficult Terrain until the end of your next turn.\n\nUsing a Higher-Level Spell Slot. The Bludgeoning damage increases by 1d10 for each spell slot level above 4.",
      "classes": [
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/druid"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/sorcerer"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/wizard"
        }
      ],
      "savingThrowAbility": "Dexterity",
      "damage": [
        {
          "damageType": "Bludgeoning",
          "damageRoll": {
            "expression": "2d10",
            "count": 2,
            "sides": 10
          }
        },
        {
          "damageType": "Cold",
          "damageRoll": {
            "expression": "4d6",
            "count": 4,
            "sides": 6
          }
        }
      ],
      "scalesWithSlotLevel": true,
      "concentration": false,
      "ritual": false
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/spells/identify",
      "@type": "Spell",
      "name": "Identify",
      "slug": "identify",
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/sources/srd-5-2-1"
      },
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Spells",
        "section": "7.207",
        "heading": "Identify",
        "lineStart": 10147,
        "lineEnd": 10158
      },
      "level": 1,
      "school": "Divination",
      "classAvailability": [
        "Bard",
        "Wizard"
      ],
      "castingTime": "1 minute or Ritual",
      "range": "Touch",
      "components": "V, S, M (a pearl worth 100+ GP)",
      "duration": "Instantaneous",
      "rulesText": "Level 1 Divination (Bard, Wizard)\n\nCasting Time: 1 minute or Ritual\nRange: Touch\nComponents: V, S, M (a pearl worth 100+ GP)\nDuration: Instantaneous\n\nYou touch an object throughout the spell's casting. If the object is a magic item or some other magical object, you learn its properties and how to use them, whether it requires Attunement, and how many charges it has, if any. You learn whether any ongoing spells are affecting the item and what they are. If the item was created by a spell, you learn that spell's name.\n\nIf you instead touch a creature throughout the casting, you learn which ongoing spells, if any, are currently affecting it.",
      "classes": [
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/bard"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/wizard"
        }
      ],
      "scalesWithSlotLevel": false,
      "concentration": false,
      "ritual": true
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/spells/illusory-script",
      "@type": "Spell",
      "name": "Illusory Script",
      "slug": "illusory-script",
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/sources/srd-5-2-1"
      },
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Spells",
        "section": "7.208",
        "heading": "Illusory Script",
        "lineStart": 10160,
        "lineEnd": 10173
      },
      "level": 1,
      "school": "Illusion",
      "classAvailability": [
        "Bard",
        "Warlock",
        "Wizard"
      ],
      "castingTime": "1 minute or Ritual",
      "range": "Touch",
      "components": "S, M (ink worth 10+ GP, which the spell consumes)",
      "duration": "10 days",
      "rulesText": "Level 1 Illusion (Bard, Warlock, Wizard)\n\nCasting Time: 1 minute or Ritual\nRange: Touch\nComponents: S, M (ink worth 10+ GP, which the spell consumes)\nDuration: 10 days\n\nYou write on parchment, paper, or another suitable material and imbue it with an illusion that lasts for the duration. To you and any creatures you designate when you cast the spell, the writing appears normal, seems to be written in your hand, and conveys whatever meaning you intended when you wrote the text. To all others, the writing appears as if it were written in an unknown or magical script that is unintelligible. Alternatively, the illusion can alter the meaning, handwriting, and language of the text, though the language must be one you know.\n\nIf the spell is dispelled, the original script and the illusion both disappear.\n\nA creature that has Truesight can read the hidden message.",
      "classes": [
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/bard"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/warlock"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/wizard"
        }
      ],
      "scalesWithSlotLevel": false,
      "concentration": false,
      "ritual": true
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/spells/imprisonment",
      "@type": "Spell",
      "name": "Imprisonment",
      "slug": "imprisonment",
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/sources/srd-5-2-1"
      },
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Spells",
        "section": "7.209",
        "heading": "Imprisonment",
        "lineStart": 10175,
        "lineEnd": 10202
      },
      "level": 9,
      "school": "Abjuration",
      "classAvailability": [
        "Warlock",
        "Wizard"
      ],
      "castingTime": "1 minute",
      "range": "30 feet",
      "components": "V, S, M (a statuette of the target worth 5,000+ GP)",
      "duration": "Until dispelled",
      "rulesText": "Level 9 Abjuration (Warlock, Wizard)\n\nCasting Time: 1 minute\nRange: 30 feet\nComponents: V, S, M (a statuette of the target worth 5,000+ GP)\nDuration: Until dispelled\n\nYou create a magical restraint to hold a creature that you can see within range. The target must make a Wisdom saving throw. On a successful save, the target is unaffected, and it is immune to this\n\nspell for the next 24 hours. On a failed save, the target is imprisoned. While imprisoned, the target doesn't need to breathe, eat, or drink, and it doesn't age. Divination spells can't locate or perceive the imprisoned target, and the target can't teleport.\n\nUntil the spell ends, the target is also affected by one of the following effects of your choice:\n\nBurial. The target is entombed beneath the earth in a hollow globe of magical force that is just large enough to contain the target. Nothing can pass into or out of the globe.\n\nChaining. Chains firmly rooted in the ground hold the target in place. The target has the Restrained condition and can't be moved by any means.\n\nHedged Prison. The target is trapped in a demi-plane that is warded against teleportation and planar travel. The demiplane is your choice of a labyrinth, a cage, a tower, or the like.\n\nMinimus Containment. The target becomes 1 inch tall and is trapped inside an indestructible gemstone or a similar object. Light can pass through the gemstone (allowing the target to see out and other creatures to see in), but nothing else can pass through by any means.\n\nSlumber. The target has the Unconscious condition and can't be awoken.\n\nEnding the Spell. When you cast the spell, specify a trigger that will end it. The trigger can be as simple or as elaborate as you choose, but the GM must agree that it has a high likelihood of happening within the next decade. The trigger must be an observable action, such as someone making a particular offering at the temple of your god, saving your true love, or defeating a specific monster.\n\nA Dispel Magic spell can end the spell only if it is cast with a level 9 spell slot, targeting either the prison or the component used to create it.",
      "classes": [
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/warlock"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/wizard"
        }
      ],
      "savingThrowAbility": "Wisdom",
      "scalesWithSlotLevel": false,
      "concentration": false,
      "ritual": false
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/spells/incendiary-cloud",
      "@type": "Spell",
      "name": "Incendiary Cloud",
      "slug": "incendiary-cloud",
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/sources/srd-5-2-1"
      },
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Spells",
        "section": "7.210",
        "heading": "Incendiary Cloud",
        "lineStart": 10204,
        "lineEnd": 10217
      },
      "level": 8,
      "school": "Conjuration",
      "classAvailability": [
        "Druid",
        "Sorcerer",
        "Wizard"
      ],
      "castingTime": "Action",
      "range": "150 feet",
      "components": "V, S",
      "duration": "Concentration, up to 1 minute",
      "rulesText": "Level 8 Conjuration (Druid, Sorcerer, Wizard)\n\nCasting Time: Action\nRange: 150 feet\nComponents: V, S\nDuration: Concentration, up to 1 minute\n\nA swirling cloud of embers and smoke fills a 20-foot-radius Sphere centered on a point within range. The cloud's area is Heavily Obscured. It lasts for the duration or until a strong wind (like that created by Gust of Wind) disperses it.\n\nWhen the cloud appears, each creature in it makes a Dexterity saving throw, taking 10d8 Fire damage on a failed save or half as much damage on a successful one. A creature must also make this save when the Sphere moves into its space and when it enters the Sphere or ends its turn there. A creature makes this save only once per turn.\n\nThe cloud moves 10 feet away from you in a direction you choose at the start of each of your turns.",
      "classes": [
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/druid"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/sorcerer"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/wizard"
        }
      ],
      "savingThrowAbility": "Dexterity",
      "damage": [
        {
          "damageType": "Fire",
          "damageRoll": {
            "expression": "10d8",
            "count": 10,
            "sides": 8
          }
        }
      ],
      "scalesWithSlotLevel": false,
      "concentration": true,
      "ritual": false
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/spells/inflict-wounds",
      "@type": "Spell",
      "name": "Inflict Wounds",
      "slug": "inflict-wounds",
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/sources/srd-5-2-1"
      },
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Spells",
        "section": "7.211",
        "heading": "Inflict Wounds",
        "lineStart": 10219,
        "lineEnd": 10230
      },
      "level": 1,
      "school": "Necromancy",
      "classAvailability": [
        "Cleric"
      ],
      "castingTime": "Action",
      "range": "Touch",
      "components": "V, S",
      "duration": "Instantaneous",
      "rulesText": "Level 1 Necromancy (Cleric)\n\nCasting Time: Action\nRange: Touch\nComponents: V, S\nDuration: Instantaneous\n\nA creature you touch makes a Constitution saving throw, taking 2d10 Necrotic damage on a failed save or half as much damage on a successful one.\n\nUsing a Higher-Level Spell Slot. The damage increases by 1d10 for each spell slot level above 1.",
      "classes": [
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/cleric"
        }
      ],
      "savingThrowAbility": "Constitution",
      "damage": [
        {
          "damageType": "Necrotic",
          "damageRoll": {
            "expression": "2d10",
            "count": 2,
            "sides": 10
          }
        }
      ],
      "scalesWithSlotLevel": true,
      "concentration": false,
      "ritual": false
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/spells/insect-plague",
      "@type": "Spell",
      "name": "Insect Plague",
      "slug": "insect-plague",
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/sources/srd-5-2-1"
      },
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Spells",
        "section": "7.212",
        "heading": "Insect Plague",
        "lineStart": 10232,
        "lineEnd": 10245
      },
      "level": 5,
      "school": "Conjuration",
      "classAvailability": [
        "Cleric",
        "Druid",
        "Sorcerer"
      ],
      "castingTime": "Action",
      "range": "300 feet",
      "components": "V, S, M (a locust)",
      "duration": "Concentration, up to 10 minutes",
      "rulesText": "Level 5 Conjuration (Cleric, Druid, Sorcerer)\n\nCasting Time: Action\nRange: 300 feet\nComponents: V, S, M (a locust)\nDuration: Concentration, up to 10 minutes\n\nSwarming locusts fill a 20-foot-radius Sphere centered on a point you choose within range. The Sphere remains for the duration, and its area is Lightly Obscured and Difficult Terrain.\n\nWhen the swarm appears, each creature in it makes a Constitution saving throw, taking 4d10 Piercing damage on a failed save or half as much damage on a successful one. A creature also makes this save when it enters the spell's area for the first time on a turn or ends its turn there. A creature makes this save only once per turn.\n\nUsing a Higher-Level Spell Slot. The damage increases by 1d10 for each spell slot level above 5.",
      "classes": [
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/cleric"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/druid"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/sorcerer"
        }
      ],
      "savingThrowAbility": "Constitution",
      "damage": [
        {
          "damageType": "Piercing",
          "damageRoll": {
            "expression": "4d10",
            "count": 4,
            "sides": 10
          }
        }
      ],
      "scalesWithSlotLevel": true,
      "concentration": true,
      "ritual": false
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/spells/instant-summons",
      "@type": "Spell",
      "name": "Instant Summons",
      "slug": "instant-summons",
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/sources/srd-5-2-1"
      },
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Spells",
        "section": "7.213",
        "heading": "Instant Summons",
        "lineStart": 10247,
        "lineEnd": 10260
      },
      "level": 6,
      "school": "Conjuration",
      "classAvailability": [
        "Wizard"
      ],
      "castingTime": "1 minute or Ritual",
      "range": "Touch",
      "components": "V, S, M (a sapphire worth 1,000+ GP)",
      "duration": "Until dispelled",
      "rulesText": "Level 6 Conjuration (Wizard)\n\nCasting Time: 1 minute or Ritual\nRange: Touch\nComponents: V, S, M (a sapphire worth 1,000+ GP)\nDuration: Until dispelled\n\nYou touch the sapphire used in the casting and an object weighing 10 pounds or less whose longest dimension is 6 feet or less. The spell leaves an Invisible mark on that object and invisibly inscribes the object's name on the sapphire. Each time you cast this spell, you must use a different sapphire.\n\nThereafter, you can take a Magic action to speak the object's name and crush the sapphire. The object instantly appears in your hand regardless of physical or planar distances, and the spell ends.\n\nIf another creature is holding or carrying the object, crushing the sapphire doesn't transport it, but instead you learn who that creature is and where that creature is currently located.",
      "classes": [
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/wizard"
        }
      ],
      "scalesWithSlotLevel": false,
      "concentration": false,
      "ritual": true
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/spells/invisibility",
      "@type": "Spell",
      "name": "Invisibility",
      "slug": "invisibility",
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/sources/srd-5-2-1"
      },
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Spells",
        "section": "7.215",
        "heading": "Invisibility",
        "lineStart": 10275,
        "lineEnd": 10286
      },
      "level": 2,
      "school": "Illusion",
      "classAvailability": [
        "Bard",
        "Sorcerer",
        "Warlock",
        "Wizard"
      ],
      "castingTime": "Action",
      "range": "Touch",
      "components": "V, S, M (an eyelash in gum arabic)",
      "duration": "Concentration, up to 1 hour",
      "rulesText": "Level 2 Illusion (Bard, Sorcerer, Warlock, Wizard)\n\nCasting Time: Action\nRange: Touch\nComponents: V, S, M (an eyelash in gum arabic)\nDuration: Concentration, up to 1 hour\n\nA creature you touch has the Invisible condition until the spell ends. The spell ends early immediately after the target makes an attack roll, deals damage, or casts a spell.\n\nUsing a Higher-Level Spell Slot. You can target one additional creature for each spell slot level above 2.",
      "classes": [
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/bard"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/sorcerer"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/warlock"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/wizard"
        }
      ],
      "scalesWithSlotLevel": true,
      "concentration": true,
      "ritual": false
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/spells/irresistible-dance",
      "@type": "Spell",
      "name": "Irresistible Dance",
      "slug": "irresistible-dance",
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/sources/srd-5-2-1"
      },
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Spells",
        "section": "7.214",
        "heading": "Irresistible Dance",
        "lineStart": 10262,
        "lineEnd": 10273
      },
      "level": 6,
      "school": "Enchantment",
      "classAvailability": [
        "Bard",
        "Wizard"
      ],
      "castingTime": "Action",
      "range": "30 feet",
      "components": "V",
      "duration": "Concentration, up to 1 minute",
      "rulesText": "Level 6 Enchantment (Bard, Wizard)\n\nCasting Time: Action\nRange: 30 feet\nComponents: V\nDuration: Concentration, up to 1 minute\n\nOne creature that you can see within range must make a Wisdom saving throw. On a successful save, the target dances comically until the end of its next turn, during which it must spend all its movement to dance in place.\n\nOn a failed save, the target has the Charmed condition for the duration. While Charmed, the target dances comically, must use all its movement to dance in place, and has Disadvantage on Dexterity saving throws and attack rolls, and other creatures have Advantage on attack rolls against it. On each of its turns, the target can take an action to collect itself and repeat the save, ending the spell on itself on a success.",
      "classes": [
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/bard"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/wizard"
        }
      ],
      "savingThrowAbility": "Wisdom",
      "scalesWithSlotLevel": false,
      "concentration": true,
      "ritual": false
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/spells/jump",
      "@type": "Spell",
      "name": "Jump",
      "slug": "jump",
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/sources/srd-5-2-1"
      },
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Spells",
        "section": "7.216",
        "heading": "Jump",
        "lineStart": 10288,
        "lineEnd": 10299
      },
      "level": 1,
      "school": "Transmutation",
      "classAvailability": [
        "Druid",
        "Ranger",
        "Sorcerer",
        "Wizard"
      ],
      "castingTime": "Bonus Action",
      "range": "Touch",
      "components": "V, S, M (a grasshopper's hind leg)",
      "duration": "1 minute",
      "rulesText": "Level 1 Transmutation (Druid, Ranger, Sorcerer, Wizard)\n\nCasting Time: Bonus Action\nRange: Touch\nComponents: V, S, M (a grasshopper's hind leg)\nDuration: 1 minute\n\nYou touch a willing creature. Once on each of its turns until the spell ends, that creature can jump up to 30 feet by spending 10 feet of movement.\n\nUsing a Higher-Level Spell Slot. You can target one additional creature for each spell slot level above 1.",
      "classes": [
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/druid"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/ranger"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/sorcerer"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/wizard"
        }
      ],
      "scalesWithSlotLevel": true,
      "concentration": false,
      "ritual": false
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/spells/knock",
      "@type": "Spell",
      "name": "Knock",
      "slug": "knock",
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/sources/srd-5-2-1"
      },
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Spells",
        "section": "7.217",
        "heading": "Knock",
        "lineStart": 10301,
        "lineEnd": 10316
      },
      "level": 2,
      "school": "Transmutation",
      "classAvailability": [
        "Bard",
        "Sorcerer",
        "Wizard"
      ],
      "castingTime": "Action",
      "range": "60 feet",
      "components": "V",
      "duration": "Instantaneous",
      "rulesText": "Level 2 Transmutation (Bard, Sorcerer, Wizard)\n\nCasting Time: Action\nRange: 60 feet\nComponents: V\nDuration: Instantaneous\n\nChoose an object that you can see within range. The object can be a door, a box, a chest, a set of manacles, a padlock, or another object that contains a mundane or magical means that prevents access.\n\nA target that is held shut by a mundane lock or that is stuck or barred becomes unlocked, unstuck, or unbarred. If the object has multiple locks, only one of them is unlocked.\n\nIf the target is held shut by Arcane Lock, that spell is suppressed for 10 minutes, during which time the target can be opened and closed.\n\nWhen you cast the spell, a loud knock, audible up to 300 feet away, emanates from the target.",
      "classes": [
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/bard"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/sorcerer"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/wizard"
        }
      ],
      "scalesWithSlotLevel": false,
      "concentration": false,
      "ritual": false
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/spells/legend-lore",
      "@type": "Spell",
      "name": "Legend Lore",
      "slug": "legend-lore",
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/sources/srd-5-2-1"
      },
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Spells",
        "section": "7.218",
        "heading": "Legend Lore",
        "lineStart": 10318,
        "lineEnd": 10331
      },
      "level": 5,
      "school": "Divination",
      "classAvailability": [
        "Bard",
        "Cleric",
        "Wizard"
      ],
      "castingTime": "10 minutes",
      "range": "Self",
      "components": "V, S, M (incense worth 250+ GP, which the spell consumes, and four ivory strips worth 50+ GP each)",
      "duration": "Instantaneous",
      "rulesText": "Level 5 Divination (Bard, Cleric, Wizard)\n\nCasting Time: 10 minutes\nRange: Self\nComponents: V, S, M (incense worth 250+ GP, which the spell consumes, and four ivory strips worth 50+ GP each)\nDuration: Instantaneous\n\nName or describe a famous person, place, or object. The spell brings to your mind a brief summary of the significant lore about that famous thing, as described by the GM.\n\nThe lore might consist of important details, amusing revelations, or even secret lore that has never been widely known. The more information you already know about the thing, the more precise and detailed the information you receive is. That information is accurate but might be couched in figurative language or poetry, as determined by the GM.\n\nIf the famous thing you chose isn't actually famous, you hear sad musical notes played on a trombone, and the spell fails.",
      "classes": [
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/bard"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/cleric"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/wizard"
        }
      ],
      "scalesWithSlotLevel": false,
      "concentration": false,
      "ritual": false
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/spells/lesser-restoration",
      "@type": "Spell",
      "name": "Lesser Restoration",
      "slug": "lesser-restoration",
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/sources/srd-5-2-1"
      },
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Spells",
        "section": "7.219",
        "heading": "Lesser Restoration",
        "lineStart": 10333,
        "lineEnd": 10342
      },
      "level": 2,
      "school": "Abjuration",
      "classAvailability": [
        "Bard",
        "Cleric",
        "Druid",
        "Paladin",
        "Ranger"
      ],
      "castingTime": "Bonus Action",
      "range": "Touch",
      "components": "V, S",
      "duration": "Instantaneous",
      "rulesText": "Level 2 Abjuration (Bard, Cleric, Druid, Paladin, Ranger)\n\nCasting Time: Bonus Action\nRange: Touch\nComponents: V, S\nDuration: Instantaneous\n\nYou touch a creature and end one condition on it: Blinded, Deafened, Paralyzed, or Poisoned.",
      "classes": [
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/bard"
        },
