    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/spells/levitate",
      "@type": "Spell",
      "name": "Levitate",
      "slug": "levitate",
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/sources/srd-5-2-1"
      },
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Spells",
        "section": "7.220",
        "heading": "Levitate",
        "lineStart": 10344,
        "lineEnd": 10359
      },
      "level": 2,
      "school": "Transmutation",
      "classAvailability": [
        "Sorcerer",
        "Wizard"
      ],
      "castingTime": "Action",
      "range": "60 feet",
      "components": "V, S, M (a metal spring)",
      "duration": "Concentration, up to 10 minutes",
      "rulesText": "Level 2 Transmutation (Sorcerer, Wizard)\n\nCasting Time: Action\nRange: 60 feet\nComponents: V, S, M (a metal spring)\nDuration: Concentration, up to 10 minutes\n\nOne creature or loose object of your choice that you can see within range rises vertically up to 20 feet and remains suspended there for the duration. The\n\nspell can levitate an object that weighs up to 500 pounds. An unwilling creature that succeeds on a Constitution saving throw is unaffected.\n\nThe target can move only by pushing or pulling against a fixed object or surface within reach (such as a wall or a ceiling), which allows it to move as if it were climbing. You can change the target's altitude by up to 20 feet in either direction on your turn. If you are the target, you can move up or down as part of your move. Otherwise, you can take a Magic action to move the target, which must remain within the spell's range.\n\nWhen the spell ends, the target floats gently to the ground if it is still aloft.",
      "classes": [
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/sorcerer"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/wizard"
        }
      ],
      "savingThrowAbility": "Constitution",
      "scalesWithSlotLevel": false,
      "concentration": true,
      "ritual": false
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/spells/light",
      "@type": "Spell",
      "name": "Light",
      "slug": "light",
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/sources/srd-5-2-1"
      },
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Spells",
        "section": "7.221",
        "heading": "Light",
        "lineStart": 10361,
        "lineEnd": 10372
      },
      "level": 0,
      "school": "Evocation",
      "classAvailability": [
        "Bard",
        "Cleric",
        "Sorcerer",
        "Wizard"
      ],
      "castingTime": "Action",
      "range": "Touch",
      "components": "V, M (a firefly or phosphorescent moss)",
      "duration": "1 hour",
      "rulesText": "Evocation Cantrip (Bard, Cleric, Sorcerer, Wizard)\n\nCasting Time: Action\nRange: Touch\nComponents: V, M (a firefly or phosphorescent moss)\nDuration: 1 hour\n\nYou touch one Large or smaller object that isn't being worn or carried by someone else. Until the spell ends, the object sheds Bright Light in a 20-foot radius and Dim Light for an additional 20 feet. The light can be colored as you like.\n\nCovering the object with something opaque blocks the light. The spell ends if you cast it again.",
      "classes": [
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/bard"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/cleric"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/sorcerer"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/wizard"
        }
      ],
      "scalesWithSlotLevel": false,
      "concentration": false,
      "ritual": false
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/spells/lightning-bolt",
      "@type": "Spell",
      "name": "Lightning Bolt",
      "slug": "lightning-bolt",
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/sources/srd-5-2-1"
      },
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Spells",
        "section": "7.222",
        "heading": "Lightning Bolt",
        "lineStart": 10374,
        "lineEnd": 10385
      },
      "level": 3,
      "school": "Evocation",
      "classAvailability": [
        "Sorcerer",
        "Wizard"
      ],
      "castingTime": "Action",
      "range": "Self",
      "components": "V, S, M (a bit of fur and a crystal rod)",
      "duration": "Instantaneous",
      "rulesText": "Level 3 Evocation (Sorcerer, Wizard)\n\nCasting Time: Action\nRange: Self\nComponents: V, S, M (a bit of fur and a crystal rod)\nDuration: Instantaneous\n\nA stroke of lightning forming a 100-foot-long, 5-foot-wide Line blasts out from you in a direction you choose. Each creature in the Line makes a Dexterity saving throw, taking 8d6 Lightning damage on a failed save or half as much damage on a successful one.\n\nUsing a Higher-Level Spell Slot. The damage increases by 1d6 for each spell slot level above 3.",
      "classes": [
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/sorcerer"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/wizard"
        }
      ],
      "savingThrowAbility": "Dexterity",
      "damage": [
        {
          "damageType": "Lightning",
          "damageRoll": {
            "expression": "8d6",
            "count": 8,
            "sides": 6
          }
        }
      ],
      "scalesWithSlotLevel": true,
      "concentration": false,
      "ritual": false
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/spells/locate-animals-or-plants",
      "@type": "Spell",
      "name": "Locate Animals or Plants",
      "slug": "locate-animals-or-plants",
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/sources/srd-5-2-1"
      },
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Spells",
        "section": "7.223",
        "heading": "Locate Animals or Plants",
        "lineStart": 10387,
        "lineEnd": 10396
      },
      "level": 2,
      "school": "Divination",
      "classAvailability": [
        "Bard",
        "Druid",
        "Ranger"
      ],
      "castingTime": "Action or Ritual",
      "range": "Self",
      "components": "V, S, M (fur from a bloodhound)",
      "duration": "Instantaneous",
      "rulesText": "Level 2 Divination (Bard, Druid, Ranger)\n\nCasting Time: Action or Ritual\nRange: Self\nComponents: V, S, M (fur from a bloodhound)\nDuration: Instantaneous\n\nDescribe or name a specific kind of Beast, Plant creature, or nonmagical plant. You learn the direction and distance to the closest creature or plant of that kind within 5 miles, if any are present.",
      "classes": [
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/bard"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/druid"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/ranger"
        }
      ],
      "scalesWithSlotLevel": false,
      "concentration": false,
      "ritual": true
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/spells/locate-creature",
      "@type": "Spell",
      "name": "Locate Creature",
      "slug": "locate-creature",
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/sources/srd-5-2-1"
      },
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Spells",
        "section": "7.224",
        "heading": "Locate Creature",
        "lineStart": 10398,
        "lineEnd": 10411
      },
      "level": 4,
      "school": "Divination",
      "classAvailability": [
        "Bard",
        "Cleric",
        "Druid",
        "Paladin",
        "Ranger",
        "Wizard"
      ],
      "castingTime": "Action",
      "range": "Self",
      "components": "V, S, M (fur from a bloodhound)",
      "duration": "Concentration, up to 1 hour",
      "rulesText": "Level 4 Divination (Bard, Cleric, Druid, Paladin, Ranger, Wizard)\n\nCasting Time: Action\nRange: Self\nComponents: V, S, M (fur from a bloodhound)\nDuration: Concentration, up to 1 hour\n\nDescribe or name a creature that is familiar to you. You sense the direction to the creature's location if that creature is within 1,000 feet of you. If the creature is moving, you know the direction of its movement.\n\nThe spell can locate a specific creature known to you or the nearest creature of a specific kind (such as a human or a unicorn) if you have seen such a creature up close - within 30 feet - at least once. If the creature you described or named is in a different form, such as under the effects of a Flesh to Stone or Polymorph spell, this spell doesn't locate the creature.\n\nThis spell can't locate a creature if any thickness of lead blocks a direct path between you and the creature.",
      "classes": [
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/bard"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/cleric"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/druid"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/paladin"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/ranger"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/wizard"
        }
      ],
      "scalesWithSlotLevel": false,
      "concentration": true,
      "ritual": false
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/spells/locate-object",
      "@type": "Spell",
      "name": "Locate Object",
      "slug": "locate-object",
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/sources/srd-5-2-1"
      },
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Spells",
        "section": "7.225",
        "heading": "Locate Object",
        "lineStart": 10413,
        "lineEnd": 10426
      },
      "level": 2,
      "school": "Divination",
      "classAvailability": [
        "Bard",
        "Cleric",
        "Druid",
        "Paladin",
        "Ranger",
        "Wizard"
      ],
      "castingTime": "Action",
      "range": "Self",
      "components": "V, S, M (a forked twig)",
      "duration": "Concentration, up to 10 minutes",
      "rulesText": "Level 2 Divination (Bard, Cleric, Druid, Paladin, Ranger, Wizard)\n\nCasting Time: Action\nRange: Self\nComponents: V, S, M (a forked twig)\nDuration: Concentration, up to 10 minutes\n\nDescribe or name an object that is familiar to you. You sense the direction to the object's location if that object is within 1,000 feet of you. If the object is in motion, you know the direction of its movement.\n\nThe spell can locate a specific object known to you if you have seen it up close - within 30 feet - at least once. Alternatively, the spell can locate the nearest object of a particular kind, such as a certain kind of apparel, jewelry, furniture, tool, or weapon.\n\nThis spell can't locate an object if any thickness of lead blocks a direct path between you and the object.",
      "classes": [
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/bard"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/cleric"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/druid"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/paladin"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/ranger"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/wizard"
        }
      ],
      "scalesWithSlotLevel": false,
      "concentration": true,
      "ritual": false
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/spells/longstrider",
      "@type": "Spell",
      "name": "Longstrider",
      "slug": "longstrider",
      "source": {
