        "lineStart": 10428,
        "lineEnd": 10439
      },
      "level": 1,
      "school": "Transmutation",
      "classAvailability": [
        "Bard",
        "Druid",
        "Ranger",
        "Wizard"
      ],
      "castingTime": "Action",
      "range": "Touch",
      "components": "V, S, M (a pinch of dirt)",
      "duration": "1 hour",
      "rulesText": "Level 1 Transmutation (Bard, Druid, Ranger, Wizard)\n\nCasting Time: Action\nRange: Touch\nComponents: V, S, M (a pinch of dirt)\nDuration: 1 hour\n\nYou touch a creature. The target's Speed increases by 10 feet until the spell ends.\n\nUsing a Higher-Level Spell Slot. You can target one additional creature for each spell slot level above 1.",
      "classes": [
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/bard"
        },
