        "lineStart": 11253,
        "lineEnd": 11262
      },
      "level": 3,
      "school": "Abjuration",
      "classAvailability": [
        "Cleric",
        "Druid",
        "Ranger",
        "Sorcerer",
        "Wizard"
      ],
      "castingTime": "Action",
      "range": "Touch",
      "components": "V, S",
      "duration": "Concentration, up to 1 hour",
      "rulesText": "Level 3 Abjuration (Cleric, Druid, Ranger, Sorcerer, Wizard)\n\nCasting Time: Action\nRange: Touch\nComponents: V, S\nDuration: Concentration, up to 1 hour\n\nFor the duration, the willing creature you touch has Resistance to one damage type of your choice: Acid, Cold, Fire, Lightning, or Thunder.",
      "classes": [
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/cleric"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/druid"
