    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/spells/purify-food-and-drink",
      "@type": "Spell",
      "name": "Purify Food and Drink",
      "slug": "purify-food-and-drink",
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/sources/srd-5-2-1"
      },
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Spells",
        "section": "7.281",
        "heading": "Purify Food and Drink",
        "lineStart": 11286,
        "lineEnd": 11295
      },
      "level": 1,
      "school": "Transmutation",
      "classAvailability": [
        "Cleric",
        "Druid",
        "Paladin"
      ],
      "castingTime": "Action or Ritual",
      "range": "10 feet",
      "components": "V, S",
      "duration": "Instantaneous",
      "rulesText": "Level 1 Transmutation (Cleric, Druid, Paladin)\n\nCasting Time: Action or Ritual\nRange: 10 feet\nComponents: V, S\nDuration: Instantaneous\n\nYou remove poison and rot from nonmagical food and drink in a 5-foot-radius Sphere centered on a point within range.",
      "classes": [
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/cleric"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/druid"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/paladin"
        }
      ],
      "scalesWithSlotLevel": false,
      "concentration": false,
      "ritual": true
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/spells/raise-dead",
      "@type": "Spell",
      "name": "Raise Dead",
      "slug": "raise-dead",
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/sources/srd-5-2-1"
      },
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Spells",
        "section": "7.282",
        "heading": "Raise Dead",
        "lineStart": 11297,
        "lineEnd": 11312
      },
      "level": 5,
      "school": "Necromancy",
      "classAvailability": [
        "Bard",
        "Cleric",
        "Paladin"
      ],
      "castingTime": "1 hour",
      "range": "Touch",
      "components": "V, S, M (a diamond worth 500+ GP, which the spell consumes)",
      "duration": "Instantaneous",
      "rulesText": "Level 5 Necromancy (Bard, Cleric, Paladin)\n\nCasting Time: 1 hour\nRange: Touch\nComponents: V, S, M (a diamond worth 500+ GP, which the spell consumes)\nDuration: Instantaneous\n\nWith a touch, you revive a dead creature if it has been dead no longer than 10 days and it wasn't Undead when it died.\n\nThe creature returns to life with 1 Hit Point. This spell also neutralizes any poisons that affected the creature at the time of death.\n\nThis spell closes all mortal wounds, but it doesn't restore missing body parts. If the creature is lacking body parts or organs integral for its survival - its head, for instance - the spell automatically fails.\n\nComing back from the dead is an ordeal. The target takes a -4 penalty to D20 Tests. Every time the target finishes a Long Rest, the penalty is reduced by 1 until it becomes 0.",
      "classes": [
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/bard"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/cleric"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/paladin"
        }
      ],
      "scalesWithSlotLevel": false,
      "concentration": false,
      "ritual": false
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/spells/ray-of-enfeeblement",
      "@type": "Spell",
      "name": "Ray of Enfeeblement",
      "slug": "ray-of-enfeeblement",
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/sources/srd-5-2-1"
      },
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Spells",
        "section": "7.283",
        "heading": "Ray of Enfeeblement",
        "lineStart": 11314,
        "lineEnd": 11325
      },
      "level": 2,
      "school": "Necromancy",
      "classAvailability": [
        "Warlock",
        "Wizard"
      ],
      "castingTime": "Action",
      "range": "60 feet",
      "components": "V, S",
      "duration": "Concentration, up to 1 minute",
      "rulesText": "Level 2 Necromancy (Warlock, Wizard)\n\nCasting Time: Action\nRange: 60 feet\nComponents: V, S\nDuration: Concentration, up to 1 minute\n\nA beam of enervating energy shoots from you toward a creature within range. The target must make a Constitution saving throw. On a successful save, the target has Disadvantage on the next attack roll it makes until the start of your next turn.\n\nOn a failed save, the target has Disadvantage on Strength-based D20 Tests for the duration. During that time, it also subtracts 1d8 from all its damage rolls. The target repeats the save at the end of each of its turns, ending the spell on a success.",
      "classes": [
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/warlock"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/wizard"
        }
      ],
      "savingThrowAbility": "Constitution",
      "scalesWithSlotLevel": false,
      "concentration": true,
      "ritual": false
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/spells/ray-of-frost",
      "@type": "Spell",
      "name": "Ray of Frost",
      "slug": "ray-of-frost",
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/sources/srd-5-2-1"
      },
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Spells",
        "section": "7.284",
        "heading": "Ray of Frost",
        "lineStart": 11327,
        "lineEnd": 11338
      },
      "level": 0,
      "school": "Evocation",
      "classAvailability": [
        "Sorcerer",
        "Wizard"
      ],
      "castingTime": "Action",
      "range": "60 feet",
      "components": "V, S",
      "duration": "Instantaneous",
      "rulesText": "Evocation Cantrip (Sorcerer, Wizard)\n\nCasting Time: Action\nRange: 60 feet\nComponents: V, S\nDuration: Instantaneous\n\nA frigid beam of blue-white light streaks toward a creature within range. Make a ranged spell attack against the target. On a hit, it takes 1d8 Cold damage, and its Speed is reduced by 10 feet until the start of your next turn.\n\nCantrip Upgrade. The damage increases by 1d8 when you reach levels 5 (2d8), 11 (3d8), and 17 (4d8).",
      "classes": [
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/sorcerer"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/wizard"
        }
      ],
      "damage": [
        {
          "damageType": "Cold",
          "damageRoll": {
            "expression": "1d8",
            "count": 1,
            "sides": 8
          }
        }
      ],
      "scalesWithSlotLevel": false,
      "concentration": false,
      "ritual": false
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/spells/ray-of-sickness",
      "@type": "Spell",
      "name": "Ray of Sickness",
      "slug": "ray-of-sickness",
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/sources/srd-5-2-1"
      },
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Spells",
        "section": "7.286",
        "heading": "Ray of Sickness",
        "lineStart": 11351,
        "lineEnd": 11362
      },
      "level": 1,
      "school": "Necromancy",
      "classAvailability": [
        "Sorcerer",
        "Wizard"
      ],
      "castingTime": "Action",
      "range": "60 feet",
      "components": "V, S",
      "duration": "Instantaneous",
      "rulesText": "Level 1 Necromancy (Sorcerer, Wizard)\n\nCasting Time: Action\nRange: 60 feet\nComponents: V, S\nDuration: Instantaneous\n\nYou shoot a greenish ray at a creature within range. Make a ranged spell attack against the target. On a hit, the target takes 2d8 Poison damage and has the Poisoned condition until the end of your next turn.\n\nUsing a Higher-Level Spell Slot. The damage increases by 1d8 for each spell slot level above 1.",
      "classes": [
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/sorcerer"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/wizard"
        }
      ],
      "damage": [
        {
          "damageType": "Poison",
          "damageRoll": {
            "expression": "2d8",
            "count": 2,
            "sides": 8
          }
        }
      ],
      "scalesWithSlotLevel": true,
      "concentration": false,
      "ritual": false
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/spells/regenerate",
      "@type": "Spell",
      "name": "Regenerate",
      "slug": "regenerate",
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/sources/srd-5-2-1"
      },
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Spells",
        "section": "7.285",
        "heading": "Regenerate",
        "lineStart": 11340,
        "lineEnd": 11349
      },
      "level": 7,
      "school": "Transmutation",
      "classAvailability": [
        "Bard",
        "Cleric",
        "Druid"
      ],
      "castingTime": "1 minute",
      "range": "Touch",
      "components": "V, S, M (a prayer wheel)",
      "duration": "1 hour",
      "rulesText": "Level 7 Transmutation (Bard, Cleric, Druid)\n\nCasting Time: 1 minute\nRange: Touch\nComponents: V, S, M (a prayer wheel)\nDuration: 1 hour\n\nA creature you touch regains 4d8 + 15 Hit Points. For the duration, the target regains 1 Hit Point at the start of each of its turns, and any severed body parts regrow after 2 minutes.",
      "classes": [
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/bard"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/cleric"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/druid"
        }
      ],
      "scalesWithSlotLevel": false,
      "concentration": false,
      "ritual": false
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/spells/reincarnate",
      "@type": "Spell",
      "name": "Reincarnate",
      "slug": "reincarnate",
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/sources/srd-5-2-1"
      },
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Spells",
        "section": "7.287",
        "heading": "Reincarnate",
        "lineStart": 11364,
        "lineEnd": 11383
      },
      "level": 5,
      "school": "Necromancy",
      "classAvailability": [
        "Druid"
      ],
      "castingTime": "1 hour",
      "range": "Touch",
      "components": "V, S, M (rare oils worth 1,000+ GP, which the spell consumes)",
      "duration": "Instantaneous",
      "rulesText": "Level 5 Necromancy (Druid)\n\nCasting Time: 1 hour\nRange: Touch\nComponents: V, S, M (rare oils worth 1,000+ GP, which the spell consumes)\nDuration: Instantaneous\n\nYou touch a dead Humanoid or a piece of one. If the creature has been dead no longer than 10 days, the spell forms a new body for it and calls the soul to enter that body. Roll 1d10 and consult the table below to determine the body's species, or the GM chooses another playable species.\n\n| 1d10 | Species     | 1d10 | Species  |\n| :--- | :---------- | :--- | :------- |\n| 1    | Roll again. | 6    | Goliath  |\n| 2    | Dragonborn  | 7    | Halfling |\n| 3    | Dwarf       | 8    | Human    |\n| 4    | Elf         | 9    | Orc      |\n| 5    | Gnome       | 10   | Tiefling |\n\nThe reincarnated creature makes any choices that a species' description offers, and the creature recalls its former life. It retains the capabilities it had in its original form, except it loses the traits of its previous species and gains the traits of its new one.",
      "classes": [
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/druid"
        }
      ],
      "scalesWithSlotLevel": false,
      "concentration": false,
      "ritual": false
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/spells/remove-curse",
      "@type": "Spell",
      "name": "Remove Curse",
      "slug": "remove-curse",
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/sources/srd-5-2-1"
      },
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Spells",
        "section": "7.288",
        "heading": "Remove Curse",
        "lineStart": 11385,
        "lineEnd": 11394
      },
      "level": 3,
      "school": "Abjuration",
      "classAvailability": [
        "Cleric",
        "Paladin",
        "Warlock",
        "Wizard"
      ],
      "castingTime": "Action",
      "range": "Touch",
      "components": "V, S",
      "duration": "Instantaneous",
      "rulesText": "Level 3 Abjuration (Cleric, Paladin, Warlock, Wizard)\n\nCasting Time: Action\nRange: Touch\nComponents: V, S\nDuration: Instantaneous\n\nAt your touch, all curses affecting one creature or object end. If the object is a cursed magic item, its curse remains, but the spell breaks its owner's Attunement to the object so it can be removed or discarded.",
      "classes": [
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/cleric"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/paladin"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/warlock"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/wizard"
        }
      ],
      "scalesWithSlotLevel": false,
      "concentration": false,
      "ritual": false
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/spells/resilient-sphere",
      "@type": "Spell",
      "name": "Resilient Sphere",
      "slug": "resilient-sphere",
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/sources/srd-5-2-1"
      },
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Spells",
        "section": "7.289",
        "heading": "Resilient Sphere",
        "lineStart": 11396,
        "lineEnd": 11411
      },
      "level": 4,
      "school": "Abjuration",
      "classAvailability": [
        "Wizard"
      ],
      "castingTime": "Action",
      "range": "30 feet",
      "components": "V, S, M (a glass sphere)",
      "duration": "Concentration, up to 1 minute",
      "rulesText": "Level 4 Abjuration (Wizard)\n\nCasting Time: Action\nRange: 30 feet\nComponents: V, S, M (a glass sphere)\nDuration: Concentration, up to 1 minute\n\nA shimmering sphere encloses a Large or smaller creature or object within range. An unwilling creature must succeed on a Dexterity saving throw or be enclosed for the duration.\n\nNothing - not physical objects, energy, or other spell effects - can pass through the barrier, in or out, though a creature in the sphere can breathe there. The sphere is immune to all damage, and a creature or object inside can't be damaged by attacks or effects originating from outside, nor can a creature inside the sphere damage anything outside it.\n\nThe sphere is weightless and just large enough to contain the creature or object inside. An enclosed creature can take an action to push against the sphere's walls and thus roll the sphere at up to half the creature's Speed. Similarly, the globe can be picked up and moved by other creatures.\n\nA Disintegrate spell targeting the globe destroys it without harming anything inside.",
      "classes": [
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/wizard"
        }
      ],
      "savingThrowAbility": "Dexterity",
      "scalesWithSlotLevel": false,
      "concentration": true,
      "ritual": false
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/spells/resistance",
      "@type": "Spell",
      "name": "Resistance",
      "slug": "resistance",
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/sources/srd-5-2-1"
      },
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Spells",
        "section": "7.290",
        "heading": "Resistance",
        "lineStart": 11413,
        "lineEnd": 11422
      },
      "level": 0,
      "school": "Abjuration",
      "classAvailability": [
        "Cleric",
        "Druid"
      ],
      "castingTime": "Action",
      "range": "Touch",
      "components": "V, S",
      "duration": "Concentration, up to 1 minute",
      "rulesText": "Abjuration Cantrip (Cleric, Druid)\n\nCasting Time: Action\nRange: Touch\nComponents: V, S\nDuration: Concentration, up to 1 minute\n\nYou touch a willing creature and choose a damage type: Acid, Bludgeoning, Cold, Fire, Lightning, Necrotic, Piercing, Poison, Radiant, Slashing, or Thunder. When the creature takes damage of the chosen type before the spell ends, the creature reduces the total damage taken by 1d4. A creature can benefit from this spell only once per turn.",
      "classes": [
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/cleric"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/druid"
        }
      ],
      "scalesWithSlotLevel": false,
      "concentration": true,
      "ritual": false
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/spells/resurrection",
      "@type": "Spell",
      "name": "Resurrection",
      "slug": "resurrection",
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/sources/srd-5-2-1"
      },
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Spells",
        "section": "7.291",
        "heading": "Resurrection",
        "lineStart": 11424,
        "lineEnd": 11439
      },
      "level": 7,
      "school": "Necromancy",
      "classAvailability": [
        "Bard",
        "Cleric"
      ],
      "castingTime": "1 hour",
      "range": "Touch",
      "components": "V, S, M (a diamond worth 1,000+ GP, which the spell consumes)",
      "duration": "Instantaneous",
      "rulesText": "Level 7 Necromancy (Bard, Cleric)\n\nCasting Time: 1 hour\nRange: Touch\nComponents: V, S, M (a diamond worth 1,000+ GP, which the spell consumes)\nDuration: Instantaneous\n\nWith a touch, you revive a dead creature that has been dead for no more than a century, didn't die of old age, and wasn't Undead when it died.\n\nThe creature returns to life with all its Hit Points. This spell also neutralizes any poisons that affected the creature at the time of death. This spell closes all mortal wounds and restores any missing body parts.\n\nComing back from the dead is an ordeal. The target takes a -4 penalty to D20 Tests. Every time the target finishes a Long Rest, the penalty is reduced by 1 until it becomes 0.\n\nCasting this spell to revive a creature that has been dead for 365 days or longer taxes you. Until you finish a Long Rest, you can't cast spells again, and you have Disadvantage on D20 Tests.",
      "classes": [
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/bard"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/cleric"
        }
      ],
      "scalesWithSlotLevel": false,
      "concentration": false,
      "ritual": false
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/spells/reverse-gravity",
      "@type": "Spell",
      "name": "Reverse Gravity",
      "slug": "reverse-gravity",
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/sources/srd-5-2-1"
      },
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Spells",
        "section": "7.292",
        "heading": "Reverse Gravity",
        "lineStart": 11441,
        "lineEnd": 11452
      },
      "level": 7,
      "school": "Transmutation",
      "classAvailability": [
        "Druid",
        "Sorcerer",
        "Wizard"
      ],
      "castingTime": "Action",
      "range": "100 feet",
      "components": "V, S, M (a lodestone and iron filings)",
      "duration": "Concentration, up to 1 minute",
      "rulesText": "Level 7 Transmutation (Druid, Sorcerer, Wizard)\n\nCasting Time: Action\nRange: 100 feet\nComponents: V, S, M (a lodestone and iron filings)\nDuration: Concentration, up to 1 minute\n\nThis spell reverses gravity in a 50-foot-radius, 100-foot high Cylinder centered on a point within range. All creatures and objects in that area that aren't anchored to the ground fall upward and reach the top of the Cylinder. A creature can make a Dexterity saving throw to grab a fixed object it can reach, thus avoiding the fall upward.\n\nIf a ceiling or an anchored object is encountered in this upward fall, creatures and objects strike it just as they would during a downward fall. If an affected creature or object reaches the Cylinder's top without striking anything, it hovers there for the duration. When the spell ends, affected objects and creatures fall downward.",
      "classes": [
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/druid"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/sorcerer"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/wizard"
        }
      ],
      "savingThrowAbility": "Dexterity",
      "scalesWithSlotLevel": false,
      "concentration": true,
      "ritual": false
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/spells/revivify",
      "@type": "Spell",
      "name": "Revivify",
      "slug": "revivify",
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/sources/srd-5-2-1"
      },
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Spells",
        "section": "7.293",
        "heading": "Revivify",
        "lineStart": 11454,
        "lineEnd": 11463
      },
      "level": 3,
      "school": "Necromancy",
      "classAvailability": [
        "Cleric",
        "Druid",
        "Paladin",
        "Ranger"
      ],
      "castingTime": "Action",
      "range": "Touch",
      "components": "V, S, M (a diamond worth 300+ GP, which the spell consumes)",
      "duration": "Instantaneous",
      "rulesText": "Level 3 Necromancy (Cleric, Druid, Paladin, Ranger)\n\nCasting Time: Action\nRange: Touch\nComponents: V, S, M (a diamond worth 300+ GP, which the spell consumes)\nDuration: Instantaneous\n\nYou touch a creature that has died within the last minute. That creature revives with 1 Hit Point. This spell can't revive a creature that has died of old age, nor does it restore any missing body parts.",
      "classes": [
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/cleric"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/druid"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/paladin"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/ranger"
        }
      ],
      "scalesWithSlotLevel": false,
      "concentration": false,
      "ritual": false
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/spells/rope-trick",
      "@type": "Spell",
      "name": "Rope Trick",
      "slug": "rope-trick",
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/sources/srd-5-2-1"
      },
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Spells",
        "section": "7.294",
        "heading": "Rope Trick",
        "lineStart": 11465,
        "lineEnd": 11476
      },
      "level": 2,
      "school": "Transmutation",
      "classAvailability": [
        "Wizard"
      ],
      "castingTime": "Action",
      "range": "Touch",
      "components": "V, S, M (a segment of rope)",
      "duration": "1 hour",
      "rulesText": "Level 2 Transmutation (Wizard)\n\nCasting Time: Action\nRange: Touch\nComponents: V, S, M (a segment of rope)\nDuration: 1 hour\n\nYou touch a rope. One end of it hovers upward until the rope hangs perpendicular to the ground or the rope reaches a ceiling. At the rope's upper end, an Invisible 3-foot-by-5-foot portal opens to an extra-dimensional space that lasts until the spell ends. That space can be reached by climbing the rope, which can be pulled into or dropped out of it.\n\nThe space can hold up to eight Medium or smaller creatures. Attacks, spells, and other effects can't pass into or out of the space, but creatures inside it can see through the portal. Anything inside the space drops out when the spell ends.",
      "classes": [
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/wizard"
        }
      ],
      "scalesWithSlotLevel": false,
      "concentration": false,
      "ritual": false
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/spells/sacred-flame",
      "@type": "Spell",
      "name": "Sacred Flame",
      "slug": "sacred-flame",
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/sources/srd-5-2-1"
      },
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Spells",
        "section": "7.295",
        "heading": "Sacred Flame",
        "lineStart": 11478,
        "lineEnd": 11489
      },
      "level": 0,
      "school": "Evocation",
      "classAvailability": [
        "Cleric"
      ],
      "castingTime": "Action",
      "range": "60 feet",
      "components": "V, S",
      "duration": "Instantaneous",
      "rulesText": "Evocation Cantrip (Cleric)\n\nCasting Time: Action\nRange: 60 feet\nComponents: V, S\nDuration: Instantaneous\n\nFlame-like radiance descends on a creature that you can see within range. The target must succeed on a Dexterity saving throw or take 1d8 Radiant damage. The target gains no benefit from Half Cover or Three-Quarters Cover for this save.\n\nCantrip Upgrade. The damage increases by 1d8 when you reach levels 5 (2d8), 11 (3d8), and 17 (4d8).",
      "classes": [
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/cleric"
        }
      ],
      "savingThrowAbility": "Dexterity",
      "damage": [
        {
          "damageType": "Radiant",
          "damageRoll": {
            "expression": "1d8",
            "count": 1,
            "sides": 8
          }
        }
      ],
      "scalesWithSlotLevel": false,
      "concentration": false,
      "ritual": false
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/spells/sanctuary",
      "@type": "Spell",
      "name": "Sanctuary",
      "slug": "sanctuary",
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/sources/srd-5-2-1"
      },
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Spells",
        "section": "7.296",
        "heading": "Sanctuary",
        "lineStart": 11491,
        "lineEnd": 11500
      },
      "level": 1,
      "school": "Abjuration",
      "classAvailability": [
        "Cleric"
      ],
      "castingTime": "Bonus Action",
      "range": "30 feet",
      "components": "V, S, M (a shard of glass from a mirror)",
      "duration": "1 minute",
      "rulesText": "Level 1 Abjuration (Cleric)\n\nCasting Time: Bonus Action\nRange: 30 feet\nComponents: V, S, M (a shard of glass from a mirror)\nDuration: 1 minute\n\nYou ward a creature within range. Until the spell ends, any creature who targets the warded creature with an attack roll or a damaging spell must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw or either choose a new target or lose the attack or spell. This spell doesn't protect the warded creature from areas of effect. The spell ends if the warded creature makes an attack roll, casts a spell, or deals damage.",
      "classes": [
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/cleric"
        }
      ],
      "savingThrowAbility": "Wisdom",
      "scalesWithSlotLevel": false,
      "concentration": false,
      "ritual": false
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/spells/scorching-ray",
      "@type": "Spell",
      "name": "Scorching Ray",
      "slug": "scorching-ray",
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/sources/srd-5-2-1"
      },
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Spells",
        "section": "7.297",
        "heading": "Scorching Ray",
        "lineStart": 11502,
        "lineEnd": 11513
      },
      "level": 2,
      "school": "Evocation",
      "classAvailability": [
        "Sorcerer",
        "Wizard"
      ],
      "castingTime": "Action",
      "range": "120 feet",
      "components": "V, S",
      "duration": "Instantaneous",
      "rulesText": "Level 2 Evocation (Sorcerer, Wizard)\n\nCasting Time: Action\nRange: 120 feet\nComponents: V, S\nDuration: Instantaneous\n\nYou hurl three fiery rays. You can hurl them at one target within range or at several. Make a ranged spell attack for each ray. On a hit, the target takes 2d6 Fire damage.\n\nUsing a Higher-Level Spell Slot. You create one additional ray for each spell slot level above 2.",
      "classes": [
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/sorcerer"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/wizard"
        }
      ],
      "damage": [
        {
          "damageType": "Fire",
          "damageRoll": {
            "expression": "2d6",
            "count": 2,
            "sides": 6
          }
        }
      ],
      "scalesWithSlotLevel": true,
      "concentration": false,
      "ritual": false
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/spells/scrying",
      "@type": "Spell",
      "name": "Scrying",
      "slug": "scrying",
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/sources/srd-5-2-1"
      },
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Spells",
        "section": "7.298",
        "heading": "Scrying",
        "lineStart": 11515,
        "lineEnd": 11542
      },
      "level": 5,
      "school": "Divination",
      "classAvailability": [
        "Bard",
        "Cleric",
        "Druid",
        "Warlock",
        "Wizard"
      ],
      "castingTime": "10 minutes",
      "range": "Self",
      "components": "V, S, M (a focus worth 1,000+ GP, such as a crystal ball, mirror, or water-filled font)",
      "duration": "Concentration, up to 10 minutes",
      "rulesText": "Level 5 Divination (Bard, Cleric, Druid, Warlock, Wizard)\n\nCasting Time: 10 minutes\nRange: Self\nComponents: V, S, M (a focus worth 1,000+ GP, such as a crystal ball, mirror, or water-filled font)\nDuration: Concentration, up to 10 minutes\n\nYou can see and hear a creature you choose that is on the same plane of existence as you. The target makes a Wisdom saving throw, which is modified (see the tables below) by how well you know the target and the sort of physical connection you have to it. The target doesn't know what it is making the save against, only that it feels uneasy.\n\n| Your Knowledge of the Target Is ... | Save Modifier |\n| :---------------------------------- | :------------ |\n| Secondhand (heard of the target)    | +5            |\n| Firsthand (met the target)          | +0            |\n| Extensive (know the target well)    | -5            |\n\n| You Have the Target’s ...               | Save Modifier |\n| :-------------------------------------- | :------------ |\n| Picture or other likeness               | -2            |\n| Garment or other possession             | -4            |\n| Body part, lock of hair, or bit of nail | -10           |\n\nOn a successful save, the target isn't affected, and you can't use this spell on it again for 24 hours.\n\nOn a failed save, the spell creates an Invisible, intangible sensor within 10 feet of the target. You can see and hear through the sensor as if you were there. The sensor moves with the target, remaining within 10 feet of it for the duration. If something can see the sensor, it appears as a luminous orb about the size of your fist.\n\nInstead of targeting a creature, you can target a location you have seen. When you do so, the sensor appears at that location and doesn't move.",
      "classes": [
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/bard"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/cleric"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/druid"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/warlock"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/wizard"
        }
      ],
      "savingThrowAbility": "Wisdom",
      "scalesWithSlotLevel": false,
      "concentration": true,
      "ritual": false
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/spells/searing-smite",
      "@type": "Spell",
      "name": "Searing Smite",
      "slug": "searing-smite",
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/sources/srd-5-2-1"
      },
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Spells",
        "section": "7.299",
        "heading": "Searing Smite",
        "lineStart": 11544,
        "lineEnd": 11555
      },
      "level": 1,
      "school": "Evocation",
      "classAvailability": [
        "Paladin"
      ],
      "castingTime": "Bonus Action, which you take immediately after hitting a target with a Melee weapon or an Unarmed Strike",
      "range": "Self",
      "components": "V",
      "duration": "1 minute",
      "rulesText": "Level 1 Evocation (Paladin)\n\nCasting Time: Bonus Action, which you take immediately after hitting a target with a Melee weapon or an Unarmed Strike\nRange: Self\nComponents: V\nDuration: 1 minute\n\nAs you hit the target, it takes an extra 1d6 Fire damage from the attack. At the start of each of its turns until the spell ends, the target takes 1d6 Fire damage and then makes a Constitution saving throw. On a failed save, the spell continues. On a successful save, the spell ends.\n\nUsing a Higher-Level Spell Slot. All the damage increases by 1d6 for each spell slot level above 1.",
      "classes": [
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/paladin"
        }
      ],
      "savingThrowAbility": "Constitution",
      "damage": [
        {
          "damageType": "Fire",
          "damageRoll": {
            "expression": "1d6",
            "count": 1,
            "sides": 6
          }
        }
      ],
      "scalesWithSlotLevel": true,
      "concentration": false,
      "ritual": false
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/spells/secret-chest",
      "@type": "Spell",
      "name": "Secret Chest",
      "slug": "secret-chest",
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/sources/srd-5-2-1"
      },
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Spells",
        "section": "7.300",
        "heading": "Secret Chest",
        "lineStart": 11557,
        "lineEnd": 11570
      },
      "level": 4,
      "school": "Conjuration",
      "classAvailability": [
        "Wizard"
      ],
      "castingTime": "Action",
      "range": "Touch",
      "components": "V, S, M (a chest, 3 feet by 2 feet by 2 feet, constructed from rare materials worth 5,000+ GP, and a Tiny replica of the chest made from the same materials worth 50+ GP)",
      "duration": "Until dispelled",
      "rulesText": "Level 4 Conjuration (Wizard)\n\nCasting Time: Action\nRange: Touch\nComponents: V, S, M (a chest, 3 feet by 2 feet by 2 feet, constructed from rare materials worth 5,000+ GP, and a Tiny replica of the chest made from the same materials worth 50+ GP)\nDuration: Until dispelled\n\nYou hide a chest and all its contents on the Ethereal Plane. You must touch the chest and the miniature replica that serve as Material components for the spell. The chest can contain up to 12 cubic feet of nonliving material (3 feet by 2 feet by 2 feet).\n\nWhile the chest remains on the Ethereal Plane, you can take a Magic action and touch the replica to recall the chest. It appears in an unoccupied space on the ground within 5 feet of you. You can send the chest back to the Ethereal Plane by taking a Magic action to touch the chest and the replica.\n\nAfter 60 days, there is a cumulative 5 percent chance at the end of each day that the spell ends. The spell also ends if you cast this spell again or if the Tiny replica chest is destroyed. If the spell ends and the larger chest is on the Ethereal Plane, the chest remains there for you or someone else to find.",
      "classes": [
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/wizard"
        }
      ],
      "scalesWithSlotLevel": false,
      "concentration": false,
      "ritual": false
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/spells/see-invisibility",
      "@type": "Spell",
      "name": "See Invisibility",
      "slug": "see-invisibility",
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/sources/srd-5-2-1"
      },
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Spells",
        "section": "7.301",
        "heading": "See Invisibility",
        "lineStart": 11572,
        "lineEnd": 11581
      },
      "level": 2,
      "school": "Divination",
      "classAvailability": [
        "Bard",
        "Sorcerer",
        "Wizard"
      ],
      "castingTime": "Action",
      "range": "Self",
      "components": "V, S, M (a pinch of talc)",
      "duration": "1 hour",
      "rulesText": "Level 2 Divination (Bard, Sorcerer, Wizard)\n\nCasting Time: Action\nRange: Self\nComponents: V, S, M (a pinch of talc)\nDuration: 1 hour\n\nFor the duration, you see creatures and objects that have the Invisible condition as if they were visible, and you can see into the Ethereal Plane. Creatures and objects there appear ghostly.",
      "classes": [
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/bard"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/sorcerer"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/wizard"
        }
      ],
      "scalesWithSlotLevel": false,
      "concentration": false,
      "ritual": false
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/spells/seeming",
      "@type": "Spell",
      "name": "Seeming",
      "slug": "seeming",
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/sources/srd-5-2-1"
      },
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Spells",
        "section": "7.302",
        "heading": "Seeming",
        "lineStart": 11583,
        "lineEnd": 11600
      },
      "level": 5,
      "school": "Illusion",
      "classAvailability": [
        "Bard",
        "Sorcerer",
        "Wizard"
      ],
      "castingTime": "Action",
      "range": "30 feet",
      "components": "V, S",
      "duration": "8 hours",
      "rulesText": "Level 5 Illusion (Bard, Sorcerer, Wizard)\n\nCasting Time: Action\nRange: 30 feet\nComponents: V, S\nDuration: 8 hours\n\nYou give an illusory appearance to each creature of your choice that you can see within range. An unwilling target can make a Charisma saving throw, and if it succeeds, it is unaffected by this spell.\n\nYou can give the same appearance or different ones to the targets. The spell can change the appearance of the targets' bodies and equipment. You can make each creature seem 1 foot shorter or taller and appear heavier or lighter. A target's new appearance must have the same basic arrangement of limbs as the target, but the extent of the illusion\n\nis otherwise up to you. The spell lasts for the duration.\n\nThe changes wrought by this spell fail to hold up to physical inspection. For example, if you use this spell to add a hat to a creature's outfit, objects pass through the hat.\n\nA creature that takes the Study action to examine a target can make an Intelligence (Investigation) check against your spell save DC. If it succeeds, it becomes aware that the target is disguised.",
      "classes": [
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/bard"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/sorcerer"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/wizard"
        }
      ],
      "savingThrowAbility": "Charisma",
      "scalesWithSlotLevel": false,
      "concentration": false,
      "ritual": false
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/spells/sending",
      "@type": "Spell",
      "name": "Sending",
      "slug": "sending",
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/sources/srd-5-2-1"
      },
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Spells",
        "section": "7.303",
        "heading": "Sending",
        "lineStart": 11602,
        "lineEnd": 11615
      },
      "level": 3,
      "school": "Divination",
      "classAvailability": [
        "Bard",
        "Cleric",
        "Wizard"
      ],
      "castingTime": "Action",
      "range": "Unlimited",
      "components": "V, S, M (a copper wire)",
      "duration": "Instantaneous",
      "rulesText": "Level 3 Divination (Bard, Cleric, Wizard)\n\nCasting Time: Action\nRange: Unlimited\nComponents: V, S, M (a copper wire)\nDuration: Instantaneous\n\nYou send a short message of 25 words or fewer to a creature you have met or a creature described to you by someone who has met it. The target hears the message in its mind, recognizes you as the sender if it knows you, and can answer in a like manner immediately. The spell enables targets to understand the meaning of your message.\n\nYou can send the message across any distance and even to other planes of existence, but if the target is on a different plane than you, there is a 5 percent chance that the message doesn't arrive. You know if the delivery fails.\n\nUpon receiving your message, a creature can block your ability to reach it again with this spell for 8 hours. If you try to send another message during that time, you learn that you are blocked, and the spell fails.",
      "classes": [
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/bard"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/cleric"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/wizard"
        }
      ],
      "scalesWithSlotLevel": false,
      "concentration": false,
      "ritual": false
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/spells/sequester",
      "@type": "Spell",
      "name": "Sequester",
      "slug": "sequester",
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/sources/srd-5-2-1"
      },
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Spells",
        "section": "7.304",
        "heading": "Sequester",
        "lineStart": 11617,
        "lineEnd": 11630
      },
      "level": 7,
      "school": "Transmutation",
      "classAvailability": [
        "Wizard"
      ],
      "castingTime": "Action",
      "range": "Touch",
      "components": "V, S, M (gem dust worth 5,000+ GP, which the spell consumes)",
      "duration": "Until dispelled",
      "rulesText": "Level 7 Transmutation (Wizard)\n\nCasting Time: Action\nRange: Touch\nComponents: V, S, M (gem dust worth 5,000+ GP, which the spell consumes)\nDuration: Until dispelled\n\nWith a touch, you magically sequester an object or a willing creature. For the duration, the target has the Invisible condition and can't be targeted by Divination spells, detected by magic, or viewed remotely with magic.\n\nIf the target is a creature, it enters a state of suspended animation; it has the Unconscious condition, doesn't age, and doesn't need food, water, or air.\n\nYou can set a condition for the spell to end early. The condition can be anything you choose, but it must occur or be visible within 1 mile of the target. Examples include “after 1,000 years” or “when the tarrasque awakens.” This spell also ends if the target takes any damage.",
      "classes": [
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/wizard"
        }
      ],
      "scalesWithSlotLevel": false,
      "concentration": false,
      "ritual": false
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/spells/shapechange",
      "@type": "Spell",
      "name": "Shapechange",
      "slug": "shapechange",
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/sources/srd-5-2-1"
      },
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Spells",
        "section": "7.305",
        "heading": "Shapechange",
        "lineStart": 11632,
        "lineEnd": 11647
      },
      "level": 9,
      "school": "Transmutation",
      "classAvailability": [
        "Druid",
        "Wizard"
      ],
      "castingTime": "Action",
      "range": "Self",
      "components": "V, S, M (a jade circlet worth 1,500+ GP)",
      "duration": "Concentration, up to 1 hour",
      "rulesText": "Level 9 Transmutation (Druid, Wizard)\n\nCasting Time: Action\nRange: Self\nComponents: V, S, M (a jade circlet worth 1,500+ GP)\nDuration: Concentration, up to 1 hour\n\nYou shape-shift into another creature for the duration or until you take a Magic action to shape-shift into a different eligible form. The new form must be of a creature that has a Challenge Rating no higher than your level or Challenge Rating. You must have seen the sort of creature before, and it can't be a Construct or an Undead.\n\nWhen you cast the spell, you gain a number of Temporary Hit Points equal to the Hit Points of the first form into which you shape-shift. These Temporary Hit Points vanish if any remain when the spell ends.\n\nYour game statistics are replaced by the stat block of the chosen form, but you retain your creature type; alignment; personality; Intelligence, Wisdom, and Charisma scores; Hit Points; Hit Point Dice; proficiencies; and ability to communicate. If you have the Spellcasting feature, you retain it too.\n\nUpon shape-shifting, you determine whether your equipment drops to the ground or changes in size and shape to fit the new form while you're in it.",
      "classes": [
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/druid"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/wizard"
        }
      ],
      "scalesWithSlotLevel": false,
      "concentration": true,
      "ritual": false
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/spells/shatter",
      "@type": "Spell",
      "name": "Shatter",
      "slug": "shatter",
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/sources/srd-5-2-1"
      },
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Spells",
        "section": "7.306",
        "heading": "Shatter",
        "lineStart": 11649,
        "lineEnd": 11662
      },
      "level": 2,
      "school": "Evocation",
      "classAvailability": [
        "Bard",
        "Sorcerer",
        "Wizard"
      ],
      "castingTime": "Action",
      "range": "60 feet",
      "components": "V, S, M (a chip of mica)",
      "duration": "Instantaneous",
      "rulesText": "Level 2 Evocation (Bard, Sorcerer, Wizard)\n\nCasting Time: Action\nRange: 60 feet\nComponents: V, S, M (a chip of mica)\nDuration: Instantaneous\n\nA loud noise erupts from a point of your choice within range. Each creature in a 10-foot-radius Sphere centered there makes a Constitution saving throw, taking 3d8 Thunder damage on a failed save or half as much damage on a successful one. A Construct has Disadvantage on the save.\n\nA nonmagical object that isn't being worn or carried also takes the damage if it's in the spell's area.\n\nUsing a Higher-Level Spell Slot. The damage increases by 1d8 for each spell slot level above 2.",
      "classes": [
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/bard"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/sorcerer"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/wizard"
        }
      ],
      "savingThrowAbility": "Constitution",
      "damage": [
        {
          "damageType": "Thunder",
          "damageRoll": {
            "expression": "3d8",
            "count": 3,
            "sides": 8
          }
        }
      ],
      "scalesWithSlotLevel": true,
      "concentration": false,
      "ritual": false
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/spells/shield",
      "@type": "Spell",
      "name": "Shield",
      "slug": "shield",
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/sources/srd-5-2-1"
      },
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Spells",
        "section": "7.307",
        "heading": "Shield",
        "lineStart": 11664,
        "lineEnd": 11675
      },
      "level": 1,
      "school": "Abjuration",
      "classAvailability": [
        "Sorcerer",
        "Wizard"
      ],
      "castingTime": "Reaction, which you take when you are hit by an attack roll or targeted by the Magic Missile spell",
      "range": "Self",
      "components": "V, S",
      "duration": "1 round",
      "rulesText": "Level 1 Abjuration (Sorcerer, Wizard)\n\nCasting Time: Reaction, which you take when you are hit by an attack roll or targeted by the Magic Missile spell\nRange: Self\nComponents: V, S\nDuration: 1 round\n\nAn imperceptible barrier of magical force protects you. Until the start of your next turn, you have a +5\n\nbonus to AC, including against the triggering attack, and you take no damage from Magic Missile.",
      "classes": [
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/sorcerer"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/wizard"
        }
      ],
      "scalesWithSlotLevel": false,
      "concentration": false,
      "ritual": false
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/spells/shield-of-faith",
      "@type": "Spell",
      "name": "Shield of Faith",
      "slug": "shield-of-faith",
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/sources/srd-5-2-1"
      },
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Spells",
        "section": "7.308",
        "heading": "Shield of Faith",
        "lineStart": 11677,
        "lineEnd": 11686
      },
      "level": 1,
      "school": "Abjuration",
      "classAvailability": [
        "Cleric",
        "Paladin"
      ],
      "castingTime": "Bonus Action",
      "range": "60 feet",
      "components": "V, S, M (a prayer scroll)",
      "duration": "Concentration, up to 10 minutes",
      "rulesText": "Level 1 Abjuration (Cleric, Paladin)\n\nCasting Time: Bonus Action\nRange: 60 feet\nComponents: V, S, M (a prayer scroll)\nDuration: Concentration, up to 10 minutes\n\nA shimmering field surrounds a creature of your choice within range, granting it a +2 bonus to AC for the duration.",
      "classes": [
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/cleric"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/paladin"
        }
      ],
      "scalesWithSlotLevel": false,
      "concentration": true,
      "ritual": false
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/spells/shillelagh",
      "@type": "Spell",
      "name": "Shillelagh",
      "slug": "shillelagh",
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/sources/srd-5-2-1"
      },
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Spells",
        "section": "7.309",
        "heading": "Shillelagh",
        "lineStart": 11688,
        "lineEnd": 11701
      },
      "level": 0,
      "school": "Transmutation",
      "classAvailability": [
        "Druid"
      ],
      "castingTime": "Bonus Action",
      "range": "Self",
      "components": "V, S, M (mistletoe)",
      "duration": "1 minute",
      "rulesText": "Transmutation Cantrip (Druid)\n\nCasting Time: Bonus Action\nRange: Self\nComponents: V, S, M (mistletoe)\nDuration: 1 minute\n\nA Club or Quarterstaff you are holding is imbued with nature's power. For the duration, you can use your spellcasting ability instead of Strength for the attack and damage rolls of melee attacks using that weapon, and the weapon's damage die becomes a d8. If the attack deals damage, it can be Force damage or the weapon's normal damage type (your choice).\n\nThe spell ends early if you cast it again or if you let go of the weapon.\n\nCantrip Upgrade. The damage die changes when you reach levels 5 (d10), 11 (d12), and 17 (2d6).",
      "classes": [
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/druid"
        }
      ],
      "scalesWithSlotLevel": false,
      "concentration": false,
      "ritual": false
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/spells/shining-smite",
      "@type": "Spell",
      "name": "Shining Smite",
      "slug": "shining-smite",
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/sources/srd-5-2-1"
      },
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Spells",
        "section": "7.310",
        "heading": "Shining Smite",
        "lineStart": 11703,
        "lineEnd": 11714
      },
      "level": 2,
      "school": "Transmutation",
      "classAvailability": [
        "Paladin"
      ],
      "castingTime": "Bonus Action, which you take immediately after hitting a creature with a Melee weapon or an Unarmed Strike",
      "range": "Self",
      "components": "V",
      "duration": "Concentration, up to 1 minute",
      "rulesText": "Level 2 Transmutation (Paladin)\n\nCasting Time: Bonus Action, which you take immediately after hitting a creature with a Melee weapon or an Unarmed Strike\nRange: Self\nComponents: V\nDuration: Concentration, up to 1 minute\n\nThe target hit by the strike takes an extra 2d6 Radiant damage from the attack. Until the spell ends, the target sheds Bright Light in a 5-foot radius, attack rolls against it have Advantage, and it can't benefit from the Invisible condition.\n\nUsing a Higher-Level Spell Slot. The damage increases by 1d6 for each spell slot level above 2.",
      "classes": [
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/paladin"
        }
      ],
      "damage": [
        {
          "damageType": "Radiant",
          "damageRoll": {
            "expression": "2d6",
            "count": 2,
            "sides": 6
          }
        }
      ],
      "scalesWithSlotLevel": true,
      "concentration": true,
      "ritual": false
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/spells/shocking-grasp",
      "@type": "Spell",
      "name": "Shocking Grasp",
      "slug": "shocking-grasp",
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/sources/srd-5-2-1"
      },
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Spells",
        "section": "7.311",
        "heading": "Shocking Grasp",
        "lineStart": 11716,
        "lineEnd": 11727
      },
      "level": 0,
      "school": "Evocation",
      "classAvailability": [
        "Sorcerer",
        "Wizard"
      ],
      "castingTime": "Action",
      "range": "Touch",
      "components": "V, S",
      "duration": "Instantaneous",
      "rulesText": "Evocation Cantrip (Sorcerer, Wizard)\n\nCasting Time: Action\nRange: Touch\nComponents: V, S\nDuration: Instantaneous\n\nLightning springs from you to a creature that you try to touch. Make a melee spell attack against the target. On a hit, the target takes 1d8 Lightning damage, and it can't make Opportunity Attacks until the start of its next turn.\n\nCantrip Upgrade. The damage increases by 1d8 when you reach levels 5 (2d8), 11 (3d8), and 17 (4d8).",
      "classes": [
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/sorcerer"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/wizard"
        }
      ],
      "damage": [
        {
          "damageType": "Lightning",
          "damageRoll": {
            "expression": "1d8",
            "count": 1,
            "sides": 8
          }
        }
      ],
      "scalesWithSlotLevel": false,
      "concentration": false,
      "ritual": false
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/spells/silence",
      "@type": "Spell",
      "name": "Silence",
      "slug": "silence",
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/sources/srd-5-2-1"
      },
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Spells",
        "section": "7.312",
        "heading": "Silence",
        "lineStart": 11729,
        "lineEnd": 11738
      },
      "level": 2,
      "school": "Illusion",
      "classAvailability": [
        "Bard",
        "Cleric",
        "Ranger"
      ],
      "castingTime": "Action or Ritual",
      "range": "120 feet",
      "components": "V, S",
      "duration": "Concentration, up to 10 minutes",
      "rulesText": "Level 2 Illusion (Bard, Cleric, Ranger)\n\nCasting Time: Action or Ritual\nRange: 120 feet\nComponents: V, S\nDuration: Concentration, up to 10 minutes\n\nFor the duration, no sound can be created within or pass through a 20-foot-radius Sphere centered on a point you choose within range. Any creature or object entirely inside the Sphere has Immunity to Thunder damage, and creatures have the Deafened condition while entirely inside it. Casting a spell that includes a Verbal component is impossible there.",
      "classes": [
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/bard"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/cleric"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/ranger"
        }
      ],
      "scalesWithSlotLevel": false,
      "concentration": true,
      "ritual": true
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/spells/silent-image",
      "@type": "Spell",
      "name": "Silent Image",
      "slug": "silent-image",
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/sources/srd-5-2-1"
      },
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Spells",
        "section": "7.313",
        "heading": "Silent Image",
        "lineStart": 11740,
        "lineEnd": 11753
      },
      "level": 1,
      "school": "Illusion",
      "classAvailability": [
        "Bard",
        "Sorcerer",
        "Wizard"
      ],
      "castingTime": "Action",
      "range": "60 feet",
      "components": "V, S, M (a bit of fleece)",
      "duration": "Concentration, up to 10 minutes",
      "rulesText": "Level 1 Illusion (Bard, Sorcerer, Wizard)\n\nCasting Time: Action\nRange: 60 feet\nComponents: V, S, M (a bit of fleece)\nDuration: Concentration, up to 10 minutes\n\nYou create the image of an object, a creature, or some other visible phenomenon that is no larger than a 15-foot Cube. The image appears at a spot within range and lasts for the duration. The image is purely visual; it isn't accompanied by sound, smell, or other sensory effects.\n\nAs a Magic action, you can cause the image to move to any spot within range. As the image changes location, you can alter its appearance so that its movements appear natural for the image. For example, if you create an image of a creature and move it, you can alter the image so that it appears to be walking.\n\nPhysical interaction with the image reveals it to be an illusion, since things can pass through it. A creature that takes a Study action to examine the image can determine that it is an illusion with a successful Intelligence (Investigation) check against your spell save DC. If a creature discerns the illusion for what it is, the creature can see through the image.",
      "classes": [
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/bard"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/sorcerer"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/wizard"
        }
      ],
      "scalesWithSlotLevel": false,
      "concentration": true,
      "ritual": false
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/spells/simulacrum",
      "@type": "Spell",
      "name": "Simulacrum",
      "slug": "simulacrum",
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/sources/srd-5-2-1"
      },
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Spells",
        "section": "7.314",
        "heading": "Simulacrum",
        "lineStart": 11755,
        "lineEnd": 11770
      },
      "level": 7,
      "school": "Illusion",
      "classAvailability": [
        "Wizard"
      ],
      "castingTime": "12 hours",
      "range": "Touch",
      "components": "V, S, M (powdered ruby worth 1,500+ GP, which the spell consumes)",
      "duration": "Until dispelled",
      "rulesText": "Level 7 Illusion (Wizard)\n\nCasting Time: 12 hours\nRange: Touch\nComponents: V, S, M (powdered ruby worth 1,500+ GP, which the spell consumes)\nDuration: Until dispelled\n\nYou create a simulacrum of one Beast or Humanoid that is within 10 feet of you for the entire casting of the spell. You finish the casting by touching both the creature and a pile of ice or snow that is the same size as that creature, and the pile turns into the simulacrum, which is a creature. It uses the game statistics of the original creature at the time of casting, except it is a Construct, its Hit Point maximum is half as much, and it can't cast this spell.\n\nThe simulacrum is Friendly to you and creatures you designate. It obeys your commands and acts on your turn in combat. The simulacrum can't gain levels, and it can't take Short or Long Rests.\n\nIf the simulacrum takes damage, the only way to restore its Hit Points is to repair it as you take a Long Rest, during which you expend components worth 100 GP per Hit Point restored. The simulacrum must stay within 5 feet of you for the repair.\n\nThe simulacrum lasts until it drops to 0 Hit Points, at which point it reverts to snow and melts away. If you cast this spell again, any simulacrum you created with this spell is instantly destroyed.",
      "classes": [
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/wizard"
        }
      ],
      "scalesWithSlotLevel": false,
      "concentration": false,
      "ritual": false
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/spells/sleep",
      "@type": "Spell",
      "name": "Sleep",
      "slug": "sleep",
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/sources/srd-5-2-1"
      },
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Spells",
        "section": "7.315",
        "heading": "Sleep",
        "lineStart": 11772,
        "lineEnd": 11783
      },
      "level": 1,
      "school": "Enchantment",
      "classAvailability": [
        "Bard",
        "Sorcerer",
        "Wizard"
      ],
      "castingTime": "Action",
      "range": "60 feet",
      "components": "V, S, M (a pinch of sand or rose petals)",
      "duration": "Concentration, up to 1 minute",
      "rulesText": "Level 1 Enchantment (Bard, Sorcerer, Wizard)\n\nCasting Time: Action\nRange: 60 feet\nComponents: V, S, M (a pinch of sand or rose petals)\nDuration: Concentration, up to 1 minute\n\nEach creature of your choice in a 5-foot-radius Sphere centered on a point within range must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw or have the Incapacitated condition until the end of its next turn, at which point it must repeat the save. If the target fails the second save, the target has the Unconscious condition for the duration. The spell ends on a target if it takes damage or someone within 5 feet of it takes an action to shake it out of the spell's effect.\n\nCreatures that don't sleep, such as elves, or that have Immunity to the Exhaustion condition automatically succeed on saves against this spell.",
      "classes": [
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/bard"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/sorcerer"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/wizard"
        }
      ],
      "savingThrowAbility": "Wisdom",
      "scalesWithSlotLevel": false,
      "concentration": true,
      "ritual": false
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/spells/sleet-storm",
      "@type": "Spell",
      "name": "Sleet Storm",
      "slug": "sleet-storm",
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/sources/srd-5-2-1"
      },
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Spells",
        "section": "7.316",
        "heading": "Sleet Storm",
        "lineStart": 11785,
        "lineEnd": 11796
      },
      "level": 3,
      "school": "Conjuration",
      "classAvailability": [
        "Druid",
        "Sorcerer",
        "Wizard"
      ],
      "castingTime": "Action",
      "range": "150 feet",
      "components": "V, S, M (a miniature umbrella)",
      "duration": "Concentration, up to 1 minute",
      "rulesText": "Level 3 Conjuration (Druid, Sorcerer, Wizard)\n\nCasting Time: Action\nRange: 150 feet\nComponents: V, S, M (a miniature umbrella)\nDuration: Concentration, up to 1 minute\n\nUntil the spell ends, sleet falls in a 40-foot-tall, 20-foot-radius Cylinder centered on a point you choose within range. The area is Heavily Obscured, and exposed flames in the area are doused.\n\nGround in the Cylinder is Difficult Terrain. When a creature enters the Cylinder for the first time on a turn or starts its turn there, it must succeed on a Dexterity saving throw or have the Prone condition and lose Concentration.",
      "classes": [
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/druid"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/sorcerer"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/wizard"
        }
      ],
      "savingThrowAbility": "Dexterity",
      "scalesWithSlotLevel": false,
      "concentration": true,
      "ritual": false
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/spells/slow",
      "@type": "Spell",
      "name": "Slow",
      "slug": "slow",
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/sources/srd-5-2-1"
      },
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Spells",
        "section": "7.317",
        "heading": "Slow",
        "lineStart": 11798,
        "lineEnd": 11811
      },
      "level": 3,
      "school": "Transmutation",
      "classAvailability": [
        "Bard",
        "Sorcerer",
        "Wizard"
      ],
      "castingTime": "Action",
      "range": "120 feet",
      "components": "V, S, M (a drop of molasses)",
      "duration": "Concentration, up to 1 minute",
      "rulesText": "Level 3 Transmutation (Bard, Sorcerer, Wizard)\n\nCasting Time: Action\nRange: 120 feet\nComponents: V, S, M (a drop of molasses)\nDuration: Concentration, up to 1 minute\n\nYou alter time around up to six creatures of your choice in a 40-foot Cube within range. Each target must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw or be affected by this spell for the duration.\n\nAn affected target's Speed is halved, it takes a -2 penalty to AC and Dexterity saving throws, and it can't take Reactions. On its turns, it can take either an action or a Bonus Action, not both, and it can make only one attack if it takes the Attack action. If it casts a spell with a Somatic component, there is a 25 percent chance the spell fails as a result of the target making the spell's gestures too slowly.\n\nAn affected target repeats the save at the end of each of its turns, ending the spell on itself on a success.",
      "classes": [
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/bard"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/sorcerer"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/wizard"
        }
      ],
      "savingThrowAbility": "Wisdom",
      "scalesWithSlotLevel": false,
      "concentration": true,
      "ritual": false
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/spells/sorcerous-burst",
      "@type": "Spell",
      "name": "Sorcerous Burst",
      "slug": "sorcerous-burst",
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/sources/srd-5-2-1"
      },
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Spells",
        "section": "7.318",
        "heading": "Sorcerous Burst",
        "lineStart": 11813,
        "lineEnd": 11826
      },
      "level": 0,
      "school": "Evocation",
      "classAvailability": [
        "Sorcerer"
      ],
      "castingTime": "Action",
      "range": "120 feet",
      "components": "V, S",
      "duration": "Instantaneous",
      "rulesText": "Evocation Cantrip (Sorcerer)\n\nCasting Time: Action\nRange: 120 feet\nComponents: V, S\nDuration: Instantaneous\n\nYou cast sorcerous energy at one creature or object within range. Make a ranged spell attack against the target. On a hit, the target takes 1d8 damage of a type you choose: Acid, Cold, Fire, Lightning, Poison, Psychic, or Thunder.\n\nIf you roll an 8 on a d8 for this spell, you can roll another d8, and add it to the damage. When you cast this spell, the maximum number of these d8s you can add to the spell's damage equals your spellcasting ability modifier.\n\nCantrip Upgrade. The damage increases by 1d8 when you reach levels 5 (2d8), 11 (3d8), and 17 (4d8).",
      "classes": [
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/sorcerer"
        }
      ],
      "scalesWithSlotLevel": false,
      "concentration": false,
      "ritual": false
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/spells/spare-the-dying",
      "@type": "Spell",
      "name": "Spare the Dying",
      "slug": "spare-the-dying",
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/sources/srd-5-2-1"
      },
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Spells",
        "section": "7.319",
        "heading": "Spare the Dying",
        "lineStart": 11828,
        "lineEnd": 11839
      },
      "level": 0,
      "school": "Necromancy",
      "classAvailability": [
        "Cleric",
        "Druid"
      ],
      "castingTime": "Action",
      "range": "15 feet",
      "components": "V, S",
      "duration": "Instantaneous",
      "rulesText": "Necromancy Cantrip (Cleric, Druid)\n\nCasting Time: Action\nRange: 15 feet\nComponents: V, S\nDuration: Instantaneous\n\nChoose a creature within range that has 0 Hit Points and isn't dead. The creature becomes Stable.\n\nCantrip Upgrade. The range doubles when you reach levels 5 (30 feet), 11 (60 feet), and 17 (120 feet).",
      "classes": [
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/cleric"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/druid"
        }
      ],
      "scalesWithSlotLevel": false,
      "concentration": false,
      "ritual": false
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/spells/speak-with-animals",
      "@type": "Spell",
      "name": "Speak with Animals",
      "slug": "speak-with-animals",
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/sources/srd-5-2-1"
      },
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Spells",
        "section": "7.320",
        "heading": "Speak with Animals",
        "lineStart": 11841,
        "lineEnd": 11852
      },
      "level": 1,
      "school": "Divination",
      "classAvailability": [
        "Bard",
        "Druid",
        "Ranger",
        "Warlock"
      ],
      "castingTime": "Action or Ritual",
      "range": "Self",
      "components": "V, S",
      "duration": "10 minutes",
      "rulesText": "Level 1 Divination (Bard, Druid, Ranger, Warlock)\n\nCasting Time: Action or Ritual\nRange: Self\nComponents: V, S\nDuration: 10 minutes\n\nFor the duration, you can comprehend and verbally communicate with Beasts, and you can use any of the Influence action's skill options with them.\n\nMost Beasts have little to say about topics that don't pertain to survival or companionship, but at minimum, a Beast can give you information about nearby locations and monsters, including whatever it has perceived within the past day.",
      "classes": [
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/bard"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/druid"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/ranger"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/warlock"
        }
      ],
      "scalesWithSlotLevel": false,
      "concentration": false,
      "ritual": true
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/spells/speak-with-dead",
      "@type": "Spell",
      "name": "Speak with Dead",
      "slug": "speak-with-dead",
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/sources/srd-5-2-1"
      },
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Spells",
        "section": "7.321",
        "heading": "Speak with Dead",
        "lineStart": 11854,
        "lineEnd": 11865
      },
      "level": 3,
      "school": "Necromancy",
      "classAvailability": [
        "Bard",
        "Cleric",
        "Wizard"
      ],
      "castingTime": "Action",
      "range": "10 feet",
      "components": "V, S, M (burning incense)",
      "duration": "10 minutes",
      "rulesText": "Level 3 Necromancy (Bard, Cleric, Wizard)\n\nCasting Time: Action\nRange: 10 feet\nComponents: V, S, M (burning incense)\nDuration: 10 minutes\n\nYou grant the semblance of life to a corpse of your choice within range, allowing it to answer questions you pose. The corpse must have a mouth, and this spell fails if the deceased creature was Undead when it died. The spell also fails if the corpse was the target of this spell within the past 10 days.\n\nUntil the spell ends, you can ask the corpse up to five questions. The corpse knows only what it knew in life, including the languages it knew. Answers are usually brief, cryptic, or repetitive, and the corpse is under no compulsion to offer a truthful answer if you are antagonistic toward it or it recognizes you as an enemy. This spell doesn't return the creature's soul to its body, only its animating spirit. Thus, the corpse can't learn new information, doesn't comprehend anything that has happened since it died, and can't speculate about future events.",
      "classes": [
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/bard"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/cleric"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/wizard"
        }
      ],
      "scalesWithSlotLevel": false,
      "concentration": false,
      "ritual": false
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/spells/speak-with-plants",
      "@type": "Spell",
      "name": "Speak with Plants",
      "slug": "speak-with-plants",
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/sources/srd-5-2-1"
      },
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Spells",
        "section": "7.322",
        "heading": "Speak with Plants",
        "lineStart": 11867,
        "lineEnd": 11884
      },
      "level": 3,
      "school": "Transmutation",
      "classAvailability": [
        "Bard",
        "Druid",
        "Ranger"
      ],
      "castingTime": "Action",
      "range": "Self",
      "components": "V, S",
      "duration": "10 minutes",
      "rulesText": "Level 3 Transmutation (Bard, Druid, Ranger)\n\nCasting Time: Action\nRange: Self\nComponents: V, S\nDuration: 10 minutes\n\nYou imbue plants in an immobile 30-foot Emanation with limited sentience and animation, giving them the ability to communicate with you and follow your simple commands. You can question plants about events in the spell's area within the past day, gaining information about creatures that have passed, weather, and other circumstances.\n\nYou can also turn Difficult Terrain caused by plant growth (such as thickets and undergrowth) into ordinary terrain that lasts for the duration. Or you\n\ncan turn ordinary terrain where plants are present into Difficult Terrain that lasts for the duration.\n\nThe spell doesn't enable plants to uproot themselves and move about, but they can move their branches, tendrils, and stalks for you.\n\nIf a Plant creature is in the area, you can communicate with it as if you shared a common language.",
      "classes": [
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/bard"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/druid"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/ranger"
        }
      ],
      "scalesWithSlotLevel": false,
      "concentration": false,
      "ritual": false
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/spells/spider-climb",
      "@type": "Spell",
      "name": "Spider Climb",
      "slug": "spider-climb",
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/sources/srd-5-2-1"
      },
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Spells",
        "section": "7.323",
        "heading": "Spider Climb",
        "lineStart": 11886,
        "lineEnd": 11897
      },
      "level": 2,
      "school": "Transmutation",
      "classAvailability": [
        "Sorcerer",
        "Warlock",
        "Wizard"
      ],
      "castingTime": "Action",
      "range": "Touch",
      "components": "V, S, M (a drop of bitumen and a spider)",
      "duration": "Concentration, up to 1 hour",
      "rulesText": "Level 2 Transmutation (Sorcerer, Warlock, Wizard)\n\nCasting Time: Action\nRange: Touch\nComponents: V, S, M (a drop of bitumen and a spider)\nDuration: Concentration, up to 1 hour\n\nUntil the spell ends, one willing creature you touch gains the ability to move up, down, and across vertical surfaces and along ceilings, while leaving its hands free. The target also gains a Climb Speed equal to its Speed.\n\nUsing a Higher-Level Spell Slot. You can target one additional creature for each spell slot level above 2.",
      "classes": [
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/sorcerer"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/warlock"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/wizard"
        }
      ],
      "scalesWithSlotLevel": true,
      "concentration": true,
      "ritual": false
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/spells/spike-growth",
      "@type": "Spell",
      "name": "Spike Growth",
      "slug": "spike-growth",
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/sources/srd-5-2-1"
      },
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Spells",
        "section": "7.324",
        "heading": "Spike Growth",
        "lineStart": 11899,
        "lineEnd": 11910
      },
      "level": 2,
      "school": "Transmutation",
      "classAvailability": [
        "Druid",
        "Ranger"
      ],
      "castingTime": "Action",
      "range": "150 feet",
      "components": "V, S, M (seven thorns)",
      "duration": "Concentration, up to 10 minutes",
      "rulesText": "Level 2 Transmutation (Druid, Ranger)\n\nCasting Time: Action\nRange: 150 feet\nComponents: V, S, M (seven thorns)\nDuration: Concentration, up to 10 minutes\n\nThe ground in a 20-foot-radius Sphere centered on a point within range sprouts hard spikes and thorns. The area becomes Difficult Terrain for the duration. When a creature moves into or within the area, it takes 2d4 Piercing damage for every 5 feet it travels.\n\nThe transformation of the ground is camouflaged to look natural. Any creature that can't see the area when the spell is cast must take a Search action and succeed on a Wisdom (Perception or Survival) check against your spell save DC to recognize the terrain as hazardous before entering it.",
      "classes": [
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/druid"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/ranger"
        }
      ],
      "damage": [
        {
          "damageType": "Piercing",
          "damageRoll": {
            "expression": "2d4",
            "count": 2,
            "sides": 4
          }
        }
      ],
      "scalesWithSlotLevel": false,
      "concentration": true,
      "ritual": false
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/spells/spirit-guardians",
      "@type": "Spell",
      "name": "Spirit Guardians",
      "slug": "spirit-guardians",
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/sources/srd-5-2-1"
      },
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Spells",
        "section": "7.325",
        "heading": "Spirit Guardians",
        "lineStart": 11912,
        "lineEnd": 11927
      },
      "level": 3,
      "school": "Conjuration",
      "classAvailability": [
        "Cleric"
      ],
      "castingTime": "Action",
      "range": "Self",
      "components": "V, S, M (a prayer scroll)",
      "duration": "Concentration, up to 10 minutes",
      "rulesText": "Level 3 Conjuration (Cleric)\n\nCasting Time: Action\nRange: Self\nComponents: V, S, M (a prayer scroll)\nDuration: Concentration, up to 10 minutes\n\nProtective spirits flit around you in a 15-foot Emanation for the duration. If you are good or neutral, their spectral form appears angelic or fey (your choice). If you are evil, they appear fiendish.\n\nWhen you cast this spell, you can designate creatures to be unaffected by it. Any other creature's Speed is halved in the Emanation, and whenever the Emanation enters a creature's space and whenever\n\na creature enters the Emanation or ends its turn there, the creature must make a Wisdom saving throw. On a failed save, the creature takes 3d8 Radiant damage (if you are good or neutral) or 3d8 Necrotic damage (if you are evil). On a successful save, the creature takes half as much damage. A creature makes this save only once per turn.\n\nUsing a Higher-Level Spell Slot. The damage increases by 1d8 for each spell slot level above 3.",
      "classes": [
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/cleric"
        }
      ],
      "savingThrowAbility": "Wisdom",
      "damage": [
        {
          "damageType": "Radiant",
          "damageRoll": {
            "expression": "3d8",
            "count": 3,
            "sides": 8
          }
        },
        {
          "damageType": "Necrotic",
          "damageRoll": {
            "expression": "3d8",
            "count": 3,
            "sides": 8
          }
        }
      ],
      "scalesWithSlotLevel": true,
      "concentration": true,
      "ritual": false
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/spells/spiritual-weapon",
      "@type": "Spell",
      "name": "Spiritual Weapon",
      "slug": "spiritual-weapon",
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/sources/srd-5-2-1"
      },
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Spells",
        "section": "7.326",
        "heading": "Spiritual Weapon",
        "lineStart": 11929,
        "lineEnd": 11942
      },
      "level": 2,
      "school": "Evocation",
      "classAvailability": [
        "Cleric"
      ],
      "castingTime": "Bonus Action",
      "range": "60 feet",
      "components": "V, S",
      "duration": "Concentration, up to 1 minute",
      "rulesText": "Level 2 Evocation (Cleric)\n\nCasting Time: Bonus Action\nRange: 60 feet\nComponents: V, S\nDuration: Concentration, up to 1 minute\n\nYou create a floating, spectral force that resembles a weapon of your choice and lasts for the duration. The force appears within range in a space of your choice, and you can immediately make one melee spell attack against one creature within 5 feet of the force. On a hit, the target takes Force damage equal to 1d8 plus your spellcasting ability modifier.\n\nAs a Bonus Action on your later turns, you can move the force up to 20 feet and repeat the attack against a creature within 5 feet of it.\n\nUsing a Higher-Level Spell Slot. The damage increases by 1d8 for every slot level above 2.",
      "classes": [
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/cleric"
        }
      ],
      "scalesWithSlotLevel": true,
      "concentration": true,
      "ritual": false
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/spells/starry-wisp",
      "@type": "Spell",
      "name": "Starry Wisp",
      "slug": "starry-wisp",
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/sources/srd-5-2-1"
      },
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Spells",
        "section": "7.327",
        "heading": "Starry Wisp",
        "lineStart": 11944,
        "lineEnd": 11955
      },
      "level": 0,
      "school": "Evocation",
      "classAvailability": [
        "Bard",
        "Druid"
      ],
      "castingTime": "Action",
      "range": "60 feet",
      "components": "V, S",
      "duration": "Instantaneous",
      "rulesText": "Evocation Cantrip (Bard, Druid)\n\nCasting Time: Action\nRange: 60 feet\nComponents: V, S\nDuration: Instantaneous\n\nYou launch a mote of light at one creature or object within range. Make a ranged spell attack against the target. On a hit, the target takes 1d8 Radiant damage, and until the end of your next turn, it emits Dim Light in a 10-foot radius and can't benefit from the Invisible condition.\n\nCantrip Upgrade. The damage increases by 1d8 when you reach levels 5 (2d8), 11 (3d8), and 17 (4d8).",
      "classes": [
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/bard"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/druid"
        }
      ],
      "damage": [
        {
          "damageType": "Radiant",
          "damageRoll": {
            "expression": "1d8",
            "count": 1,
            "sides": 8
          }
        }
      ],
      "scalesWithSlotLevel": false,
      "concentration": false,
      "ritual": false
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/spells/stinking-cloud",
      "@type": "Spell",
      "name": "Stinking Cloud",
      "slug": "stinking-cloud",
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/sources/srd-5-2-1"
      },
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Spells",
        "section": "7.328",
        "heading": "Stinking Cloud",
        "lineStart": 11957,
        "lineEnd": 11968
      },
      "level": 3,
      "school": "Conjuration",
      "classAvailability": [
        "Bard",
        "Sorcerer",
        "Wizard"
      ],
      "castingTime": "Action",
      "range": "90 feet",
      "components": "V, S, M (a rotten egg)",
      "duration": "Concentration, up to 1 minute",
      "rulesText": "Level 3 Conjuration (Bard, Sorcerer, Wizard)\n\nCasting Time: Action\nRange: 90 feet\nComponents: V, S, M (a rotten egg)\nDuration: Concentration, up to 1 minute\n\nYou create a 20-foot-radius Sphere of yellow, nauseating gas centered on a point within range. The cloud is Heavily Obscured. The cloud lingers in the air for the duration or until a strong wind (such as the one created by Gust of Wind) disperses it.\n\nEach creature that starts its turn in the Sphere must succeed on a Constitution saving throw or have the Poisoned condition until the end of the current turn. While Poisoned in this way, the creature can't take an action or a Bonus Action.",
      "classes": [
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/bard"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/sorcerer"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/wizard"
        }
      ],
      "savingThrowAbility": "Constitution",
      "scalesWithSlotLevel": false,
      "concentration": true,
      "ritual": false
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/spells/stone-shape",
      "@type": "Spell",
      "name": "Stone Shape",
      "slug": "stone-shape",
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/sources/srd-5-2-1"
      },
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Spells",
        "section": "7.329",
        "heading": "Stone Shape",
        "lineStart": 11970,
        "lineEnd": 11979
      },
      "level": 4,
      "school": "Transmutation",
      "classAvailability": [
        "Cleric",
        "Druid",
        "Wizard"
      ],
      "castingTime": "Action",
      "range": "Touch",
      "components": "V, S, M (soft clay)",
      "duration": "Instantaneous",
      "rulesText": "Level 4 Transmutation (Cleric, Druid, Wizard)\n\nCasting Time: Action\nRange: Touch\nComponents: V, S, M (soft clay)\nDuration: Instantaneous\n\nYou touch a stone object of Medium size or smaller or a section of stone no more than 5 feet in any dimension and form it into any shape you like. For example, you could shape a large rock into a weapon, statue, or coffer, or you could make a small passage through a wall that is 5 feet thick. You could also shape a stone door or its frame to seal the door shut. The object you create can have up to two hinges and a latch, but finer mechanical detail isn't possible.",
      "classes": [
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/cleric"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/druid"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/wizard"
        }
      ],
      "scalesWithSlotLevel": false,
      "concentration": false,
      "ritual": false
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/spells/stoneskin",
      "@type": "Spell",
      "name": "Stoneskin",
      "slug": "stoneskin",
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/sources/srd-5-2-1"
      },
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Spells",
        "section": "7.330",
        "heading": "Stoneskin",
        "lineStart": 11981,
        "lineEnd": 11990
      },
      "level": 4,
      "school": "Transmutation",
      "classAvailability": [
        "Druid",
        "Ranger",
        "Sorcerer",
        "Wizard"
      ],
      "castingTime": "Action",
      "range": "Touch",
      "components": "V, S, M (diamond dust worth 100+ GP, which the spell consumes)",
      "duration": "Concentration, up to 1 hour",
      "rulesText": "Level 4 Transmutation (Druid, Ranger, Sorcerer, Wizard)\n\nCasting Time: Action\nRange: Touch\nComponents: V, S, M (diamond dust worth 100+ GP, which the spell consumes)\nDuration: Concentration, up to 1 hour\n\nUntil the spell ends, one willing creature you touch has Resistance to Bludgeoning, Piercing, and Slashing damage.",
      "classes": [
        {
          "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/classes/druid"
        },
