    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/tables/10-105-efreeti-bottle-table-1",
      "@type": "Table",
      "name": "Efreeti Bottle Table 1",
      "slug": "10-105-efreeti-bottle-table-1",
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/sources/srd-5-2-1"
      },
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Magic Items",
        "section": "10.105",
        "heading": "Efreeti Bottle",
        "lineStart": 15626,
        "lineEnd": 15630
      },
      "columns": [
        "1d10",
        "Effect"
      ],
      "rows": [
        {
          "position": 1,
          "cells": [
            {
              "value": "1"
            },
            {
              "value": "The efreeti attacks you. After fighting for 5 rounds, the efreeti disappears, and the bottle loses its magic."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "position": 2,
          "cells": [
            {
              "value": "2–9"
            },
            {
              "value": "The efreeti understands your languages and obeys your commands for 1 hour, after which it returns to the bottle, and a new stopper contains it. The stopper can’t be removed for 24 hours. The next two times the bottle is opened, the same effect occurs. If the bottle is opened a fourth time, the efreeti escapes and disappears, and the bottle loses its magic."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "position": 3,
          "cells": [
            {
              "value": "10"
            },
            {
              "value": "The efreeti understands your languages and can cast Wish once for you. It disappears when it grants the wish or after 1 hour, and the bottle loses its magic."
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "rawText": "| 1d10 | Effect                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 |\n| :--- | :--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 1    | The efreeti attacks you. After fighting for 5 rounds, the efreeti disappears, and the bottle loses its magic.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          |\n| 2–9  | The efreeti understands your languages and obeys your commands for 1 hour, after which it returns to the bottle, and a new stopper contains it. The stopper can’t be removed for 24 hours. The next two times the bottle is opened, the same effect occurs. If the bottle is opened a fourth time, the efreeti escapes and disappears, and the bottle loses its magic. |\n| 10   | The efreeti understands your languages and can cast Wish once for you. It disappears when it grants the wish or after 1 hour, and the bottle loses its magic.                                                                                                                                                                                                          |"
    },
