      "rawText": "| 1d4 | Senses                                      |\n| :--- | :------------------------------------------ |\n| 1   | Hearing and standard vision out to 30 feet  |\n| 2   | Hearing and standard vision out to 60 feet  |\n| 3   | Hearing and standard vision out to 120 feet |\n| 4   | Hearing and Darkvision out to 120 feet      |"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/tables/10-34-sentient-items-special-purpose",
      "@type": "Table",
      "name": "Sentient Item's Special Purpose",
      "slug": "10-34-sentient-items-special-purpose",
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/graph20/objects/sources/srd-5-2-1"
      },
      "sourceLocator": {
        "chapter": "Magic Items",
        "section": "10.34",
        "heading": "Special Purpose",
        "lineStart": 14835,
        "lineEnd": 14846
      },
      "columns": [
        "1d10",
        "Special Purpose"
      ],
      "rows": [
        {
          "position": 1,
          "cells": [
            {
              "value": "1"
            },
            {
              "value": "Aligned. The item seeks to defeat or destroy those of a diametrically opposed alignment.Such an item is never Neutral."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "position": 2,
          "cells": [
            {
              "value": "2"
            },
            {
              "value": "Bane. The item seeks to thwart or destroy creatures of a particular type, such as Constructs, Fiends, or Undead."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "position": 3,
          "cells": [
            {
              "value": "3"
            },
            {
              "value": "Creator Seeker. The item seeks its creator and wants to understand why it was created."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "position": 4,
          "cells": [
            {
              "value": "4"
            },
            {
              "value": "Destiny Seeker. The item believes it and its bearer have key roles to play in future events."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "position": 5,
          "cells": [
            {
              "value": "5"
            },
            {
              "value": "Destroyer. The item craves destruction and goads its user to fight arbitrarily."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "position": 6,
          "cells": [
            {
              "value": "6"
            },
            {
              "value": "Glory Seeker. The item seeks renown as the greatest magic item in the world by winning fame or notoriety for its user."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "position": 7,
          "cells": [
            {
              "value": "7"
            },
            {
              "value": "Lore Seeker. The item craves knowledge or is determined to solve a mystery, learn a secret, or unravel a cryptic prophecy."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "position": 8,
          "cells": [
            {
              "value": "8"
            },
            {
              "value": "Protector. The item seeks to defend a particular kind of creature, such as elves or werewolves."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "position": 9,
          "cells": [
            {
              "value": "9"
            },
            {
              "value": "Soulmate Seeker. The item seeks another sentient magic item, perhaps one that is similar to itself."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "position": 10,
          "cells": [
            {
              "value": "10"
            },
            {
              "value": "Templar. The item seeks to defend the servants and interests of a particular deity."
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "rawText": "| 1d10 | Special Purpose                                                                                                            |\n| :--- | :------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 1    | Aligned. The item seeks to defeat or destroy those of a diametrically opposed alignment.Such an item is never Neutral.     |\n| 2    | Bane. The item seeks to thwart or destroy creatures of a particular type, such as Constructs, Fiends, or Undead.           |\n| 3    | Creator Seeker. The item seeks its creator and wants to understand why it was created.                                     |\n| 4    | Destiny Seeker. The item believes it and its bearer have key roles to play in future events.                               |\n| 5    | Destroyer. The item craves destruction and goads its user to fight arbitrarily.                                            |\n| 6    | Glory Seeker. The item seeks renown as the greatest magic item in the world by winning fame or notoriety for its user.     |\n| 7    | Lore Seeker. The item craves knowledge or is determined to solve a mystery, learn a secret, or unravel a cryptic prophecy. |\n| 8    | Protector. The item seeks to defend a particular kind of creature, such as elves or werewolves.                            |\n| 9    | Soulmate Seeker. The item seeks another sentient magic item, perhaps one that is similar to itself.                        |\n| 10   | Templar. The item seeks to defend the servants and interests of a particular deity.                                        |"
    },
